#: src/core/main.c:251
msgid ""
"NetworkManager monitors all network connections and automatically\n"
"chooses the best connection to use.  It also allows the user to\n"
"specify wireless access points which wireless cards in the computer\n"
"should associate with."
msgstr ""
"NetwerkBestuurder moniteer alle netwerk verbindings en outomaties\n"
"kies die beste konneksie om te gebruik.  Dit laat die gebruiker ook toe om\n"
"spesifiseer draadlose toegangspunte watter draadlose kaarte in die rekenaar\n"
"behoort te assosieer met."

