#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:4799
msgid ""
"nmcli can accepts both direct JSON configuration data and a file name "
"containing the configuration. In the latter case the file is read and the "
"contents is put into this property.\n"
"\n"
"Examples: set team.config { \"device\": \"team0\", \"runner\": {\"name\": "
"\"roundrobin\"}, \"ports\": {\"eth1\": {}, \"eth2\": {}} }\n"
"          set team.config /etc/my-team.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"nmcli kan aanvaar beide direk JSON konfigurasie data en 'n lêer naam wat die "
"konfigurasie. In  laasgenoemde geval word die lêer gelees en die inhoud word "
"in hierdie eiendom geplaas.\n"
"\n"
"Voorbeelde: set team.config { \"device\": \"team0\", \"runner\": {\"name\": "
"\"roundrobin\"}, \"ports\": {\"eth1\": {}, \"eth2\": {}} }\n"
"          stel team.config /etc/my-team.conf\n"

#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:4807
msgid ""
"Enter a list of link watchers formatted as dictionaries where the keys are "
"teamd properties. Dictionary pairs are in the form: key=value and pairs are "
"separated by ' '. Dictionaries are separated with ','.\n"
"The keys allowed/required in the dictionary change on the basis of the link "
"watcher type, while the only property common to all the link watchers is  "
"'name'*, which defines the link watcher to be specified.\n"
"\n"
"Properties available for the 'ethtool' link watcher:\n"
"  'delay-up', 'delay-down'\n"
"\n"
"Properties available for the 'nsna_ping' link watcher:\n"
"  'init-wait', 'interval', 'missed-max', 'target-host'*\n"
"\n"
"Properties available for the 'arp_ping' include all the ones for 'nsna_ping' "
"and:\n"
"  'source-host'*, 'validate-active', 'validate-inactive', 'send-always'.\n"
"\n"
"Properties flagged with a '*' are mandatory.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"   name=arp_ping source-host=172.16.1.1 target-host=172.16.1.254, "
"name=ethtool delay-up=3\n"
msgstr ""
"Ingaan 'n lys van skakel kykers geformateer as woordeboeke waar die sleutels "
"is teamd eiendomme. Woordeboek pare is in die vorm: key=value en pare word "
"geskei deur ' '. Woordeboeke word geskei met ','.\n"
"Die sleutels wat in die woordeboek toegelaat/vereis word verander op grond "
"van die skakel kyker tipe, terwyl die enigste eiendom wat gemeen is aan al "
"die skakelkykers is  'name'*, wat die skakel kyker definieer wat "
"gespesifiseer moet word.\n"
"\n"
"Eiendomme beskikbaar vir die 'ethtool' skakel kyker:\n"
"  'delay-up', 'delay-down'\n"
"\n"
"Eiendomme beskikbaar vir die 'nsna_ping' skakel kyker:\n"
"  'init-wait', 'interval', 'missed-max', 'target-host'*\n"
"\n"
"Eiendomme beskikbaar vir die 'arp_ping' sluit al die een vir 'nsna_ping' "
"en:\n"
"  'source-host'*, 'validate-active', 'validate-inactive', 'send-always'.\n"
"\n"
"Eiendomme gevlag met 'n '*' verpligtend is.\n"
"\n"
"Voorbeeld:\n"
"   name=arp_ping source-host=172.16.1.1 target-host=172.16.1.254, "
"name=ethtool delay-up=3\n"

#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:4856
msgid "IEEE 802.15.4 (WPAN) parent device or connection UUID"
msgstr "IEEE 802.15.4 (WPAN) ouer toestel of verbinding UUID"

#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:4892
msgid ""
"Enter file path to CA certificate (optionally prefixed with file://).\n"
"  [file://]<file path>\n"
"Note that nmcli does not support specifying certificates as raw blob data.\n"
"Example: /home/cimrman/cacert.crt\n"
msgstr ""
"Ingaan lêer pad na CA sertifikaat (opsioneel voorvoegsel met lêer://).\n"
"  [file://]<file path>\n"
