"which this 6LowPAN interface should be created."
msgstr ""
"Indien gegee, spesifiseer die ouer koppelvlaknaam of ouerverbinding UUID "
"waaruit hierdie 6LowPAN koppelvlak geskep moet word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:250
msgid "Channel on which the mesh network to join is located."
msgstr "Kanaal waarop die mesh netwerk om aan te sluit is geleë."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:251
msgid ""
"Anycast DHCP MAC address used when requesting an IP address via DHCP. The "
"specific anycast address used determines which DHCP server class answers the "
"request. This is currently only implemented by dhclient DHCP plugin."
msgstr ""
"Anycast DHCP MAC adres wat gebruik word wanneer 'n IP adres via DHCP versoek "
"word. Die spesifieke anycast-adres wat gebruik word, bepaal watter DHCP "
"bediener klas die versoek beantwoord. Dit word tans slegs deur dhclient DHCP "
"inprop geïmplementeer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:252
msgid "SSID of the mesh network to join."
msgstr "SSID van die maasnetwerk om aan te sluit."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:396
msgid ""
"Configures AP isolation, which prevents communication between wireless "
"devices connected to this AP. This property can be set to a value different "
"from NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1) only when the interface is configured in AP "
"mode. If set to NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1), devices are not able to communicate "
"with each other. This increases security because it protects devices against "
"attacks from other clients in the network. At the same time, it prevents "
"devices to access resources on the same wireless networks as file shares, "
"printers, etc. If set to NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0), devices can talk to each "
"other. When set to NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1), the global default is used; in "
"case the global default is unspecified it is assumed to be NM_TERNARY_FALSE "
"(0)."
msgstr ""
"Konfigureer AP isolasie, wat kommunikasie tussen draadlose toestelle "
"verhinder gekoppel aan hierdie AP. Hierdie eiendom kan op 'n waarde gestel "
"word verskil vanaf NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1) slegs wanneer die koppelvlak in "
"AP modus opgestel is. Indien gestel op NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1), toestelle kan "
"nie met mekaar kommunikeer nie. Dit verhoog sekuriteit omdat dit toestelle "
"teen aanvalle beskerm vanaf ander kliente in die netwerk. Op dieselfde tyd, "
"dit verhoed toestelle om toegang te verkry tot hulpbronne op dieselfde "
"draadlose netwerke as lêer delings, drukkers, ens. Indien gestel op "
"NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0), toestelle kan met mekaar praat. Wanneer ingestel op "
"NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1), die globale verstek word gebruik; ingeval die "
"globale verstek is ongespesifiseer word dit veronderstel om te wees "
"NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:397
msgid ""
"802.11 frequency band of the network.  One of \"a\" for 5GHz 802.11a or "
"\"bg\" for 2.4GHz 802.11.  This will lock associations to the Wi-Fi network "
"to the specific band, i.e. if \"a\" is specified, the device will not "
"associate with the same network in the 2.4GHz band even if the network's "
"settings are compatible.  This setting depends on specific driver capability "
"and may not work with all drivers."
msgstr ""
"802.11 frekwensie band van die netwerk.  Een van \"a\" vir 5GHz 802.11a of "
"\"bg\" vir 2.4GHz 802.11.  Dit sal assosiasies met die Wi-Fi netwerk aan die "
"spesifieke band sluit, d.w.s. indien \"a\" word gespesifiseer, die toestel "
"sal nie assosieer met dieselfde netwerk in die 2.4GHz band selfs al is die "
"netwerk se instellings versoenbaar.  Hierdie instelling hang af van "
"spesifieke drywer vermoë en sal dalk nie met alle drywer werk nie."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:8
msgid ""
"If specified, directs the device to only associate with the given access "
"point.  This capability is highly driver dependent and not supported by all "
"devices.  Note: this property does not control the BSSID used when creating "
"an Ad-Hoc network and is unlikely to in the future."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:399
msgid ""
"Wireless channel to use for the Wi-Fi connection.  The device will only join "
"(or create for Ad-Hoc networks) a Wi-Fi network on the specified channel.  "
"Because channel numbers overlap between bands, this property also requires "
"the \"band\" property to be set."
msgstr ""
"Draadlose kanaal om te gebruik vir die Wi-Fi verbinding. Die toestel sal "
"slegs by 'n Wi-Fi netwerk op die gespesifiseerde kanaal aansluit (of vir Ad-"
"Hoc netwerke skep). Omdat kanaal nommers tussen bande oorvleuel, vereis "
"hierdie eiendom ook dat die \"band\" eiendom gestel word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:400
msgid ""
"If specified, request that the device use this MAC address instead. This is "
"known as MAC cloning or spoofing. Beside explicitly specifying a MAC "
"address, the special values \"preserve\", \"permanent\", \"random\" and "
"\"stable\" are supported. \"preserve\" means not to touch the MAC address on "
"activation. \"permanent\" means to use the permanent hardware address of the "
"device. \"random\" creates a random MAC address on each connect. \"stable\" "
"creates a hashed MAC address based on connection.stable-id and a machine "
"dependent key. If unspecified, the value can be overwritten via global "
"defaults, see manual of NetworkManager.conf. If still unspecified, it "
"defaults to \"preserve\" (older versions of NetworkManager may use a "
"different default value). On D-Bus, this field is expressed as \"assigned-"
"mac-address\" or the deprecated \"cloned-mac-address\"."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, versoek dat die toestel eerder hierdie MAC adres "
"gebruik. Dit staan bekend as MAC kloning of spoofing. Behalwe om 'n MAC "
"adres uitdruklik te spesifiseer, die spesiale waardes \"preserve\", "
"\"permanent\", \"random\" en \"stable\" word ondersteun. \"preserve\" "
"beteken om nie aan die MAC-adres te raak tydens aktivering nie. "
"\"permanent\" beteken om die permanente hardeware-adres van die toestel te "
"gebruik. \"random\" skep 'n ewekansige MAC adres op elke verbinding. "
"\"stable\" skep 'n hashed MAC-adres gebaseer op connection.stable-id en 'n "
"masjien afhanklike sleutel. Indien nie gespesifiseer nie, kan die waarde "
"oorgeskryf word via globale verstekke, sien handleiding van "
"NetworkManager.conf. Indien dit steeds ongespesifiseer is, word dit verstek "
"\"preserve\" (ouer weergawes van NetwerkBestuurder kan 'n ander "
"verstekwaarde gebruik). Op D-Bus, hierdie veld word uitgedruk as \"assigned-"
"mac-address\" of die deprecated \"cloned-mac-address\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:377
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:401
msgid ""
"With \"cloned-mac-address\" setting \"random\" or \"stable\", by default all "
"bits of the MAC address are scrambled and a locally-administered, unicast "
"MAC address is created. This property allows to specify that certain bits "
"are fixed. Note that the least significant bit of the first MAC address will "
"always be unset to create a unicast MAC address. If the property is NULL, it "
"is eligible to be overwritten by a default connection setting. If the value "
"is still NULL or an empty string, the default is to create a locally-"
"administered, unicast MAC address. If the value contains one MAC address, "
"this address is used as mask. The set bits of the mask are to be filled with "
"the current MAC address of the device, while the unset bits are subject to "
"randomization. Setting \"FE:FF:FF:00:00:00\" means to preserve the OUI of "
"the current MAC address and only randomize the lower 3 bytes using the "
"\"random\" or \"stable\" algorithm. If the value contains one additional MAC "
"address after the mask, this address is used instead of the current MAC "
"address to fill the bits that shall not be randomized. For example, a value "
"of \"FE:FF:FF:00:00:00 68:F7:28:00:00:00\" will set the OUI of the MAC "
"address to 68:F7:28, while the lower bits are randomized. A value of "
"\"02:00:00:00:00:00 00:00:00:00:00:00\" will create a fully scrambled "
"globally-administered, burned-in MAC address. If the value contains more "
"than one additional MAC addresses, one of them is chosen randomly. For "
"example, \"02:00:00:00:00:00 00:00:00:00:00:00 02:00:00:00:00:00\" will "
"create a fully scrambled MAC address, randomly locally or globally "
"administered."
msgstr ""
"Met \"cloned-mac-address\" instelling \"random\" of \"stable\", by verstek "
"alle stukkies van die MAC adres is deurmekaar en 'n plaaslik-geadministreer, "
"unicast MAC address is geskep. Hierdie eienskap laat toe om te spesifiseer "
"dat sekere bisse vasgestel is. Let daarop dat die minste beduidende deel van "
"die eerste MAC adres sal altyd wees unset om 'n te skep unicast MAC adres. "
"Indien die eiendom is NULL, dit kom in aanmerking om deur 'n verstek "
"verbinding instelling oorgeskryf te word. As die waarde nog steeds NULL of  "
"'n leë toutjie, die verstek is om 'n plaaslik-geadministreerde, unicast MAC "
"adres. As die waarde een MAC-adres bevat, word hierdie adres as masker "
"gebruik. Die stel stukkies van die masker moet gevul word met die huidige "
"MAC-adres van die toestel, terwyl die unset stukkies is onderhewig aan "
"ewekansigheid. Instelling \"FE:FF:FF:00:00:00\" beteken om die OUI van die "
"huidige MAC adres te bewaar en slegs die onderste 3 grepe ewekansig te maak "
"deur die \"random\" of \"stable\" algoritme. As die waarde een bykomende MAC-"
"adres na die masker bevat, word hierdie adres in plaas van die huidige MAC "
"adres gebruik om die stukkies te vul wat nie ewekansig gemaak sal word nie. "
"Byvoorbeeld, 'n waarde van \"FE:FF:FF:00:00:00 68:F7:28:00:00:00\" sal die "
"OUI van die MAC adres stel na 68:F7:28, terwyl die onderste stukkies "
"ewekansig is. 'n Waarde van \"02:00:00:00:00:00 00:00:00:00:00:00\" sal 'n "
"volledig deurmekaar, wêreldwyd-geadministreerde, ingebrande MAC adres. As "
"die waarde meer as een bykomende MAC-adresse bevat, word een van hulle "
"lukraak gekies. Byvoorbeeld, \"02:00:00:00:00:00 00:00:00:00:00:00 "
"02:00:00:00:00:00\" sal 'n volledig deurmekaar MAC-adres skep, lukraak "
"plaaslik of wêreldwyd geadministreer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:402
msgid ""
"If TRUE, indicates that the network is a non-broadcasting network that hides "
"its SSID. This works both in infrastructure and AP mode. In infrastructure "
"mode, various workarounds are used for a more reliable discovery of hidden "
"networks, such as probe-scanning the SSID.  However, these workarounds "
"expose inherent insecurities with hidden SSID networks, and thus hidden SSID "
"networks should be used with caution. In AP mode, the created network does "
"not broadcast its SSID. Note that marking the network as hidden may be a "
"privacy issue for you (in infrastructure mode) or client stations (in AP "
"mode), as the explicit probe-scans are distinctly recognizable on the air."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, dui aan dat die netwerk 'n nie-uitsaainetwerk is wat sy SSID "
"versteek. Dit werk beide in infrastruktuur en AP modus. In infrastruktuur "
"modus word verskeie oplossings gebruik vir 'n meer betroubare ontdekking van "
"versteekte netwerke, soos om die SSID te ondersoek. Hierdie oplossings stel "
"egter inherente onsekerheid met versteekte SSID netwerke bloot, en dus moet "
"versteekte SSID-netwerke met omsigtigheid gebruik word. In AP modus saai die "
"geskepte netwerk nie sy SSID uit nie. Let daarop dat die merk van die "
"netwerk as verborge 'n privaat heidskwessie vir jou (in infrastruktuur "
"modus) of klient stasies (in AP modus) kan wees, aangesien die eksplisiete "
"ondersoek skanderings duidelik herkenbaar is op die lug."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:403
msgid ""
"If specified, this connection will only apply to the Wi-Fi device whose "
"permanent MAC address matches. This property does not change the MAC address "
"of the device (i.e. MAC spoofing)."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, sal hierdie verbinding slegs van toepassing wees op "
"die Wi-Fi toestel waarvan die permanente MAC adres ooreenstem. Hierdie "
"eienskap verander nie die MAC adres van die toestel nie (d.w.s. MAC "
"spoofing)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:404
msgid ""
"A list of permanent MAC addresses of Wi-Fi devices to which this connection "
"should never apply.  Each MAC address should be given in the standard hex-"
"digits-and-colons notation (eg \"00:11:22:33:44:55\")."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys van permanente MAC adresse van Wi-Fi toestelle waarop hierdie "
"verbinding nooit van toepassing moet wees nie. Elke MAC-adres moet in die "
"standaard hex-syfers-en-kolonnotasie gegee word (bv \"00:11:22:33:44:55\")."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:15
msgid ""
"One of NM_SETTING_MAC_RANDOMIZATION_DEFAULT (0) (never randomize unless the "
"user has set a global default to randomize and the supplicant supports "
"randomization),  NM_SETTING_MAC_RANDOMIZATION_NEVER (1) (never randomize the "
"MAC address), or NM_SETTING_MAC_RANDOMIZATION_ALWAYS (2) (always randomize "
"the MAC address). This property is deprecated for 'cloned-mac-address'. "
"Deprecated: 1"
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:406
msgid ""
"Wi-Fi network mode; one of \"infrastructure\", \"mesh\", \"adhoc\" or "
"\"ap\".  If blank, infrastructure is assumed."
msgstr ""
"Wi-Fi netw rk modus; een van \"infrastructure\", \"mesh\", \"adhoc\" of "
"\"ap\".  Indien leeg, infrastruktuur word veronderstel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:380
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:407
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:444
msgid ""
"If non-zero, only transmit packets of the specified size or smaller, "
"breaking larger packets up into multiple Ethernet frames."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, stuur slegs pakkies van die gespesifiseerde grootte of "
"kleiner, en breek groter pakkies op in verskeie Ethernet rame."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:408
msgid ""
"One of NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_POWERSAVE_DISABLE (2) (disable Wi-Fi power "
"saving), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_POWERSAVE_ENABLE (3) (enable Wi-Fi power "
"saving), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_POWERSAVE_IGNORE (1) (don't touch currently "
"configure setting) or NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_POWERSAVE_DEFAULT (0) (use the "
"globally configured value). All other values are reserved."
msgstr ""
"Een van NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_POWERSAVE_DISABLE (2) (deaktiveer Wi-Fi-"
"kragbesparing), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_POWERSAVE_ENABLE (3) (aktiveer Wi-Fi-"
"kragbesparing), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_POWERSAVE_IGNORE (1)__SETTING_ tans nie "
"aan die NWPOWERSAVE_SETING_0 instel nie (moenie instel nie) (Moenie tans "
"DEEL aanraak nie) gekonfigureerde waarde). Alle ander waardes is voorbehou."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:409
msgid ""
"If non-zero, directs the device to only use the specified bitrate for "
"communication with the access point.  Units are in Kb/s, ie 5500 = 5.5 "
"Mbit/s.  This property is highly driver dependent and not all devices "
"support setting a static bitrate."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, rig die toestel om slegs die gespesifiseerde bitsnelheid te "
"gebruik vir kommunikasie met die toegangspunt. Eenhede is in Kb/s, maw 5500 "
"= 5,5 Mbit/s. Hierdie eiendom is hoogs drywer afhanklik en nie alle "
"toestelle ondersteun die stel van 'n statiese bitsnelheid nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:410
msgid ""
"A list of BSSIDs (each BSSID formatted as a MAC address like "
"\"00:11:22:33:44:55\") that have been detected as part of the Wi-Fi network. "
" NetworkManager internally tracks previously seen BSSIDs. The property is "
"only meant for reading and reflects the BSSID list of NetworkManager. The "
"changes you make to this property will not be preserved."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys BSSID's (elke BSSID geformateer as 'n MAC adres soos "
"\"00:11:22:33:44:55\") wat as deel van die Wi-Fi netwerk bespeur is. "
"NetwerkBestuurder volg intern voorheen gesiene BSSID's. Die eiendom is slegs "
"bedoel vir lees en weerspieël die BSSID lys van NetwerkBestuurder. Die "
"veranderinge wat jy aan hierdie eiendom maak, sal nie bewaar word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:411
msgid "SSID of the Wi-Fi network. Must be specified."
msgstr "SSID van die Wi-Fi netwerk. Moet gespesifiseer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:412
msgid ""
"If non-zero, directs the device to use the specified transmit power. Units "
"are dBm.  This property is highly driver dependent and not all devices "
"support setting a static transmit power."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, rig die toestel om die gespesifiseerde uitsaaikrag te "
"gebruik. Eenhede is dBm. Hierdie eiendom is hoogs bestuurder afhanklik en "
"nie alle toestelle ondersteun die stel van 'n statiese transmit krag nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:413
msgid ""
"The NMSettingWirelessWakeOnWLan options to enable. Not all devices support "
"all options. May be any combination of NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_ANY "
"(0x2), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_DISCONNECT (0x4), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_MAGIC (0x8), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_GTK_REKEY_FAILURE (0x10), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_EAP_IDENTITY_REQUEST (0x20), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_4WAY_HANDSHAKE (0x40), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_RFKILL_RELEASE (0x80), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_TCP (0x100) or the special values "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_DEFAULT (0x1) (to use global settings) and "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_IGNORE (0x8000) (to disable management of "
"Wake-on-LAN in NetworkManager)."
msgstr ""
"Die NMSettingWirelessWakeOnWLan opsies om te aktiveer. Nie alle toestelle "
"ondersteun alle opsies nie. Kan enige kombinasie wees van "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_ANY (0x2), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_DISCONNECT (0x4), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_MAGIC (0x8), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_GTK_REKEY_FAILURE (0x10), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_EAP_IDENTITY_REQUEST (0x20), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_4WAY_HANDSHAKE (0x40), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_RFKILL_RELEASE (0x80), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_TCP (0x100) of die spesiale waardes "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_DEFAULT (0x1) (om globale instellings te "
"gebruik) en NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_WAKE_ON_WLAN_IGNORE (0x8000) (om deaktiveer "
"bestuur van Wake-on-LAN in NetwerkBestuurder)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:414
msgid ""
"When WEP is used (ie, key-mgmt = \"none\" or \"ieee8021x\") indicate the "
"802.11 authentication algorithm required by the AP here.  One of \"open\" "
"for Open System, \"shared\" for Shared Key, or \"leap\" for Cisco LEAP.  "
"When using Cisco LEAP (ie, key-mgmt = \"ieee8021x\" and auth-alg = \"leap\") "
"the \"leap-username\" and \"leap-password\" properties must be specified."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer WEP gebruik word (bv, key-mgmt = \"none\" of \"ieee8021x\") dui die "
"aan 802.11 stawings algoritme wat deur die AP vereis word hier.  Een van "
"\"open\" vir Oop Stelsel, \"shared\" vir Gedeelde Sleutel, of \"leap\" vir "
"Cisco LEAP.  Wanneer gebruik Cisco LEAP (dws, key-mgmt = \"ieee8021x\" en "
"auth-alg = \"leap\") die \"leap-username\" en \"leap-password\" eiendomme "
"moet gespesifiseer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:415
msgid ""
"Indicates whether Fast Initial Link Setup (802.11ai) must be enabled for the "
"connection.  One of NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_DEFAULT (0) (use "
"global default value), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_DISABLE (1) "
"(disable FILS), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_OPTIONAL (2) (enable FILS "
"if the supplicant and the access point support it) or "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_REQUIRED (3) (enable FILS and fail if not "
"supported).  When set to NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_DEFAULT (0) and "
"no global default is set, FILS will be optionally enabled."
msgstr ""
"Dui aan of vinnige aanvanklike skakelopstelling (802.11ai) moet in staat "
"gestel word vir die konneksie.  Een van "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_DEFAULT (0) (gebruik globale verstek "
"waarde), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_DISABLE (1) (deaktiveer FILS), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_OPTIONAL (2) (in staat stel FILS indien "
"die bidder en die toegang punt dit ondersteun) of "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_REQUIRED (3) (in staat stel FILS en misluk "
"indien nie ondersteun nie).  Wanneer ingestel op "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_FILS_DEFAULT (0) en geen globale verstek is "
"ingestel nie, FILS sal opsioneel geaktiveer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:416
msgid ""
"A list of group/broadcast encryption algorithms which prevents connections "
"to Wi-Fi networks that do not utilize one of the algorithms in the list.  "
"For maximum compatibility leave this property empty.  Each list element may "
"be one of \"wep40\", \"wep104\", \"tkip\", or \"ccmp\"."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys van groep/uitsaai enkripsie algoritmes wat verbindings met Wi-Fi "
"netwerke verhoed wat nie een van die algoritmes in die lys gebruik nie. Vir "
"maksimum versoenbaarheid laat hierdie eiendom leeg. Elke lys element kan een "
"van wees \"wep40\", \"wep104\", \"tkip\", of \"ccmp\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:417
msgid ""
"Key management used for the connection. One of \"none\" (WEP or no password "
"protection), \"ieee8021x\" (Dynamic WEP), \"owe\" (Opportunistic Wireless "
"Encryption), \"wpa-psk\" (WPA2 + WPA3 personal), \"sae\" (WPA3 personal "
"only), \"wpa-eap\" (WPA2 + WPA3 enterprise) or \"wpa-eap-suite-b-192\" (WPA3 "
"enterprise only). This property must be set for any Wi-Fi connection that "
"uses security."
msgstr ""
"Sleutel bestuur wat vir die verbinding gebruik word. Een van \"none\" (WEP "
"of geen wagwoord beskerming nie), \"ieee8021x\" (Dinamies WEP), \"owe\" "
"(Opportunistiese Draadlose Enkripsie), \"wpa-psk\" (WPA2 + WPA3 persoonlik), "
"\"sae\" (WPA3 persoonlik slegs), \"wpa-eap\" (WPA2 + WPA3 enterprise) of "
"\"wpa-eap-suite-b-192\" (WPA3 enterprise slegs). Hierdie eiendom moet gestel "
"word vir enige Wi-Fi verbinding wat sekuriteit gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:418
msgid ""
"The login password for legacy LEAP connections (ie, key-mgmt = \"ieee8021x\" "
"and auth-alg = \"leap\")."
msgstr ""
"Die aanmeld wagwoord vir verouderde LEAP verbindings (bv, key-mgmt = "
"\"ieee8021x\" en auth-alg = \"leap\")."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:419
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"leap-password\" property."
msgstr "Vlae wat aandui hoe om die te hanteer \"leap-password\" eiendom."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:420
msgid ""
"The login username for legacy LEAP connections (ie, key-mgmt = \"ieee8021x\" "
"and auth-alg = \"leap\")."
msgstr ""
"Die login gebruikersnaam vir legacy LEAP konneksies (bv, key-mgmt = "
"\"ieee8021x\" en auth-alg = \"leap\")."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:421
msgid ""
"A list of pairwise encryption algorithms which prevents connections to Wi-Fi "
"networks that do not utilize one of the algorithms in the list. For maximum "
"compatibility leave this property empty.  Each list element may be one of "
"\"tkip\" or \"ccmp\"."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys van paarsgewyse enkripsie-algoritmes wat verbindings met Wi-Fi-"
"netwerke verhoed wat nie een van die algoritmes in die lys gebruik nie. Vir "
"maksimum versoenbaarheid laat hierdie eiendom leeg. Elke lyselement kan een "
"van wees \"tkip\" of \"ccmp\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:422
msgid ""
"Indicates whether Protected Management Frames (802.11w) must be enabled for "
"the connection.  One of NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_DEFAULT (0) (use "
"global default value), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_DISABLE (1) (disable "
"PMF), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_OPTIONAL (2) (enable PMF if the "
"supplicant and the access point support it) or "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_REQUIRED (3) (enable PMF and fail if not "
"supported).  When set to NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_DEFAULT (0) and no "
"global default is set, PMF will be optionally enabled."
msgstr ""
"Dui aan of Beskermde Bestuursrame (802.11w) vir die verbinding geaktiveer "
"moet word. Een van NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_DEFAULT (0) (gebruik "
"wêreldwye verstekwaarde), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_DISABLE (1) "
"(deaktiveer PMF), NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_OPTIONAL (2) (aktiveer "
"PMFURITY en (aktiveer PMFRETS) en (aktiveer PMFELESS) as die PMFREET-"
"toeganklik is en (aktiveer PMFRETS) nie ondersteun nie). Wanneer dit op "
"NM_SETTING_WIRELESS_SECURITY_PMF_DEFAULT (0) gestel is en geen globale "
"verstek gestel is nie, sal PMF opsioneel geaktiveer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:423
msgid ""
"List of strings specifying the allowed WPA protocol versions to use. Each "
"element may be one \"wpa\" (allow WPA) or \"rsn\" (allow WPA2/RSN).  If not "
"specified, both WPA and RSN connections are allowed."
msgstr ""
"Lys van toutjies wat die toegelate WPA protokol weergawes spesifiseer om te "
"gebruik. Elke element kan een \"wpa\" (laat WPA toe) of \"rsn\" (laat "
"WPA2/RSN toe) wees. Indien nie gespesifiseer nie, word beide WPA en RSN "
"verbindings toegelaat."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:424
msgid ""
"Pre-Shared-Key for WPA networks. For WPA-PSK, it's either an ASCII "
"passphrase of 8 to 63 characters that is (as specified in the 802.11i "
"standard) hashed to derive the actual key, or the key in form of 64 "
"hexadecimal character. The WPA3-Personal networks use a passphrase of any "
"length for SAE authentication."
msgstr ""
"Vooraf-Gedeelde-Sleutel vir WPA netwerke. Vir WPA-PSK is dit óf 'n ASCII "
"wagfrase van 8 tot 63 karakters wat (soos gespesifiseer in die 802.11i "
"standaard) gehash is om die werklike sleutel af te lei, óf die sleutel in "
"die vorm van 64 heksadesimale karakters. Die WPA3-Persoonlike netwerke "
"gebruik 'n wagfrase van enige lengte vir SAE stawing."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:425
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"psk\" property."
msgstr "Vlae wat aandui hoe om die \"psk\" eiendom te hanteer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:426
msgid ""
"Flags indicating how to handle the \"wep-key0\", \"wep-key1\", \"wep-key2\", "
"and \"wep-key3\" properties."
msgstr ""
"Vlae wat aandui hoe om die \"wep-key0\", \"wep-key1\", \"wep-key2\" en \"wep-"
"key3\" eiendomme te hanteer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:427
msgid ""
"Controls the interpretation of WEP keys.  Allowed values are "
"NM_WEP_KEY_TYPE_KEY (1), in which case the key is either a 10- or 26-"
"character hexadecimal string, or a 5- or 13-character ASCII password; or "
"NM_WEP_KEY_TYPE_PASSPHRASE (2), in which case the passphrase is provided as "
"a string and will be hashed using the de-facto MD5 method to derive the "
"actual WEP key."
msgstr ""
"Beheer die interpretasie van WEP sleutels. Toegelate waardes is "
"NM_WEP_KEY_TYPE_KEY (1), in welke geval die sleutel óf 'n 10- of 26-karakter "
"heksadesimale string is, óf 'n 5- of 13-karakter ASCII wagwoord; of "
"NM_WEP_KEY_TYPE_PASSPHRASE (2), in welke geval die wagwoordfrase as 'n "
"toutjie verskaf word en met behulp van die de-facto MD5 metode gehash sal "
"word om die werklike WEP sleutel af te lei."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:428
msgid ""
"Index 0 WEP key.  This is the WEP key used in most networks.  See the \"wep-"
"key-type\" property for a description of how this key is interpreted."
msgstr ""
"Indeks 0 WEP-sleutel. Dit is die WEP-sleutel wat in die meeste netwerke "
"gebruik word. Sien die \"wep-key-type\" eiendom vir 'n beskrywing van hoe "
"hierdie sleutel geïnterpreteer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:429
msgid ""
"Index 1 WEP key.  This WEP index is not used by most networks.  See the "
"\"wep-key-type\" property for a description of how this key is interpreted."
msgstr ""
"Indeks 1 WEP sleutel. Hierdie WEP indeks word nie deur die meeste netwerke "
"gebruik nie. Sien die \"wep-key-type\" eiendom vir 'n beskrywing van hoe "
"hierdie sleutel geïnterpreteer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:430
msgid ""
"Index 2 WEP key.  This WEP index is not used by most networks.  See the "
"\"wep-key-type\" property for a description of how this key is interpreted."
msgstr ""
"Indeks 2 WEP-sleutel. Hierdie WEP-indeks word nie deur die meeste netwerke "
"gebruik nie. Sien die \"wep-key-type\" eiendom vir 'n beskrywing van hoe "
"hierdie sleutel geïnterpreteer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:431
msgid ""
"Index 3 WEP key.  This WEP index is not used by most networks.  See the "
"\"wep-key-type\" property for a description of how this key is interpreted."
msgstr ""
"Indeks 3 WEP sleutel. Hierdie WEP indeks word nie deur die meeste netwerke "
"gebruik nie. Sien die \"wep-key-type\" eiendom vir 'n beskrywing van hoe "
"hierdie sleutel geïnterpreteer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:432
msgid ""
"When static WEP is used (ie, key-mgmt = \"none\") and a non-default WEP key "
"index is used by the AP, put that WEP key index here.  Valid values are 0 "
"(default key) through 3.  Note that some consumer access points (like the "
"Linksys WRT54G) number the keys 1 - 4."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer statiese WEP gebruik word (dws key-mgmt = \"none\") en 'n nie-"
"verstek WEP sleutel indeks word deur die AP gebruik, plaas daardie WEP "
"sleutel indeks hier. Geldige waardes is 0 (verstek sleutel) tot 3. Let "
"daarop dat sommige verbruiker toegang punte (soos die Linksys WRT54G) die "
"sleutels 1 - 4 nommer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:433
msgid ""
"Flags indicating which mode of WPS is to be used if any. There's little "
"point in changing the default setting as NetworkManager will automatically "
"determine whether it's feasible to start WPS enrollment from the Access "
"Point capabilities. WPS can be disabled by setting this property to a value "
"of 1."
msgstr ""
"Vlae wat aandui watter modus van WPS gebruik moet word indien enige. Daar is "
"min sin daarin om die verstekinstelling te verander, aangesien "
"NetwerkBestuurder outomaties sal bepaal of dit haalbaar is om WPS inskrywing "
"te begin vanaf die Toegang punt vermoëns. WPS kan gedeaktiveer word deur "
"hierdie eiendom op 'n waarde van 1 te stel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:32
msgid ""
"List of strings to be matched against the altSubjectName of the certificate "
"presented by the authentication server. If the list is empty, no "
"verification of the server certificate's altSubjectName is performed."
msgstr ""
"Lys van stringe wat ooreenstem met die altSubjectName van die sertifikaat "
"wat deur die stawing bediener aangebied word. As die lys leeg is, word geen "
"verifikasie van die bediener sertifikaat se altSubjectName uitgevoer nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:33
msgid ""
"Anonymous identity string for EAP authentication methods.  Used as the "
"unencrypted identity with EAP types that support different tunneled identity "
"like EAP-TTLS."
msgstr ""
"Anonieme identiteitstring vir EAP stawing metodes. Word gebruik as die "
"ongeënkripteerde identiteit met EAP tipes wat verskillende tonnel identiteit "
"soos EAP-TTLS ondersteun."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:34
msgid ""
"A timeout for the authentication. Zero means the global default; if the "
"global default is not set, the authentication timeout is 25 seconds."
msgstr ""
"'n Uitteltyd vir die stawing. Nul beteken die globale verstek; as die "
"globale verstek nie ingestel is nie, is die verifikasie-tydverloop 25 "
"sekondes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:35
msgid ""
"Contains the CA certificate if used by the EAP method specified in the "
"\"eap\" property. Certificate data is specified using a \"scheme\"; three "
"are currently supported: blob, path and pkcs#11 URL. When using the blob "
"scheme this property should be set to the certificate's DER encoded data. "
"When using the path scheme, this property should be set to the full UTF-8 "
"encoded path of the certificate, prefixed with the string \"file://\" and "
"ending with a terminating NUL byte. This property can be unset even if the "
"EAP method supports CA certificates, but this allows man-in-the-middle "
"attacks and is NOT recommended. Note that enabling NMSetting8021x:system-ca-"
"certs will override this setting to use the built-in path, if the built-in "
"path is not a directory."
msgstr ""
"Bevat die CA sertifikaat indien dit gebruik word deur die EAP metode "
"gespesifiseer in die \"eap\" eiendom. Sertifikaat data word gespesifiseer "
"deur 'n \"scheme\" te gebruik; drie word tans ondersteun: blob, pad en "
"pkcs#11 URL. Wanneer die blob skema gebruik word, moet hierdie eienskap op "
"die sertifikaat se DER gekodeerde data gestel word. Wanneer die padskema "
"gebruik word, moet hierdie eienskap gestel word op die volle UTF-8 "
"gekodeerde pad van die sertifikaat, voorafgegaan met die toutjie \"file://\" "
"en eindig met 'n eindigende NUL greep. Hierdie eiendom kan unset word selfs "
"al ondersteun die EAP metode CA sertifikate, maar dit laat man-in-die-middel "
"aanvalle toe en word NIE aanbeveel nie. Let daarop dat die aktivering van "
"NMSetting8021x:system-ca-certs sal hierdie instelling ignoreer om die "
"ingeboude pad te gebruik, as die ingeboude pad nie 'n gids is nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:36
msgid ""
"The password used to access the CA certificate stored in \"ca-cert\" "
"property. Only makes sense if the certificate is stored on a PKCS#11 token "
"that requires a login."
msgstr ""
"Die wagwoord wat gebruik word om toegang te verkry tot die CA sertifikaat "
"wat in \"ca-cert\"-eiendom gestoor is. Maak net sin as die sertifikaat op 'n "
"PKCS#11 token gestoor word wat 'n aanmelding vereis"

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:37
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"ca-cert-password\" property."
msgstr "Vlae wat aandui hoe om die te hanteer \"ca-cert-password\" eiendom."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:38
msgid ""
"UTF-8 encoded path to a directory containing PEM or DER formatted "
"certificates to be added to the verification chain in addition to the "
"certificate specified in the \"ca-cert\" property. If NMSetting8021x:system-"
"ca-certs is enabled and the built-in CA path is an existing directory, then "
"this setting is ignored."
msgstr ""
"UTF-8 gekodeerde pad na 'n gids wat PEM  of DER geformateerde sertifikate "
"bevat om by die verifikasieketting gevoeg te word bykomend tot die "
"sertifikaat gespesifiseer in die \"ca-cert\" eiendom. Indien "
"NMSetting8021x:system-ca-certs geaktiveer is en die ingeboude CA-pad is 'n "
"bestaande gids, dan word hierdie instelling geïgnoreer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:39
msgid ""
"Contains the client certificate if used by the EAP method specified in the "
"\"eap\" property. Certificate data is specified using a \"scheme\"; two are "
"currently supported: blob and path. When using the blob scheme (which is "
"backwards compatible with NM 0.7.x) this property should be set to the "
"certificate's DER encoded data. When using the path scheme, this property "
"should be set to the full UTF-8 encoded path of the certificate, prefixed "
"with the string \"file://\" and ending with a terminating NUL byte."
msgstr ""
"Bevat die kliëntsertifikaat as dit gebruik word deur die EAP metode "
"gespesifiseer in die \"eap\" eiendom. Sertifikaat data word gespesifiseer "
"deur 'n \"scheme\" te gebruik; twee word tans ondersteun: blob en path. "
"Wanneer die blob-skema gebruik word (wat agteruit versoenbaar is met NM "
"0.7.x) moet hierdie eiendom op die sertifikaat se DER gekodeerde data gestel "
"word. Wanneer die padskema gebruik word, moet hierdie eiendom gestel word op "
"die volle UTF-8 gekodeerde pad van die sertifikaat, voorafgegaan met die "
"toutjie \"file://\" en eindig met 'n eindigende NUL greep."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:40
msgid ""
"The password used to access the client certificate stored in \"client-cert\" "
"property. Only makes sense if the certificate is stored on a PKCS#11 token "
"that requires a login."
msgstr ""
"Die wagwoord wat gebruik word om toegang te verkry tot die klient "
"sertifikaat wat in \"client-cert\" eiendom gestoor is. Maak net sin as die "
"sertifikaat op 'n PKCS#11 token gestoor word wat 'n aanmelding vereis."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:41
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"client-cert-password\" property."
msgstr ""
"Vlae wat aandui hoe om te hanteer die \"client-cert-password\" eiendom."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:42
msgid ""
"Constraint for server domain name. If set, this list of FQDNs is used as a "
"match requirement for dNSName element(s) of the certificate presented by the "
"authentication server.  If a matching dNSName is found, this constraint is "
"met.  If no dNSName values are present, this constraint is matched against "
"SubjectName CN using the same comparison. Multiple valid FQDNs can be passed "
"as a \";\" delimited list."
msgstr ""
"Beperking vir bediener domein naam. Indien stel, hierdie lys van FQDNs word "
"gebruik as 'n wedstryd vereiste vir dNSName element(s) van die sertifikaat "
"aangebied deur die stawing bediener.  Indien 'n bypassende dNSName gevind "
"word, word aan hierdie beperking voldoen.  Indien geen dNSName waardes "
"aanwesig is, hierdie beperking is wedstryd daarteen SubjectName CN gebruik "
"dieselfde vergelyking. Veelvoud geldig FQDNs geslaag kan word as 'n \";\" "
"afgebakende lys."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:43
msgid ""
"Constraint for server domain name. If set, this FQDN is used as a suffix "
"match requirement for dNSName element(s) of the certificate presented by the "
"authentication server.  If a matching dNSName is found, this constraint is "
"met.  If no dNSName values are present, this constraint is matched against "
"SubjectName CN using same suffix match comparison. Since version 1.24, "
"multiple valid FQDNs can be passed as a \";\" delimited list."
msgstr ""
"Beperking vir bediener domein naam. Indien gestel, word hierdie FQDN gebruik "
"as 'n agtervoegsel passing vereiste vir dNSName element(s) van die "
"sertifikaat wat deur die stawing bediener aangebied word. As 'n "
"ooreenstemmende dNSName gevind word, word aan hierdie beperking voldoen. As "
"geen dNSName waardes teenwoordig is nie, word hierdie beperking teen "
"SubjectName CN gepas deur dieselfde agtervoegsel passing vergelyking te "
"gebruik. Sedert weergawe 1.24 kan verskeie geldige FQDN's as 'n \";\" "
"deurgegee word afgebakende lys."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:44
msgid ""
"The allowed EAP method to be used when authenticating to the network with "
"802.1x.  Valid methods are: \"leap\", \"md5\", \"tls\", \"peap\", \"ttls\", "
"\"pwd\", and \"fast\".  Each method requires different configuration using "
"the properties of this setting; refer to wpa_supplicant documentation for "
"the allowed combinations."
msgstr ""
"Die toegelate EAP-metode wat gebruik moet word wanneer daar na die netwerk "
"geverifieer word met 802.1x. Geldige metodes is: \"leap\", \"md5\", \"tls\", "
"\"peap\", \"ttls\", \"pwd\", en \"fast\".  Elke metode vereis verskillende "
"konfigurasie deur die eienskappe van hierdie instelling te gebruik; verwys "
"na wpa_supplicant dokumentasie vir die toegelate kombinasies."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:45
msgid ""
"Identity string for EAP authentication methods.  Often the user's user or "
"login name."
msgstr ""
"Identiteitsstring vir EAP stawing metodes. Dikwels die gebruiker se "
"gebruiker of aanmeld naam."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:46
msgid ""
"Whether the 802.1X authentication is optional. If TRUE, the activation will "
"continue even after a timeout or an authentication failure. Setting the "
"property to TRUE is currently allowed only for Ethernet connections. If set "
"to FALSE, the activation can continue only after a successful authentication."
msgstr ""
"Whether die 802.1X stawing opsioneel is. Indien WAAR, sal die aktivering "
"voortgaan selfs na 'n uitteltyd of 'n verifikasie mislukking. Om die eiendom "
"op TRUE te stel, word tans slegs vir Ethernet verbindings toegelaat. As dit "
"op ONWAAR gestel is, kan die aktivering slegs voortgaan na 'n suksesvolle "
"stawing."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:47
msgid "UTF-8 encoded file path containing PAC for EAP-FAST."
msgstr "UTF-8-gekodeerde lêerpad wat PAC bevat vir EAP-FAST."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:48
msgid ""
"UTF-8 encoded password used for EAP authentication methods. If both the "
"\"password\" property and the \"password-raw\" property are specified, "
"\"password\" is preferred."
msgstr ""
"UTF-8 geënkodeerde wagwoord gebruik vir EAP stawing metodes. Indien beide "
"die \"password\" eiendom en die \"password-raw\" eiendom gespesifiseer word, "
"\"password\" word verkies."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:49
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:81
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:123
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:148
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:292
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"password\" property."
msgstr "Vlae wat aandui hoe om die \"password\" eiendom te hanteer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:50
msgid ""
"Password used for EAP authentication methods, given as a byte array to allow "
"passwords in other encodings than UTF-8 to be used. If both the \"password\" "
"property and the \"password-raw\" property are specified, \"password\" is "
"preferred."
msgstr ""
"Wagwoord gebruik vir EAP stawing metodes, gegee as 'n greepskikking om "
"wagwoorde in ander enkoderings as UTF-8 toe te laat om gebruik te word. As "
"beide die \"password\" eiendom en die \"password-raw\" eiendom gespesifiseer "
"word, word \"password\" verkies."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:51
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"password-raw\" property."
msgstr "Vlae wat aandui hoe om te hanteer die \"password-raw\" eiendom."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:63
msgid ""
"Specifies authentication flags to use in \"phase 1\" outer authentication "
"using NMSetting8021xAuthFlags options. The individual TLS versions can be "
"explicitly disabled. If a certain TLS disable flag is not set, it is up to "
"the supplicant to allow or forbid it. The TLS options map to "
"tls_disable_tlsv1_x settings. See the wpa_supplicant documentation for more "
"details."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:53
msgid ""
"Enables or disables in-line provisioning of EAP-FAST credentials when FAST "
"is specified as the EAP method in the \"eap\" property. Recognized values "
"are \"0\" (disabled), \"1\" (allow unauthenticated provisioning), \"2\" "
"(allow authenticated provisioning), and \"3\" (allow both authenticated and "
"unauthenticated provisioning).  See the wpa_supplicant documentation for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer of deaktiveer inlyn voorsiening van EAP-SNEL geloofsbriewe wanneer "
"SNEL as die EAP metode in die \"eap\"-eienskap gespesifiseer word. Herkende "
"waardes is \"0\" (gedeaktiveer), \"1\" (laat ongeverifieerde voorsiening "
"toe), \"2\" (laat geverifieerde voorsiening toe) en \"3\" (laat beide "
"geverifieerde en ongeverifieerde voorsiening toe). Sien die wpa_supplicant "
"dokumentasie vir meer besonderhede."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:54
msgid ""
"Forces use of the new PEAP label during key derivation.  Some RADIUS servers "
"may require forcing the new PEAP label to interoperate with PEAPv1.  Set to "
"\"1\" to force use of the new PEAP label.  See the wpa_supplicant "
"documentation for more details."
msgstr ""
"Forseer die gebruik van die nuwe PEAP etiket tydens sleutelafleiding. "
"Sommige RADIUS bedieners mag vereis dat die nuwe PEAP-etiket gedwing word om "
"met PEAPv1 te werk. Stel op \"1\" om die gebruik van die nuwe PEAP etiket af "
"te dwing. Sien die wpa_supplicant dokumentasie vir meer besonderhede."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:55
msgid ""
"Forces which PEAP version is used when PEAP is set as the EAP method in the "
"\"eap\" property.  When unset, the version reported by the server will be "
"used.  Sometimes when using older RADIUS servers, it is necessary to force "
"the client to use a particular PEAP version.  To do so, this property may be "
"set to \"0\" or \"1\" to force that specific PEAP version."
msgstr ""
"Dwing watter PEAP weergawe gebruik word wanneer PEAP as die EAP metode in "
"die \"eap\" eiendom gestel is. Wanneer dit nie ingestel is nie, sal die "
"weergawe wat deur die bediener gerapporteer word, gebruik word. Soms wanneer "
"ouer RADIUS bedieners gebruik word, is dit nodig om die klient te dwing om "
"'n spesifieke PEAP weergawe te gebruik. Om dit te doen, kan hierdie eienskap "
"op \"0\" of \"1\" gestel word om daardie spesifieke PEAP weergawe af te "
"dwing."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:56
msgid ""
"List of strings to be matched against the altSubjectName of the certificate "
"presented by the authentication server during the inner \"phase 2\" "
"authentication. If the list is empty, no verification of the server "
"certificate's altSubjectName is performed."
msgstr ""
"Lys van toutjies wat ooreenstem met die altSubjectName van die sertifikaat "
"wat deur die stawingbediener tydens die binneste \"phase 2\" stawing "
"aangebied word. As die lys leeg is, word geen verifikasie van die "
"bedienersertifikaat se altSubjectName uitgevoer nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:57
msgid ""
"Specifies the allowed \"phase 2\" inner authentication method when an EAP "
"method that uses an inner TLS tunnel is specified in the \"eap\" property.  "
"For TTLS this property selects one of the supported non-EAP inner methods: "
"\"pap\", \"chap\", \"mschap\", \"mschapv2\" while \"phase2-autheap\" selects "
"an EAP inner method.  For PEAP this selects an inner EAP method, one of: "
"\"gtc\", \"otp\", \"md5\" and \"tls\". Each \"phase 2\" inner method "
"requires specific parameters for successful authentication; see the "
"wpa_supplicant documentation for more details. Both \"phase2-auth\" and "
"\"phase2-autheap\" cannot be specified."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die toegelate \"phase 2\" innerlike stawing metode wanneer 'n "
"EAP metode wat 'n binneste TLS tonnel gebruik, in die \"eap\" eienskap "
"gespesifiseer word. Vir TTLS kies hierdie eienskap een van die ondersteunde "
"nie-EAP-innerlike metodes: \"pap\", \"chap\", \"mschap\", \"mschapv2\" "
"terwyl \"phase2-autheap\" 'n EAP innerlike metode kies. Vir PEAP kies dit 'n "
"innerlike EAP-metode, een van: \"gtc\", \"otp\", \"md5\" en \"tls\". Elke "
"\"phase 2\" innerlike metode vereis spesifieke parameters vir suksesvolle "
"stawing; sien die wpa_supplicant-dokumentasie vir meer besonderhede. Beide "
"\"phase2-auth\" en \"phase2-autheap\" kan nie gespesifiseer word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:58
msgid ""
"Specifies the allowed \"phase 2\" inner EAP-based authentication method when "
"TTLS is specified in the \"eap\" property.  Recognized EAP-based \"phase 2\" "
"methods are \"md5\", \"mschapv2\", \"otp\", \"gtc\", and \"tls\". Each "
"\"phase 2\" inner method requires specific parameters for successful "
"authentication; see the wpa_supplicant documentation for more details."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die toegelate \"phase 2\" innerlike EAP-gebaseerde stawing "
"metode wanneer TTLS in die \"eap\" eiendom gespesifiseer word. Erkende EAP-"
"gebaseerde \"phase 2\" metodes is \"md5\", \"mschapv2\", \"otp\", \"gtc\" en "
"\"tls\". Elke \"phase 2\" innerlike metode vereis spesifieke parameters vir "
"suksesvolle stawing; sien die wpa_supplicant dokumentasie vir meer "
"besonderhede."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:59
msgid ""
"Contains the \"phase 2\" CA certificate if used by the EAP method specified "
"in the \"phase2-auth\" or \"phase2-autheap\" properties. Certificate data is "
"specified using a \"scheme\"; three are currently supported: blob, path and "
"pkcs#11 URL. When using the blob scheme this property should be set to the "
"certificate's DER encoded data. When using the path scheme, this property "
"should be set to the full UTF-8 encoded path of the certificate, prefixed "
"with the string \"file://\" and ending with a terminating NUL byte. This "
"property can be unset even if the EAP method supports CA certificates, but "
"this allows man-in-the-middle attacks and is NOT recommended. Note that "
"enabling NMSetting8021x:system-ca-certs will override this setting to use "
"the built-in path, if the built-in path is not a directory."
msgstr ""
"Bevat die \"phase 2\" CA-sertifikaat as dit gebruik word deur die EAP-metode "
"gespesifiseer in die \"phase2-auth\" of \"phase2-autheap\" eiendomme. "
"Sertifikaat data word gespesifiseer deur 'n \"scheme\" te gebruik; drie word "
"tans ondersteun: blob, pad en pkcs#11 URL. Wanneer die blob-skema gebruik "
"word, moet hierdie eiendom op die sertifikaat se DER gekodeerde data gestel "
"word. Wanneer die padskema gebruik word, moet hierdie eiendom gestel word op "
"die volle UTF-8 gekodeerde pad van die sertifikaat, voorafgegaan met die "
"toutjie \"file://\" en eindig met 'n eindigende NUL greep. Hierdie eienskap "
"kan gedeaktiveer word selfs al ondersteun die EAP metode CA sertifikate, "
"maar dit laat man-in-die-middel-aanvalle toe en word NIE aanbeveel nie. Let "
"daarop dat die aktivering van NMSetting8021x:system-ca-certs hierdie "
"instelling sal ignoreer om die ingeboude pad te gebruik, as die ingeboude "
"pad nie 'n gids is nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:60
msgid ""
"The password used to access the \"phase2\" CA certificate stored in \"phase2-"
"ca-cert\" property. Only makes sense if the certificate is stored on a "
"PKCS#11 token that requires a login."
msgstr ""
"Die wagwoord wat gebruik word om toegang te verkry tot die \"phase2\" CA "
"sertifikaat gestoor in \"phase2-ca-cert\" eiendom. Maak net sin as die "
"sertifikaat op 'n PKCS#11-token gestoor word wat 'n aanmelding vereis."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:61
msgid ""
"Flags indicating how to handle the \"phase2-ca-cert-password\" property."
msgstr ""
"Vlae wat aandui hoe om die \"phase2-ca-cert-password\" eiendom te hanteer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:62
msgid ""
"UTF-8 encoded path to a directory containing PEM or DER formatted "
"certificates to be added to the verification chain in addition to the "
"certificate specified in the \"phase2-ca-cert\" property. If "
"NMSetting8021x:system-ca-certs is enabled and the built-in CA path is an "
"existing directory, then this setting is ignored."
msgstr ""
"UTF-8 gekodeerde pad na 'n gids wat PEM  of DER geformateerde sertifikate "
"bevat om by die verifikasie ketting gevoeg te word bykomend tot die "
"sertifikaat gespesifiseer in die \"phase2-ca-cert\" eiendom. Indien "
"NMSetting8021x:system-ca-certs geaktiveer is en die ingeboude CA pad is 'n "
"bestaande gids, dan word hierdie instelling geïgnoreer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:63
msgid ""
"Contains the \"phase 2\" client certificate if used by the EAP method "
"specified in the \"phase2-auth\" or \"phase2-autheap\" properties. "
"Certificate data is specified using a \"scheme\"; two are currently "
"supported: blob and path. When using the blob scheme (which is backwards "
"compatible with NM 0.7.x) this property should be set to the certificate's "
"DER encoded data. When using the path scheme, this property should be set to "
"the full UTF-8 encoded path of the certificate, prefixed with the string "
"\"file://\" and ending with a terminating NUL byte. This property can be "
"unset even if the EAP method supports CA certificates, but this allows man-"
"in-the-middle attacks and is NOT recommended."
msgstr ""
"Bevat die \"phase 2\" klient sertifikaat indien dit gebruik word deur die "
"EAP-metode gespesifiseer in die \"phase2-auth\" of \"phase2-autheap\" "
"eiendomme. Sertifikaat data word gespesifiseer deur 'n \"scheme\" te "
"gebruik; twee word tans ondersteun: blob en path. Wanneer die blob-skema "
"gebruik word (wat agteruit versoenbaar is met NM 0.7.x) moet hierdie eiendom "
"op die sertifikaat se DER gekodeerde data gestel word. Wanneer die padskema "
"gebruik word, moet hierdie eienskap gestel word op die volle UTF-8 "
"gekodeerde pad van die sertifikaat, voorafgegaan met die string \"file://\" "
"en eindig met 'n eindigende NUL-greep. Hierdie eiendom kan gedeaktiveer word "
"selfs al ondersteun die EAP metode CA sertifikate, maar dit laat man-in-die-"
"middel aanvalle toe en word NIE aanbeveel nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:64
msgid ""
"The password used to access the \"phase2\" client certificate stored in "
"\"phase2-client-cert\" property. Only makes sense if the certificate is "
"stored on a PKCS#11 token that requires a login."
msgstr ""
"Die wagwoord wat gebruik word om toegang te verkry tot die \"phase2\" klient "
"sertifikaat wat in \"phase2-client-cert\" eiendom gestoor is. Maak net sin "
"as die sertifikaat op 'n PKCS#11 token gestoor word wat 'n aanmelding vereis."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:65
msgid ""
"Flags indicating how to handle the \"phase2-client-cert-password\" property."
msgstr ""
"Vlae wat aandui hoe om die \"phase2-client-cert-password\" eiendom te "
"hanteer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:66
msgid ""
"Constraint for server domain name. If set, this list of FQDNs is used as a "
"match requirement for dNSName element(s) of the certificate presented by the "
"authentication server during the inner \"phase 2\" authentication. If a "
"matching dNSName is found, this constraint is met.  If no dNSName values are "
"present, this constraint is matched against SubjectName CN using the same "
"comparison. Multiple valid FQDNs can be passed as a \";\" delimited list."
msgstr ""
"Beperking vir bediener domein naam. Indien gestel, word hierdie lys FQDN's "
"gebruik as 'n passingsvereiste vir dNSName element(s) van die sertifikaat "
"wat deur die stawing bediener tydens die innerlike \"phase 2\" stawing "
"aangebied word. As 'n ooreenstemmende dNSName gevind word, word aan hierdie "
"beperking voldoen. As geen dNSName waardes teenwoordig is nie, word hierdie "
"beperking met SubjectName CN ooreenstem met dieselfde vergelyking. "
"Veelvuldige geldige FQDN's kan deurgegee word as 'n \";\" afgebakende lys."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:67
msgid ""
"Constraint for server domain name. If set, this FQDN is used as a suffix "
"match requirement for dNSName element(s) of the certificate presented by the "
"authentication server during the inner \"phase 2\" authentication.  If a "
"matching dNSName is found, this constraint is met.  If no dNSName values are "
"present, this constraint is matched against SubjectName CN using same suffix "
"match comparison. Since version 1.24, multiple valid FQDNs can be passed as "
"a \";\" delimited list."
msgstr ""
"Beperking vir bedienerdomeinnaam. Indien gestel, word hierdie FQDN gebruik "
"as 'n agtervoegselpassingsvereiste vir dNSName-element(s) van die "
"sertifikaat wat deur die stawing bediener tydens die innerlike \"phase 2\" "
"stawing aangebied word. As 'n ooreenstemmende dNSName gevind word, word aan "
"hierdie beperking voldoen. As geen dNSName waardes teenwoordig is nie, word "
"hierdie beperking teen SubjectName CN gepas deur dieselfde agtervoegsel "
"passing vergelyking te gebruik. Sedert weergawe 1.24 kan verskeie geldige "
"FQDN's as 'n \";\" deurgegee word afgebakende lys."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:68
msgid ""
"Contains the \"phase 2\" inner private key when the \"phase2-auth\" or "
"\"phase2-autheap\" property is set to \"tls\". Key data is specified using a "
"\"scheme\"; two are currently supported: blob and path. When using the blob "
"scheme and private keys, this property should be set to the key's encrypted "
"PEM encoded data. When using private keys with the path scheme, this "
"property should be set to the full UTF-8 encoded path of the key, prefixed "
"with the string \"file://\" and ending with a terminating NUL byte. When "
"using PKCS#12 format private keys and the blob scheme, this property should "
"be set to the PKCS#12 data and the \"phase2-private-key-password\" property "
"must be set to password used to decrypt the PKCS#12 certificate and key. "
"When using PKCS#12 files and the path scheme, this property should be set to "
"the full UTF-8 encoded path of the key, prefixed with the string \"file://\" "
"and ending with a terminating NUL byte, and as with the blob scheme the "
"\"phase2-private-key-password\" property must be set to the password used to "
"decode the PKCS#12 private key and certificate."
msgstr ""
"Bevat die \"phase 2\" innerlike private sleutel wanneer die \"phase2-auth\" "
"of \"phase2-autheap\" eienskap op \"tls\" gestel is. Sleutel data word "
"gespesifiseer deur 'n \"scheme\" te gebruik; twee word tans ondersteun: blob "
"en path. Wanneer die blob skema en privaat sleutels gebruik word, moet "
"hierdie eienskap op die sleutel se geënkripteerde PEM geënkodeerde data "
"gestel word. Wanneer private sleutels met die padskema gebruik word, moet "
"hierdie eienskap op die volle UTF-8 gekodeerde pad van die sleutel gestel "
"word, voorafgegaan met die toutjie \"file://\" en eindig met 'n eindigende "
"NUL greep. Wanneer PKCS#12-formaat privaat sleutels en die blobskema gebruik "
"word, moet hierdie eienskap op die PKCS#12-data gestel word en die \"phase2-"
"private-key-password\" eienskap moet gestel word op wagwoord wat gebruik "
"word om die PKCS#12 sertifikaat te dekripteer en sleutel. Wanneer PKCS#12 "
"lêers en die padskema gebruik word, moet hierdie eiendom gestel word op die "
"volle UTF-8 gekodeerde pad van die sleutel, voorafgegaan met die toutjie "
"\"file://\" en eindig met 'n eindigende NUL greep, en soos met die blob "
"skema die \"phase2-private-key-password\" eiendom moet gestel word op die "
"wagwoord wat gebruik word om die PKCS#12 private sleutel en sertifikaat te "
"dekodeer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:69
msgid ""
"The password used to decrypt the \"phase 2\" private key specified in the "
"\"phase2-private-key\" property when the private key either uses the path "
"scheme, or is a PKCS#12 format key."
msgstr ""
"Die wagwoord wat gebruik word om die \"phase 2\" privaat sleutel "
"gespesifiseer in die \"phase2-private-key\" eiendom te dekripteer wanneer "
"die privaat sleutel óf die padskema gebruik, óf 'n PKCS#12 formaat sleutel "
"is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:70
msgid ""
"Flags indicating how to handle the \"phase2-private-key-password\" property."
msgstr ""
"Vlae wat aandui hoe om die \"phase2-private-key-password\" eiendom te "
"hanteer."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:81
msgid ""
"Substring to be matched against the subject of the certificate presented by "
"the authentication server during the inner \"phase 2\" authentication. When "
"unset, no verification of the authentication server certificate's subject is "
"performed.  This property provides little security, if any, and its use is "
"deprecated in favor of NMSetting8021x:phase2-domain-suffix-match."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:72
msgid "PIN used for EAP authentication methods."
msgstr "PIN gebruik vir EAP stawing metodes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:73
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:150
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"pin\" property."
msgstr "Vlae wat aandui hoe om te hanteer die \"pin\" eiendom."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:74
msgid ""
"Contains the private key when the \"eap\" property is set to \"tls\". Key "
"data is specified using a \"scheme\"; two are currently supported: blob and "
"path. When using the blob scheme and private keys, this property should be "
"set to the key's encrypted PEM encoded data. When using private keys with "
"the path scheme, this property should be set to the full UTF-8 encoded path "
"of the key, prefixed with the string \"file://\" and ending with a "
"terminating NUL byte. When using PKCS#12 format private keys and the blob "
"scheme, this property should be set to the PKCS#12 data and the \"private-"
"key-password\" property must be set to password used to decrypt the PKCS#12 "
"certificate and key. When using PKCS#12 files and the path scheme, this "
"property should be set to the full UTF-8 encoded path of the key, prefixed "
"with the string \"file://\" and ending with a terminating NUL byte, and as "
"with the blob scheme the \"private-key-password\" property must be set to "
"the password used to decode the PKCS#12 private key and certificate. "
"WARNING: \"private-key\" is not a \"secret\" property, and thus unencrypted "
"private key data using the BLOB scheme may be readable by unprivileged "
"users.  Private keys should always be encrypted with a private key password "
"to prevent unauthorized access to unencrypted private key data."
msgstr ""
"Bevat die private sleutel wanneer die \"eap\" eiendom op \"tls\" gestel is. "
"Sleutel data word gespesifiseer deur 'n \"scheme\" te gebruik; twee word "
"tans ondersteun: blob en path. Wanneer die blob skema en privaat sleutels "
"gebruik word, moet hierdie eiendom op die sleutel se geënkripteerde PEM-"
"geënkodeerde data gestel word. Wanneer privaat sleutels met die padskema "
"gebruik word, moet hierdie eienskap op die volle UTF-8-gekodeerde pad van "
"die sleutel gestel word, voorafgegaan met die toutjie \"file://\" en eindig "
"met 'n eindigende NUL greep. Wanneer PKCS#12-formaat privaat sleutels en die "
"blob skema gebruik word, moet hierdie eiendom op die PKCS#12 data gestel "
"word en die \"private-key-password\" eiendom moet gestel word op wagwoord "
"wat gebruik word om die PKCS#12-sertifikaat en sleutel te dekripteer. "
"Wanneer PKCS#12 lêers en die padskema gebruik word, moet hierdie eiendom "
"gestel word op die volle UTF-8 gekodeerde pad van die sleutel, voorafgegaan "
"met die toutjie \"file://\" en eindig met 'n eindigende NUL greep, en soos "
"met die blob skema die \"private-key-password\" eiendom moet gestel word op "
"die wagwoord wat gebruik word om die PKCS#12 privaat sleutel en sertifikaat "
"te dekodeer. WAARSKUWING: \"private-key\" is nie 'n \"secret\" eiendom nie, "
"en dus kan ongeënkripteerde privaatsleuteldata wat die BLOB skema gebruik, "
"deur onbevoorregte gebruikers leesbaar wees. Privaat sleutels moet altyd "
"geïnkripteer word met 'n privaat sleutel wagwoord om ongemagtigde toegang "
"tot ongeënkripteerde privaat sleutel data te voorkom."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:75
msgid ""
"The password used to decrypt the private key specified in the \"private-"
"key\" property when the private key either uses the path scheme, or if the "
"private key is a PKCS#12 format key."
msgstr ""
"Die wagwoord wat gebruik word om die privaat sleutel te dekripteer "
"gespesifiseer in die \"private-key\" eiendom wanneer die private sleutel óf "
"die padskema gebruik, of as die privaat sleutel 'n is PKCS#12 formateer "
"sleutel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:76
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"private-key-password\" property."
msgstr ""
"Vlae wat aandui hoe om te hanteer die \"private-key-password\" eiendom."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:87
msgid ""
"Substring to be matched against the subject of the certificate presented by "
"the authentication server. When unset, no verification of the authentication "
"server certificate's subject is performed.  This property provides little "
"security, if any, and its use is deprecated in favor of "
"NMSetting8021x:domain-suffix-match."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:78
msgid ""
"When TRUE, overrides the \"ca-path\" and \"phase2-ca-path\" properties using "
"the system CA directory specified at configure time with the --system-ca-"
"path switch.  The certificates in this directory are added to the "
"verification chain in addition to any certificates specified by the \"ca-"
"cert\" and \"phase2-ca-cert\" properties. If the path provided with --system-"
"ca-path is rather a file name (bundle of trusted CA certificates), it "
"overrides \"ca-cert\" and \"phase2-ca-cert\" properties instead (sets "
"ca_cert/ca_cert2 options for wpa_supplicant)."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer WAAR, ignoreer die \"ca-path\" en \"phase2-ca-path\" eiendomme met "
"behulp van die stelsel CA-gids gespesifiseer tydens die konfigurasietyd met "
"die --system-ca-path  skakelaar. Die sertifikate in hierdie gids word by die "
"verifikasie ketting gevoeg bykomend tot enige sertifikate gespesifiseer deur "
"die \"ca-cert\" en \"phase2-ca-cert\" eiendomme. As die pad wat met --system-"
"ca-path verskaf word eerder 'n lêernaam is (bondel betroubare CA-"
"sertifikate), ignoreer dit eerder \"ca-cert\" en \"phase2-ca-cert\" "
"eienskappe (stel ca_cert/ca_cert2 opsies vir wpa_supplicant )."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:373
msgid ""
"When TRUE, setup the interface to accept packets for all MAC addresses. This "
"is enabling the kernel interface flag IFF_PROMISC. When FALSE, the interface "
"will only accept the packets with the interface destination mac address or "
"broadcast."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer WAAR, stel die koppelvlak op om pakkies vir alle MAC adresse te "
"aanvaar. Dit aktiveer die kernel koppelvlak  vlag IFF_PROMISC. Wanneer "
"ONWAAR, sal die koppelvlak slegs die pakkies met die koppelvlak bestemming "
"Mac adres of uitsending aanvaar."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:374
msgid ""
"When TRUE, enforce auto-negotiation of speed and duplex mode. If \"speed\" "
"and \"duplex\" properties are both specified, only that single mode will be "
"advertised and accepted during the link auto-negotiation process: this works "
"only for BASE-T 802.3 specifications and is useful for enforcing gigabits "
"modes, as in these cases link negotiation is mandatory. When FALSE, "
"\"speed\" and \"duplex\" properties should be both set or link configuration "
"will be skipped."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer WAAR, dwing outo-onderhandeling van spoed en dupleksmodus af. As "
"\"speed\" en \"duplex\" eienskappe albei gespesifiseer word, sal slegs "
"daardie enkelmodus geadverteer en aanvaar word tydens die skakel outo-"
"onderhandeling proses: dit werk slegs vir BASE-T 802.3 spesifikasies en is "
"nuttig om gigabit modusse af te dwing, soos in hierdie gevalle skakel "
"onderhandeling is verpligtend. Wanneer ONWAAR, \"speed\" en \"duplex\" "
"eienskappe moet beide gestel word of skakel konfigurasie sal oorgeslaan word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:375
msgid ""
"If specified, request that the device use this MAC address instead. This is "
"known as MAC cloning or spoofing. Beside explicitly specifying a MAC "
"address, the special values \"preserve\", \"permanent\", \"random\" and "
"\"stable\" are supported. \"preserve\" means not to touch the MAC address on "
"activation. \"permanent\" means to use the permanent hardware address if the "
"device has one (otherwise this is treated as \"preserve\"). \"random\" "
"creates a random MAC address on each connect. \"stable\" creates a hashed "
"MAC address based on connection.stable-id and a machine dependent key. If "
"unspecified, the value can be overwritten via global defaults, see manual of "
"NetworkManager.conf. If still unspecified, it defaults to \"preserve\" "
"(older versions of NetworkManager may use a different default value). On D-"
"Bus, this field is expressed as \"assigned-mac-address\" or the deprecated "
"\"cloned-mac-address\"."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, versoek dat die toestel eerder hierdie MAC adres "
"gebruik. Dit staan bekend as MAC kloning of spoofing. Behalwe om 'n MAC "
"adres uitdruklik te spesifiseer, word die spesiale waardes \"preserve\", "
"\"permanent\", \"random\" en \"stable\" ondersteun. \"preserve\" beteken om "
"nie aan die MAC adres te raak tydens aktivering nie. \"permanent\" beteken "
"om die permanente hardewar adres te gebruik as die toestel een het (anders "
"word dit as \"preserve\" behandel). \"random\" skep 'n ewekansige MAC adres "
"op elke verbinding. \"stable\" skep 'n hashed MAC adres gebaseer op "
"connection.stable-id en 'n masjien afhanklike sleutel. Indien nie "
"gespesifiseer nie, kan die waarde oorgeskryf word via globale verstekke, "
"sien handleiding van NetworkManager.conf. As dit steeds ongespesifiseer is, "
"is dit verstek na \"preserve\" (ouer weergawes van NetworkManager kan 'n "
"ander verstekwaarde gebruik). Op D-Bus word hierdie veld uitgedruk as "
"\"assigned-mac-address\" of die afgekeurde \"cloned-mac-address\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:376
msgid ""
"When a value is set, either \"half\" or \"full\", configures the device to "
"use the specified duplex mode. If \"auto-negotiate\" is \"yes\" the "
"specified duplex mode will be the only one advertised during link "
"negotiation: this works only for BASE-T 802.3 specifications and is useful "
"for enforcing gigabits modes, as in these cases link negotiation is "
"mandatory. If the value is unset (the default), the link configuration will "
"be either skipped (if \"auto-negotiate\" is \"no\", the default) or will be "
"auto-negotiated (if \"auto-negotiate\" is \"yes\") and the local device will "
"advertise all the supported duplex modes. Must be set together with the "
"\"speed\" property if specified. Before specifying a duplex mode be sure "
"your device supports it."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer 'n waarde gestel is, óf \"half\" óf \"full\", konfigureer die "
"toestel om die gespesifiseerde dupleksmodus te gebruik. As "
"\"autonegotiation\" \"yes\" is, sal die gespesifiseerde dupleksmodus die "
"enigste een wees wat tydens skakelonderhandeling geadverteer word: dit werk "
"slegs vir BASE-T 802.3 spesifikasies en is nuttig om gigabit modusse af te "
"dwing, aangesien skakelonderhandeling in hierdie gevalle verpligtend is. As "
"die waarde nie ingestel is nie (die verstek), sal die skakelkonfigurasie óf "
"oorgeslaan word (as \"auto-negotiate\" \"no\" is, die verstek) óf outo-"
"onderhandel word (as \"auto-negotiate\" \"yes\" is) en die plaaslike toestel "
"sal al die ondersteunde dupleksmodusse adverteer. Moet saam met die "
"\"speed\" eiendom gestel word indien gespesifiseer. Voordat jy 'n "
"dupleksmodus spesifiseer, maak seker dat jou toestel dit ondersteun."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:378
msgid ""
"If specified, this connection will only apply to the Ethernet device whose "
"permanent MAC address matches. This property does not change the MAC address "
"of the device (i.e. MAC spoofing)."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, sal hierdie verbinding slegs van toepassing wees op "
"die Ethernet toestel waarvan die permanente MAC adres ooreenstem. Hierdie "
"eiendom verander nie die MAC adres van die toestel nie (d.w.s. MAC spoofing)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:379
msgid ""
"If specified, this connection will never apply to the Ethernet device whose "
"permanent MAC address matches an address in the list.  Each MAC address is "
"in the standard hex-digits-and-colons notation (00:11:22:33:44:55)."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, sal hierdie verbinding nooit van toepassing wees op "
"die Ethernet toestel waarvan die permanente MAC adres ooreenstem met 'n "
"adres in die lys nie. Elke MAC-adres is in die standaard heks-syfer-en-"
"dubbelpunte notasie (00:11:22:33:44:55)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:381
msgid ""
"Specific port type to use if the device supports multiple attachment "
"methods.  One of \"tp\" (Twisted Pair), \"aui\" (Attachment Unit Interface), "
"\"bnc\" (Thin Ethernet) or \"mii\" (Media Independent Interface). If the "
"device supports only one port type, this setting is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Spesifieke poort tipe om te gebruik as die toestel veelvuldige aanhegting "
"metodes ondersteun. Een van \"tp\" (Verdraaide Paar), \"aui\" (Aanhegsel "
"Eenheid Koppelvlak), \"bnc\" (Dun Ethernet) of \"mii\" (Media Onafhanklike "
"Koppelvlak). As die toestel slegs een poort tipe ondersteun, word hierdie "
"instelling geïgnoreer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:382
msgid ""
"s390 network device type; one of \"qeth\", \"lcs\", or \"ctc\", representing "
"the different types of virtual network devices available on s390 systems."
msgstr ""
"s390 netwerk toestel tipe; een van \"qeth\", \"lcs\" of \"ctc\", wat die "
"verskillende tipes virtuele netwerk toestelle wat op s390 stelsels "
"beskikbaar is verteenwoordig."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:383
msgid ""
"Dictionary of key/value pairs of s390-specific device options.  Both keys "
"and values must be strings.  Allowed keys include \"portno\", \"layer2\", "
"\"portname\", \"protocol\", among others.  Key names must contain only "
"alphanumeric characters (ie, [a-zA-Z0-9]). Currently, NetworkManager itself "
"does nothing with this information. However, s390utils ships a udev rule "
"which parses this information and applies it to the interface."
msgstr ""
"Woordeboek van sleutel/waarde pare van s390-spesifieke toestel opsies. Beide "
"sleutels en waardes moet toutjies wees. Toegelate sleutels sluit onder "
"andere \"portno\", \"layer2\", \"portname\", \"protocol\" in. Sleutel name "
"moet slegs alfanumeriese karakters bevat (dws [a-zA-Z0-9]). Tans, doen "
"NetwerkBestuurder self niks met hierdie inligting nie. s390utils stuur egter "
"'n udev-reël wat hierdie inligting ontleed en dit op die koppelvlak toepas."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:384
msgid ""
"Identifies specific subchannels that this network device uses for "
"communication with z/VM or s390 host.  Like the \"mac-address\" property for "
"non-z/VM devices, this property can be used to ensure this connection only "
"applies to the network device that uses these subchannels.  The list should "
"contain exactly 3 strings, and each string may only be composed of "
"hexadecimal characters and the period (.) character."
msgstr ""
"Identifiseer spesifieke subkanale wat hierdie netwerk toestel gebruik vir "
"kommunikasie met z/VM of s390 gasheer. Soos die \"mac-address\" eiendom vir "
"nie-z/VM toestelle, kan hierdie eiendom gebruik word om te verseker dat "
"hierdie verbinding slegs van toepassing is op die netwerk toestel wat "
"hierdie subkanale gebruik. Die lys moet presies 3 toutjies bevat, en elke "
"string mag slegs saamgestel word uit heksadesimale karakters en die punt (.) "
"karakter."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:385
msgid ""
"When a value greater than 0 is set, configures the device to use the "
"specified speed. If \"auto-negotiate\" is \"yes\" the specified speed will "
"be the only one advertised during link negotiation: this works only for BASE-"
"T 802.3 specifications and is useful for enforcing gigabit speeds, as in "
"this case link negotiation is mandatory. If the value is unset (0, the "
"default), the link configuration will be either skipped (if \"auto-"
"negotiate\" is \"no\", the default) or will be auto-negotiated (if \"auto-"
"negotiate\" is \"yes\") and the local device will advertise all the "
"supported speeds. In Mbit/s, ie 100 == 100Mbit/s. Must be set together with "
"the \"duplex\" property when non-zero. Before specifying a speed value be "
"sure your device supports it."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer 'n waarde groter as 0 gestel word, konfigureer die toestel om die "
"gespesifiseerde spoed te gebruik. Indien \"auto-negotiate\" is \"yes\" die "
"gespesifiseerde spoed sal die enigste een wees geadverteer tydens skakel "
"onderhandeling: hierdie werk slegs vir BASE-T 802.3 spesifikasies en is "
"nuttig om gigabit snelhede af te dwing, soos in hierdie geval skakel "
"onderhandeling verpligtend is. Indien die waarde is unset (0, die verstek), "
"die skakel konfigurasie sal óf oorgeslaan word (indien \"auto-negotiate\" is "
"\"no\", die verstek) ofsal wees outo-onderhandel (indien \"auto-negotiate\" "
"is \"yes\") en die plaaslike toestel sal al die ondersteunde snelhede "
"adverteer. In Mbit/s, ie 100 == 100Mbit/s. Moet wees gestel-bymekaar met die "
"\"duplex\" eiendom wanneer nie-nul. Voordat jy 'n spoed waarde spesifiseer, "
"maak seker dat jou toestel dit ondersteun."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:386
msgid ""
"The NMSettingWiredWakeOnLan options to enable. Not all devices support all "
"options. May be any combination of NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_PHY (0x2), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_UNICAST (0x4), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_MULTICAST (0x8), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_BROADCAST (0x10), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_ARP (0x20), NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_MAGIC "
"(0x40) or the special values NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_DEFAULT (0x1) (to "
"use global settings) and NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_IGNORE (0x8000) (to "
"disable management of Wake-on-LAN in NetworkManager)."
msgstr ""
"Die NMSettingWiredWakeOnLan opsies om te aktiveer. Nie alle toestelle "
"ondersteun alle opsies nie. Mag enige kombinasie van wees "
"NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_PHY (0x2), NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_UNICAST "
"(0x4), NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_MULTICAST (0x8), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_BROADCAST (0x10), "
"NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_ARP (0x20), NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_MAGIC "
"(0x40) of die spesiale waardes NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_DEFAULT (0x1) "
"(om globale instellings te gebruik) en NM_SETTING_WIRED_WAKE_ON_LAN_IGNORE "
"(0x8000) (om deaktiveer bestuur van Wake-on-LAN in NetwerkBestuurder)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:387
msgid ""
"If specified, the password used with magic-packet-based Wake-on-LAN, "
"represented as an Ethernet MAC address.  If NULL, no password will be "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, die wagwoord wat gebruik word met magic-packet-based "
"Wake-on-LAN, verteenwoordig as 'n Ethernet MAC adres. Indien NULL, sal geen "
"wagwoord vereis word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:79
msgid "Encapsulation of ADSL connection.  Can be \"vcmux\" or \"llc\"."
msgstr "Enkapsulasie van ADSL konneksie.  Kan wees \"vcmux\" of \"llc\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:80
msgid "Password used to authenticate with the ADSL service."
msgstr "Wagwoord gebruik om te outentiseer met die ADSL diens."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:82
msgid "ADSL connection protocol.  Can be \"pppoa\", \"pppoe\" or \"ipoatm\"."
msgstr ""
"ADSL konneksie protokol.  Kan wees \"pppoa\", \"pppoe\" of \"ipoatm\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:83
msgid "Username used to authenticate with the ADSL service."
msgstr "Gebruikersnaam gebruik om te outentiseer met die ADSL diens."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:84
msgid "VCI of ADSL connection"
msgstr "VCI van ADSL konneksie"

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:85
msgid "VPI of ADSL connection"
msgstr "VPI van ADSL konneksie"

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:86
msgid "The Bluetooth address of the device."
msgstr "Die Bluetooth adres van die toestel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:87
msgid ""
"Either \"dun\" for Dial-Up Networking connections or \"panu\" for Personal "
"Area Networking connections to devices supporting the NAP profile."
msgstr ""
"Óf \"dun\" vir inbelnetwerkverbindings of \"panu\" vir persoonlike area "
"netwerk verbindings na toestelle wat die NAP profiel ondersteun."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:88
msgid ""
"Dictionary of key/value pairs of bonding options.  Both keys and values must "
"be strings. Option names must contain only alphanumeric characters (ie, [a-"
"zA-Z0-9])."
msgstr ""
"Woordeboek van sleutel/waarde pare van binding opsies. Beide sleutels en "
"waardes moet toutjies wees. Opsiename moet slegs alfanumeriese karakters "
"bevat (dws [a-zA-Z0-9])."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:439
msgid ""
"The queue ID of this bond port. The maximum value of queue ID is the number "
"of TX queues currently active in device."
msgstr ""
"Die tou ID van hierdie verbandpoort. Die maksimum waarde van tou ID is die "
"aantal TX toue wat tans aktief is in toestel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:89
msgid "The Ethernet MAC address aging time, in seconds."
msgstr "Die Ethernet MAC adres veroudering tyd, in sekondes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:90
msgid "The Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) forwarding delay, in seconds."
msgstr "Die Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) aanstuur vertraging, in sekondes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:91
msgid ""
"If specified, The MAC address of the multicast group this bridge uses for "
"STP. The address must be a link-local address in standard Ethernet MAC "
"address format, ie an address of the form 01:80:C2:00:00:0X, with X in [0, "
"4..F]. If not specified the default value is 01:80:C2:00:00:00."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, Die MAC adres van die multicast groep wat hierdie brug "
"vir STP gebruik. Die adres moet 'n skakel-plaaslike adres in standaard "
"Ethernet MAC adres formaat wees, dws 'n adres van die vorm "
"01:80:C2:00:00:0X, met X in [0, 4..F]. Indien nie gespesifiseer nie, is die "
"verstek waarde 01:80:C2:00:00:00."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:92
msgid ""
"A mask of group addresses to forward. Usually, group addresses in the range "
"from 01:80:C2:00:00:00 to 01:80:C2:00:00:0F are not forwarded according to "
"standards. This property is a mask of 16 bits, each corresponding to a group "
"address in that range that must be forwarded. The mask can't have bits 0, 1 "
"or 2 set because they are used for STP, MAC pause frames and LACP."
msgstr ""
"'n Masker van groepadresse om aan te stuur. Gewoonlik word groep adresse in "
"die reeks van 01:80:C2:00:00:00 tot 01:80:C2:00:00:0F nie volgens standaarde "
"aangestuur nie. Hierdie eiendom is 'n masker van 16 bisse, wat elk "
"ooreenstem met 'n groepadres in daardie reeks wat aangestuur moet word. Die "
"masker kan nie stukkies 0, 1 of 2 gestel hê nie, want hulle word gebruik vir "
"STP, MAC pouse rame en LACP."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:93
msgid "The Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) hello time, in seconds."
msgstr "Die Spanning Boom Protokol (STP) hallo tyd, in sekondes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:94
msgid ""
"If specified, the MAC address of bridge. When creating a new bridge, this "
"MAC address will be set. If this field is left unspecified, the "
"\"ethernet.cloned-mac-address\" is referred instead to generate the initial "
"MAC address. Note that setting \"ethernet.cloned-mac-address\" anyway "
"overwrites the MAC address of the bridge later while activating the bridge. "
"Hence, this property is deprecated. Deprecated: 1"
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:95
msgid "The Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) maximum message age, in seconds."
msgstr ""
"Die Spanning Boom Protokol (STP) maksimum boodskap ouderdom, in sekondes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:96
msgid ""
"Set maximum size of multicast hash table (value must be a power of 2)."
msgstr ""
"Stel maksimum grootte van multicast hash tabel (waarde moet 'n mag van 2 "
"wees)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:97
msgid ""
"Set the number of queries the bridge will send before stopping forwarding a "
"multicast group after a \"leave\" message has been received."
msgstr ""
"Stel die aantal navrae wat die brug sal stuur voordat die aanstuur van 'n "
"multicast groep gestop word nadat 'n \"leave\" boodskap ontvang is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:98
msgid ""
"Set interval (in deciseconds) between queries to find remaining members of a "
"group, after a \"leave\" message is received."
msgstr ""
"Stel interval (in besluite sekondes) tussen navrae om oorblywende lede van "
"'n groep te vind, nadat 'n \"leave\" boodskap ontvang is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:99
msgid ""
"Set delay (in deciseconds) after which the bridge will leave a group, if no "
"membership reports for this group are received."
msgstr ""
"Stel vertraging (in besluite sekondes) in waarna die brug 'n groep sal "
"verlaat, indien geen lidmaatskap verslae vir hierdie groep ontvang word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:100
msgid ""
"Enable or disable sending of multicast queries by the bridge. If not "
"specified the option is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer of deaktiveer die stuur van multicast navrae deur die brug. Indien "
"nie gespesifiseer nie, is die opsie gedeaktiveer"

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:101
msgid ""
"If no queries are seen after this delay (in deciseconds) has passed, the "
"bridge will start to send its own queries."
msgstr ""
"Indien geen navrae gesien word nadat hierdie vertraging (in besluite "
"sekondes) verby is nie, sal die brug begin om sy eie navrae te stuur."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:102
msgid ""
"Interval (in deciseconds) between queries sent by the bridge after the end "
"of the startup phase."
msgstr ""
"Interval (in besluite sekondes) tussen navrae wat deur die brug gestuur is "
"na die einde van die opstart fase."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:103
msgid ""
"Set the Max Response Time/Max Response Delay (in deciseconds) for IGMP/MLD "
"queries sent by the bridge."
msgstr ""
"Stel die maksimum reaksietyd/maksimum reaksievertraging (in besluite "
"sekondes) vir IGMP/MLD navrae wat deur die brug gestuur word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:104
msgid ""
"If enabled the bridge's own IP address is used as the source address for "
"IGMP queries otherwise the default of 0.0.0.0 is used."
msgstr ""
"Indien geaktiveer word die brug se eie IP adres as die bronadres vir IGMP "
"navrae gebruik, anders word die verstek van 0.0.0.0 gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:105
msgid ""
"Sets bridge's multicast router. Multicast-snooping must be enabled for this "
"option to work. Supported values are: 'auto', 'disabled', 'enabled' to which "
"kernel assigns the numbers 1, 0, and 2, respectively. If not specified the "
"default value is 'auto' (1)."
msgstr ""
"Stel brug se multicast-roeteerder. Multicast-snuffel moet geaktiveer wees "
"vir hierdie opsie om te werk. Ondersteunde waardes is: 'auto', 'disabled', "
"'enabled' waaraan kernel die nommers 1, 0 en 2 onderskeidelik toeken. Indien "
"nie gespesifiseer nie, is die verstekwaarde 'auto' (1)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:106
msgid ""
"Controls whether IGMP snooping is enabled for this bridge. Note that if "
"snooping was automatically disabled due to hash collisions, the system may "
"refuse to enable the feature until the collisions are resolved."
msgstr ""
"Beheer of IGMP snooping vir hierdie brug geaktiveer is. Let daarop dat as "
"snooping is outomaties gedeaktiveer as gevolg van hash botsings, kan die "
"stelsel weier om die funksie in staat te stel totdat die botsings opgelos."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:107
msgid "Set the number of IGMP queries to send during startup phase."
msgstr ""
"Stel die aantal IGMP navrae wat tydens die opstart fase gestuur moet word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:108
msgid ""
"Sets the time (in deciseconds) between queries sent out at startup to "
"determine membership information."
msgstr ""
"Stel die tyd (in besluite sekondes) tussen navrae wat by opstart uitgestuur "
"word om lidmaatskap inligting te bepaal."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:109
msgid ""
"Sets the Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) priority for this bridge.  Lower "
"values are \"better\"; the lowest priority bridge will be elected the root "
"bridge."
msgstr ""
"Stel die Spanning Boom Protokol (STP) prioriteit vir hierdie brug. Laer "
"waardes is \"better\"; die laagste prioriteit brug sal as die wortelbrug "
"gekies word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:110
msgid ""
"Controls whether Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) is enabled for this bridge."
msgstr ""
"Beheer of Spanning Boom Protokol (STP) vir hierdie brug geaktiveer is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:111
msgid ""
"The default PVID for the ports of the bridge, that is the VLAN id assigned "
"to incoming untagged frames."
msgstr ""
"Die verstek PVID vir die poorte van die brug, dit is die VLAN id wat aan "
"inkomende untagged rame toegewys is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:112
msgid "Control whether VLAN filtering is enabled on the bridge."
msgstr "Beheer of VLAN filtrering op die brug geaktiveer is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:113
msgid ""
"If specified, the protocol used for VLAN filtering. Supported values are: "
"'802.1Q', '802.1ad'. If not specified the default value is '802.1Q'."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, die protokol wat vir VLAN filtrering gebruik word. "
"Ondersteunde waardes is: '802.1Q', '802.1ad'. Indien nie gespesifiseer nie, "
"is die verstekwaarde '802.1Q'."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:114
msgid "Controls whether per-VLAN stats accounting is enabled."
msgstr "Beheer of per-VLAN stats rekeningkunde geaktiveer is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:115
msgid ""
"Array of bridge VLAN objects. In addition to the VLANs specified here, the "
"bridge will also have the default-pvid VLAN configured  by the bridge.vlan-"
"default-pvid property. In nmcli the VLAN list can be specified with the "
"following syntax: $vid [pvid] [untagged] [, $vid [pvid] [untagged]]... where "
"$vid is either a single id between 1 and 4094 or a range, represented as a "
"couple of ids separated by a dash."
msgstr ""
"Skikking van brug-VLAN-voorwerpe. Benewens die VLAN's wat hier gespesifiseer "
"word, sal die brug ook die verstek-pvid-VLAN hê wat deur die bridge.vlan-"
"default-pvid eiendom opgestel is. In nmcli kan die VLAN lys gespesifiseer "
"word met die volgende sintaksis: $vid [pvid] [untagged] [, $vid [pvid] "
"[untagged]]... waar $vid óf 'n enkele id tussen 1 en 4094 óf 'n reeks is , "
"voorgestel as 'n paar ID's geskei deur 'n streep."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:116
msgid ""
"Enables or disables \"hairpin mode\" for the port, which allows frames to be "
"sent back out through the port the frame was received on."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer of deaktiveer \"hairpin mode\" vir die poort, wat toelaat dat rame "
"teruggestuur word deur die poort waarop die raam ontvang is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:117
msgid ""
"The Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) port cost for destinations via this port."
msgstr ""
"Die Spanning Boom Protokol (STP) poort koste vir bestemmings via hierdie "
"poort."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:118
msgid "The Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) priority of this bridge port."
msgstr "Die Spanning Boom Protokol (STP) prioriteit van hierdie brugpoort."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:119
msgid ""
"Array of bridge VLAN objects. In addition to the VLANs specified here, the "
"port will also have the default-pvid VLAN configured on the bridge by the "
"bridge.vlan-default-pvid property. In nmcli the VLAN list can be specified "
"with the following syntax: $vid [pvid] [untagged] [, $vid [pvid] "
"[untagged]]... where $vid is either a single id between 1 and 4094 or a "
"range, represented as a couple of ids separated by a dash."
msgstr ""
"Skikking van brug-VLAN voorwerpe. Benewens die VLAN's wat hier gespesifiseer "
"word, sal die poort ook die verstek-pvid-VLAN op die brug gekonfigureer hê "
"deur die bridge.vlan-default-pvid eiendom. In nmcli kan die VLAN lys "
"gespesifiseer word met die volgende sintaksis: $vid [pvid] [untagged] [, "
"$vid [pvid] [untagged]]... waar $vid óf 'n enkele id tussen 1 en 4094 óf 'n "
"reeks is , voorgestel as 'n paar ID's geskei deur 'n streep."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:120
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:144
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:155
msgid ""
"If non-zero, only transmit packets of the specified size or smaller, "
"breaking larger packets up into multiple frames."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, stuur slegs pakkies van die gespesifiseerde grootte of "
"kleiner, en breek groter pakkies op in veelvuldige rame."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:121
msgid ""
"The number to dial to establish the connection to the CDMA-based mobile "
"broadband network, if any.  If not specified, the default number (#777) is "
"used when required."
msgstr ""
"Die nommer om te skakel om die verbinding met die CDMA-gebaseerde mobiele "
"breëband netwerk te bewerkstellig, indien enige. Indien nie gespesifiseer "
"nie, word die versteknommer (#777) gebruik wanneer nodig."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:122
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:147
msgid ""
"The password used to authenticate with the network, if required.  Many "
"providers do not require a password, or accept any password.  But if a "
"password is required, it is specified here."
msgstr ""
"Die wagwoord wat gebruik word om met die netwerk te verifieer, indien nodig. "
"Baie verskaffers benodig nie 'n wagwoord nie, of aanvaar enige wagwoord. "
"Maar as 'n wagwoord vereis word, word dit hier gespesifiseer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:124
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:153
msgid ""
"The username used to authenticate with the network, if required.  Many "
"providers do not require a username, or accept any username.  But if a "
"username is required, it is specified here."
msgstr ""
"Die gebruikernaam wat gebruik word om met die netwerk te verifieer, indien "
"nodig. Baie outentiseer benodig nie 'n gebruikersnaam nie, of aanvaar enige "
"gebruikersnaam. Maar as 'n gebruikersnaam vereis word, word dit hier "
"gespesifiseer."

#. Generated file. Do not edit.
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:3
msgid ""
"The number of retries for the authentication. Zero means to try "
"indefinitely; -1 means to use a global default. If the global default is not "
"set, the authentication retries for 3 times before failing the connection. "
"Currently, this only applies to 802-1x authentication."
msgstr ""
"Die aantal herproberings vir die stawing. Nul beteken om onbepaald te "
"probeer; -1 beteken om 'n globale verstek te gebruik. Indien die globale "
"verstek nie gestel is nie, die stawing herprobeer vir 3 keer voor die "
"verbinding misluk. Tans, dit geld slegs vir 802-1x stawing."

#: ../src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:155
msgid ""
"Whether or not the connection should be automatically connected by "
"NetworkManager when the resources for the connection are available. TRUE to "
"automatically activate the connection, FALSE to require manual intervention "
"to activate the connection. Autoconnect happens when the circumstances are "
"suitable. That means for example that the device is currently managed and "
"not active. Autoconnect thus never replaces or competes with an already "
"active profile. Note that autoconnect is not implemented for VPN profiles. "
"See \"secondaries\" as an alternative to automatically connect VPN profiles."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:5
msgid ""
"The autoconnect priority in range -999 to 999. If the connection is set to "
"autoconnect, connections with higher priority will be preferred. The higher "
"number means higher priority. Defaults to 0. Note that this property only "
"matters if there are more than one candidate profile to select for "
"autoconnect. In case of equal priority, the profile used most recently is "
"chosen."
msgstr ""
"Die outokoppelprioriteit in reeks -999 tot 999. As die verbinding op "
"outokoppel gestel is, sal verbindings met hoër prioriteit voorkeur geniet. "
"Die hoër getal beteken hoër prioriteit. Verstek op 0. Let daarop dat hierdie "
"eienskap slegs saak maak as daar meer as een kandidaatprofiel is om te kies "
"vir outo-verbinding. In geval van gelyke prioriteit, word die profiel wat "
"mees onlangs gebruik is, gekies."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:6
msgid ""
"The number of times a connection should be tried when autoactivating before "
"giving up. Zero means forever, -1 means the global default (4 times if not "
"overridden). Setting this to 1 means to try activation only once before "
"blocking autoconnect. Note that after a timeout, NetworkManager will try to "
"autoconnect again."
msgstr ""
"Die aantal kere wat 'n verbinding probeer moet word wanneer dit outomaties "
"geaktiveer word voordat dit opgee. Nul beteken vir ewig, -1 beteken die "
"globale verstek (4 keer indien nie oorskryf nie). Deur dit op 1 te stel, "
"beteken dit om net een keer te probeer aktivering voordat outomatiese "
"verbinding geblokkeer word. Let daarop dat NetworkManager na 'n uitteltyd "
"weer sal probeer om outomaties te koppel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:7
msgid ""
"Whether or not slaves of this connection should be automatically brought up "
"when NetworkManager activates this connection. This only has a real effect "
"for master connections. The properties \"autoconnect\", \"autoconnect-"
"priority\" and \"autoconnect-retries\" are unrelated to this setting. The "
"permitted values are: 0: leave slave connections untouched, 1: activate all "
"the slave connections with this connection, -1: default. If -1 (default) is "
"set, global connection.autoconnect-slaves is read to determine the real "
"value. If it is default as well, this fallbacks to 0."
msgstr ""
"Whether of nie slawe van hierdie verband moet outomaties opgebring word "
"wanneer NetwerkBestuurder aktiveer hierdie verbinding. Dit het slegs 'n "
"werklike effek vir meester verbindings. Die eiendomme \"autoconnect\", "
"\"autoconnect-priority\" en \"autoconnect-retries\" is nie verwant aan "
"hierdie instelling nie. Die toegelate waardes is: 0: laat slaweverbindings "
"onaangeraak, 1: aktiveer al die slaafverbindings met hierdie verbinding, -1: "
"verstek. As -1 (verstek) gestel is, globaal connection.autoconnect-slaves "
"word gelees om die werklike waarde te bepaal. As dit ook verstek is, val dit "
"terug na 0."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:8
msgid ""
"Whether DNSOverTls (dns-over-tls) is enabled for the connection. DNSOverTls "
"is a technology which uses TLS to encrypt dns traffic. The permitted values "
"are: \"yes\" (2) use DNSOverTls and disabled fallback, \"opportunistic\" (1) "
"use DNSOverTls but allow fallback to unencrypted resolution, \"no\" (0) "
"don't ever use DNSOverTls. If unspecified \"default\" depends on the plugin "
"used. Systemd-resolved uses global setting. This feature requires a plugin "
"which supports DNSOverTls. Otherwise, the setting has no effect. One such "
"plugin is dns-systemd-resolved."
msgstr ""
"Whether DNSOverTls (dns-over-tls) is geaktiveer vir die verbinding. "
"DNSOverTls is 'n tegnologie wat TLS gebruik om dns verkeer te enkripteer. "
"Die toegelate waardes is: \"yes\" (2) gebruik DNSOverTls en gestremde "
"fallback, \"opportunistic\" (1) gebruik DNSOverTls maar laat terugval na "
"ongeënkripteerde resolusie toe, \"no\" (0) nooit gebruik nie DNSOverTls. "
"Indien ongespesifiseer \"default\" hang af van die inprop wat gebruik word. "
"Systemd-resolved gebruik globale omgewing. Hierdie kenmerk vereis 'n inprop "
"wat ondersteun DNSOverTls. Andersins het die instelling geen effek nie. Een "
"so 'n inprop is dns-systemd-resolved."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:9
msgid ""
"If greater than zero, delay success of IP addressing until either the "
"timeout is reached, or an IP gateway replies to a ping."
msgstr ""
"Indien groter as nul, vertraag sukses van IP adressering totdat óf die "
"uitteltyd bereik is, óf 'n IP gateway antwoord op 'n ping."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:10
msgid ""
"A human readable unique identifier for the connection, like \"Work Wi-Fi\" "
"or \"T-Mobile 3G\"."
msgstr ""
"'n Menslike leesbare unieke identifiseerder vir die verbinding, soos \"Work "
"Wi-Fi\" of \"T-Mobile 3G\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:11
msgid ""
"The name of the network interface this connection is bound to. If not set, "
"then the connection can be attached to any interface of the appropriate type "
"(subject to restrictions imposed by other settings). For software devices "
"this specifies the name of the created device. For connection types where "
"interface names cannot easily be made persistent (e.g. mobile broadband or "
"USB Ethernet), this property should not be used. Setting this property "
"restricts the interfaces a connection can be used with, and if interface "
"names change or are reordered the connection may be applied to the wrong "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Die naam van die netwerkkoppelvlak waaraan hierdie verbinding gebonde is. As "
"dit nie gestel is nie, kan die verbinding aan enige koppelvlak van die "
"toepaslike tipe gekoppel word (onderhewig aan beperkings wat deur ander "
"instellings opgelê word). Vir sagteware-toestelle spesifiseer dit die naam "
"van die geskepte toestel. Vir verbindingtipes waar koppelvlakname nie maklik "
"bestendig gemaak kan word nie (bv. mobiele breëband of USB Ethernet), moet "
"hierdie eienskap nie gebruik word nie. Die instelling van hierdie eienskap "
"beperk die koppelvlakke waarmee 'n verbinding gebruik kan word, en as "
"koppelvlakname verander of herrangskik word, kan die verbinding op die "
"verkeerde koppelvlak toegepas word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:12
msgid "Whether LLDP is enabled for the connection."
msgstr "Whether LLDP vir die verbinding geaktiveer is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:13
msgid ""
"Whether Link-Local Multicast Name Resolution (LLMNR) is enabled for the "
"connection. LLMNR is a protocol based on the Domain Name System (DNS) packet "
"format that allows both IPv4 and IPv6 hosts to perform name resolution for "
"hosts on the same local link. The permitted values are: \"yes\" (2) register "
"hostname and resolving for the connection, \"no\" (0) disable LLMNR for the "
"interface, \"resolve\" (1) do not register hostname but allow resolving of "
"LLMNR host names If unspecified, \"default\" ultimately depends on the DNS "
"plugin (which for systemd-resolved currently means \"yes\"). This feature "
"requires a plugin which supports LLMNR. Otherwise, the setting has no "
"effect. One such plugin is dns-systemd-resolved."
msgstr ""
"Whether Link-Local Multicast Name Resolution (LLMNR) is vir die verbinding "
"geaktiveer. LLMNR is 'n protokol gebaseer op die Domain Name System (DNS) "
"pakkieformaat wat beide IPv4- en IPv6-gashere toelaat om naamresolusie vir "
"gashere op dieselfde plaaslike skakel uit te voer. Die toegelate waardes "
"is:\"yes\" (2) registreer gasheernaam en die oplossing vir die verbinding, "
"\"no\" (0) deaktiveer LLMNR vir die koppelvlak, \"resolve\" (1) moenie "
"gasheernaam registreer nie, maar laat die oplossing van LLMNR-gasheername "
"toe. Indien ongespesifiseer, \"default\" hang uiteindelik af van die DNS-"
"inprop (wat tans vir systemd-resolved beteken \"yes\"). Hierdie kenmerk "
"vereis 'n inprop wat LLMNR ondersteun. Andersins het die instelling geen "
"effek nie. Een so 'n inprop is dns-systemd-resolved."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:14
msgid "Interface name of the master device or UUID of the master connection."
msgstr "Koppelvlaknaam van die hooftoestel of UUID van die hoofverbinding."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:15
msgid ""
"Whether mDNS is enabled for the connection. The permitted values are: "
"\"yes\" (2) register hostname and resolving for the connection, \"no\" (0) "
"disable mDNS for the interface, \"resolve\" (1) do not register hostname but "
"allow resolving of mDNS host names and \"default\" (-1) to allow lookup of a "
"global default in NetworkManager.conf. If unspecified, \"default\" "
"ultimately depends on the DNS plugin (which for systemd-resolved currently "
"means \"no\"). This feature requires a plugin which supports mDNS. "
"Otherwise, the setting has no effect. One such plugin is dns-systemd-"
"resolved."
msgstr ""
"Whether mDNS is geaktiveer vir die verbinding. Die toegelate waardes is: "
"\"yes\" (2) registreer gasheernaam en die oplossing vir die verbinding, "
"\"no\" (0) deaktiveer mDNS vir die koppelvlak, \"resolve\" (1) moenie "
"gasheernaam registreer nie, maar laat die oplossing van toe mDNS gasheername "
"en \"default\" (-1) om opsoek van 'n globale verstek te laat in "
"NetworkManager.conf. Indien ongespesifiseer, \"default\" hang uiteindelik af "
"van die DNS-inprop (wat vir systemd-resolved tans beteken \"no\"). Hierdie "
"kenmerk vereis 'n inprop wat ondersteun mDNS. Andersins het die instelling "
"geen effek nie. Een so 'n inprop is dns-systemd-resolved."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:16
msgid ""
"Whether the connection is metered. When updating this property on a "
"currently activated connection, the change takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"Whether die verbinding is gemeter. Wanneer hierdie eiendom op 'n tans "
"geaktiveerde verbinding bygewerk word, tree die verandering onmiddellik in "
"werking."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:18
msgid ""
"If configured, set to a Manufacturer Usage Description (MUD) URL that points "
"to manufacturer-recommended network policies for IoT devices. It is "
"transmitted as a DHCPv4 or DHCPv6 option. The value must be a valid URL "
"starting with \"https://\". The special value \"none\" is allowed to "
"indicate that no MUD URL is used. If the per-profile value is unspecified "
"(the default), a global connection default gets consulted. If still "
"unspecified, the ultimate default is \"none\"."
msgstr ""
"Indien gekonfigureer, stel dit op 'n Vervaardiger Gebruiksbeskrywing (MUD) "
"URL wat verwys na vervaardiger-aanbevole netwerkbeleide vir IoT toestelle. "
"Dit word as 'n DHCPv4- of DHCPv6-opsie oorgedra. Die waarde moet 'n geldige "
"URL wees wat met \"https://\" begin. Die spesiale waarde \"none\" word "
"toegelaat om aan te dui dat geen MUD URL gebruik word nie. As die per-"
"profiel waarde ongespesifiseer is (die verstek), word 'n globale verbinding "
"verstek geraadpleeg. As dit steeds ongespesifiseer is, is die uiteindelike "
"verstek \"none\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:19
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the profile can be active multiple times at a particular "
"moment. The value is of type NMConnectionMultiConnect."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer of die profiel verskeie kere op 'n spesifieke oomblik aktief kan "
"wees. Die waarde is van tipe NMConnectionMultiConnect."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:20
msgid ""
"An array of strings defining what access a given user has to this "
"connection.  If this is NULL or empty, all users are allowed to access this "
"connection; otherwise users are allowed if and only if they are in this "
"list.  When this is not empty, the connection can be active only when one of "
"the specified users is logged into an active session.  Each entry is of the "
"form \"[type]:[id]:[reserved]\"; for example, \"user:dcbw:blah\". At this "
"time only the \"user\" [type] is allowed.  Any other values are ignored and "
"reserved for future use.  [id] is the username that this permission refers "
"to, which may not contain the \":\" character. Any [reserved] information "
"present must be ignored and is reserved for future use.  All of [type], "
"[id], and [reserved] must be valid UTF-8."
msgstr ""
"'n Reeks toutjies wat definieer watter toegang 'n gegewe gebruiker tot "
"hierdie verbinding het.  Indien dit is NULL of leeg, alle gebruikers word "
"toegelaat om toegang tot hierdie verbinding te verkry; anders word "
"gebruikers toegelaat as en slegs as hulle in hierdie lys is.  Wanneer dit "
"nie leeg is nie, die verbinding kan slegs aktief wees wanneer een van die "
"gespesifiseerde gebruikers by 'n aktiewe sessie aangemeld is. Elke "
"inskrywing is van die vorm \"[type]:[id]:[reserved]\"; byvoorbeeld, "
"\"user:dcbw:blah\". Op hierdie tydstip slegs die \"user\" [tipe] is "
"toegelaat.  Enige ander waardes word geïgnoreer en gereserveer vir "
"toekomstige gebruik.  [id] is die gebruikersnaam waarna hierdie toestemming "
"verwys, wat nie mag bevat die \":\" karakter. Enige [gereserveerde] "
"inligting teenwoordig moet geïgnoreer word en word gereserveer vir "
"toekomstige gebruik.  Alle van [type], [id], en [reserved] moet geldige UTF-"
"8 wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:21
msgid ""
"FALSE if the connection can be modified using the provided settings "
"service's D-Bus interface with the right privileges, or TRUE if the "
"connection is read-only and cannot be modified."
msgstr ""
"ONWAAR as die verbinding gewysig kan word deur die verskafde "
"instellingsdiens se D-Bus-koppelvlak met die regte voorregte te gebruik, of "
"WAAR as die verbinding leesalleen is en nie gewysig kan word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:22
msgid ""
"List of connection UUIDs that should be activated when the base connection "
"itself is activated. Currently, only VPN connections are supported."
msgstr ""
"Lys van verbinding-UUID's wat geaktiveer moet word wanneer die "
"basisverbinding self geaktiveer word. Tans word slegs VPN-verbindings "
"ondersteun."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:23
msgid ""
"Setting name of the device type of this slave's master connection (eg, "
"\"bond\"), or NULL if this connection is not a slave."
msgstr ""
"Stel naam van die toesteltipe van hierdie slaaf se hoofverbinding (bv. "
"\"bond\"), of NULL as hierdie verbinding nie 'n slaaf is nie."

#: ../src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:174
msgid ""
"This represents the identity of the connection used for various purposes. It "
"allows to configure multiple profiles to share the identity. Also, the "
"stable-id can contain placeholders that are substituted dynamically and "
"deterministically depending on the context. The stable-id is used for "
"generating IPv6 stable private addresses with ipv6.addr-gen-mode=stable-"
"privacy. It is also used to seed the generated cloned MAC address for "
"ethernet.cloned-mac-address=stable and wifi.cloned-mac-address=stable. It is "
"also used as DHCP client identifier with ipv4.dhcp-client-id=stable and to "
"derive the DHCP DUID with ipv6.dhcp-duid=stable-[llt,ll,uuid]. Note that "
"depending on the context where it is used, other parameters are also seeded "
"into the generation algorithm. For example, a per-host key is commonly also "
"included, so that different systems end up generating different IDs. Or with "
"ipv6.addr-gen-mode=stable-privacy, also the device's name is included, so "
"that different interfaces yield different addresses. The per-host key is the "
"identity of your machine and stored in /var/lib/NetworkManager/secret-key. "
"The '$' character is treated special to perform dynamic substitutions at "
"runtime. Currently, supported are \"${CONNECTION}\", \"${DEVICE}\", "
"\"${MAC}\", \"${BOOT}\", \"${RANDOM}\". These effectively create unique IDs "
"per-connection, per-device, per-boot, or every time. Note that \"${DEVICE}\" "
"corresponds to the interface name of the device and \"${MAC}\" is the "
"permanent MAC address of the device. Any unrecognized patterns following '$' "
"are treated verbatim, however are reserved for future use. You are thus "
"advised to avoid '$' or escape it as \"$$\". For example, set it to "
"\"${CONNECTION}-${BOOT}-${DEVICE}\" to create a unique id for this "
"connection that changes with every reboot and differs depending on the "
"interface where the profile activates. If the value is unset, a global "
"connection default is consulted. If the value is still unset, the default is "
"similar to \"${CONNECTION}\" and uses a unique, fixed ID for the connection."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:25
msgid ""
"The time, in seconds since the Unix Epoch, that the connection was last "
"_successfully_ fully activated. NetworkManager updates the connection "
"timestamp periodically when the connection is active to ensure that an "
"active connection has the latest timestamp. The property is only meant for "
"reading (changes to this property will not be preserved)."
msgstr ""
"Die tyd, in sekondes sedert die Unix Epoch, dat die konneksie was laaste "
"_suksesvol_ ten volle geaktiveer. NetwerkBestuurder opdateer die verbinding "
"tydstempel periodiek wanneer die verbinding aktief is om te verseker dat 'n "
"aktiewe verbinding die nuutste tydstempel het. Die eiendom is slegs bedoel "
"vir lees (veranderinge aan hierdie eiendom sal nie bewaar word nie)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:26
msgid ""
"Base type of the connection. For hardware-dependent connections, should "
"contain the setting name of the hardware-type specific setting (ie, \"802-3-"
"ethernet\" or \"802-11-wireless\" or \"bluetooth\", etc), and for non-"
"hardware dependent connections like VPN or otherwise, should contain the "
"setting name of that setting type (ie, \"vpn\" or \"bridge\", etc)."
msgstr ""
"Basis tipe van die verbinding. Vir hardeware-afhanklike verbindings, moet "
"die instellingsnaam van die hardeware-tipe spesifieke instelling bevat (bv. "
"\"802-3-ethernet\" of \"802-11-wireless\" of \"bluetooth\", ens.), en vir "
"nie-hardeware-afhanklike verbindings soos VPN of andersins, moet die "
"instellingsnaam van daardie instellingtipe bevat (bv. \"vpn\" of \"bridge\", "
"ens.)."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:157
msgid ""
"A universally unique identifier for the connection, for example generated "
"with libuuid.  It should be assigned when the connection is created, and "
"never changed as long as the connection still applies to the same network.  "
"For example, it should not be changed when the \"id\" property or "
"NMSettingIP4Config changes, but might need to be re-created when the Wi-Fi "
"SSID, mobile broadband network provider, or \"type\" property changes. The "
"UUID must be in the format \"2815492f-7e56-435e-b2e9-246bd7cdc664\" (ie, "
"contains only hexadecimal characters and \"-\")."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:29
msgid ""
"Timeout in milliseconds to wait for device at startup. During boot, devices "
"may take a while to be detected by the driver. This property will cause to "
"delay NetworkManager-wait-online.service and nm-online to give the device a "
"chance to appear. This works by waiting for the given timeout until a "
"compatible device for the profile is available and managed. The value 0 "
"means no wait time. The default value is -1, which currently has the same "
"meaning as no wait time."
msgstr ""
"Tyduit in millisekondes om te wag vir toestel by opstart. Tydens stewel kan "
"toestelle 'n rukkie neem om deur die drywer opgespoor te word. Hierdie "
"eiendom sal veroorsaak dat NetworkManager-wait-online.service en nm-online "
"vertraag word om die toestel 'n kans te gee om te verskyn. Dit werk deur te "
"wag vir die gegewe uitteltyd totdat 'n versoenbare toestel vir die profiel "
"beskikbaar en bestuur is. Die waarde 0 beteken geen wagtyd nie. Die "
"verstekwaarde is -1, wat tans dieselfde betekenis het as geen wagtyd nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:30
msgid ""
"The trust level of a the connection.  Free form case-insensitive string (for "
"example \"Home\", \"Work\", \"Public\").  NULL or unspecified zone means the "
"connection will be placed in the default zone as defined by the firewall. "
"When updating this property on a currently activated connection, the change "
"takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"Die vertrouensvlak van 'n die verbinding. Vrye vorm hoofletter-onsensitiewe "
"string (byvoorbeeld \"Home\", \"Work\", \"Public\"). NULL of "
"ongespesifiseerde sone beteken dat die verbinding in die versteksone geplaas "
"sal word soos deur die brandmuur gedefinieer. Wanneer hierdie eiendom op 'n "
"tans geaktiveerde verbinding bygewerk word, tree die verandering onmiddellik "
"in werking."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:125
msgid ""
"Specifies the NMSettingDcbFlags for the DCB FCoE application.  Flags may be "
"any combination of NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2), and NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die NMSettingDcbFlagsvir die DCB FCoE aansoek. Vlae kan enige "
"kombinasie van wees NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2), en NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:126
msgid ""
"The FCoE controller mode; either \"fabric\" or \"vn2vn\". Since 1.34, NULL "
"is the default and means \"fabric\". Before 1.34, NULL was rejected as "
"invalid and the default was \"fabric\"."
msgstr ""
"Die FCoE-beheerdermodus; óf \"fabric\" of \"vn2vn\". Sedert 1.34 is NULL die "
"verstek en beteken \"fabric\". Voor 1.34 is NULL as ongeldig verwerp en die "
"verstek was \"fabric\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:127
msgid ""
"The highest User Priority (0 - 7) which FCoE frames should use, or -1 for "
"default priority.  Only used when the \"app-fcoe-flags\" property includes "
"the NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1) flag."
msgstr ""
"Die hoogste gebruiker prioriteit (0 - 7) wat FCoE rame moet gebruik, of -1 "
"vir verstek prioriteit. Slegs gebruik wanneer die \"app-fcoe-flags\" eiendom "
"die NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1) vlag insluit."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:128
msgid ""
"Specifies the NMSettingDcbFlags for the DCB FIP application.  Flags may be "
"any combination of NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2), and NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die NMSettingDcbFlags vir die DCB FIP-toepassing. Vlae mag wees "
"enige kombinasie van NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2) en NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:129
msgid ""
"The highest User Priority (0 - 7) which FIP frames should use, or -1 for "
"default priority.  Only used when the \"app-fip-flags\" property includes "
"the NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1) flag."
msgstr ""
"Die hoogste gebruikerprioriteit (0 - 7) wat FIP rame moet gebruik, of -1 vir "
"verstek prioriteit. Slegs gebruik wanneer die \"app-fip-flags\" eiendom die "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1) vlag insluit."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:130
msgid ""
"Specifies the NMSettingDcbFlags for the DCB iSCSI application.  Flags may be "
"any combination of NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2), and NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die NMSettingDcbFlags vir die DCB iSCSI toepassing. Vlae mag "
"wees enige kombinasie van NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2) en NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:131
msgid ""
"The highest User Priority (0 - 7) which iSCSI frames should use, or -1 for "
"default priority. Only used when the \"app-iscsi-flags\" property includes "
"the NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1) flag."
msgstr ""
"Die hoogste gebruiker prioriteit (0 - 7) wat iSCSI rame moet gebruik, of -1 "
"vir verstek prioriteit. Slegs gebruik wanneer die \"app-iscsi-flags\" "
"eiendom die NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1) vlag insluit."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:132
msgid ""
"An array of 8 uint values, where the array index corresponds to the User "
"Priority (0 - 7) and the value indicates the percentage of bandwidth of the "
"priority's assigned group that the priority may use.  The sum of all "
"percentages for priorities which belong to the same group must total 100 "
"percents."
msgstr ""
"'n Skikking van 8 uint waardes, waar die skikking indeks ooreenstem met die "
"Gebruiker prioriteit (0 - 7) en die waarde die persentasie bandwydte van die "
"prioriteit se toegewysde groep aandui wat die prioriteit mag gebruik. Die "
"som van alle persentasies vir prioriteite wat aan dieselfde groep behoort "
"moet 100 persent beloop."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:133
msgid ""
"An array of 8 boolean values, where the array index corresponds to the User "
"Priority (0 - 7) and the value indicates whether or not the corresponding "
"priority should transmit priority pause."
msgstr ""
"'n Skikking van 8 boolese waardes, waar die skikking indeks ooreenstem met "
"die Gebruiker prioriteit (0 - 7) en die waarde aandui of die ooreenstemmende "
"prioriteit prioriteit pouse moet oordra of nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:134
msgid ""
"Specifies the NMSettingDcbFlags for DCB Priority Flow Control (PFC). Flags "
"may be any combination of NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2), and NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die NMSettingDcbFlags vir DCB Priority Flow Control (PFC). Vlae "
"mag wees enige kombinasie van NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2) en NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:135
msgid ""
"An array of 8 uint values, where the array index corresponds to the Priority "
"Group ID (0 - 7) and the value indicates the percentage of link bandwidth "
"allocated to that group.  Allowed values are 0 - 100, and the sum of all "
"values must total 100 percents."
msgstr ""
"'n Skikking van 8 uint-waardes, waar die skikking indeks ooreenstem met die "
"Prioriteit groep-ID (0 - 7) en die waarde die persentasie skakel bandwydte "
"aandui wat aan daardie groep toegewys is. Toegelate waardes is 0 - 100, en "
"die som van alle waardes moet 100 persent beloop."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:136
msgid ""
"Specifies the NMSettingDcbFlags for DCB Priority Groups.  Flags may be any "
"combination of NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2), and NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die NMSettingDcbFlags vir DCB prioriteit groepe. Vlae mag wees "
"enige kombinasie van NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ENABLE (0x1), "
"NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_ADVERTISE (0x2) en NM_SETTING_DCB_FLAG_WILLING (0x4)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:137
msgid ""
"An array of 8 uint values, where the array index corresponds to the User "
"Priority (0 - 7) and the value indicates the Priority Group ID.  Allowed "
"Priority Group ID values are 0 - 7 or 15 for the unrestricted group."
msgstr ""
"'n Skikking van 8 uint waardes, waar die skikking indeks ooreenstem met die "
"gebruikerprioriteit (0 - 7) en die waarde die prioriteit groep ID aandui. "
"Toegelate prioriteit groep ID waardes is 0 - 7 of 15 vir die onbeperkte "
"groep."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:138
msgid ""
"An array of 8 boolean values, where the array index corresponds to the User "
"Priority (0 - 7) and the value indicates whether or not the priority may use "
"all of the bandwidth allocated to its assigned group."
msgstr ""
"'n Skikking van 8 boolese waardes, waar die skikking indeks ooreenstem met "
"die Gebruiker prioriteit (0 - 7) en die waarde aandui of die prioriteit al "
"die bandwydte mag gebruik wat aan sy toegewysde groep toegewys is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:139
msgid ""
"An array of 8 uint values, where the array index corresponds to the User "
"Priority (0 - 7) and the value indicates the traffic class (0 - 7) to which "
"the priority is mapped."
msgstr ""
"'n Skikking van 8 uint waardes, waar die skikking indeks ooreenstem met die "
"Gebruiker prioriteit (0 - 7) en die waarde die verkeersklas (0 - 7) aandui "
"waarna die prioriteit gekarteer is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:140
msgid ""
"The GPRS Access Point Name specifying the APN used when establishing a data "
"session with the GSM-based network.  The APN often determines how the user "
"will be billed for their network usage and whether the user has access to "
"the Internet or just a provider-specific walled-garden, so it is important "
"to use the correct APN for the user's mobile broadband plan. The APN may "
"only be composed of the characters a-z, 0-9, ., and - per GSM 03.60 Section "
"14.9."
msgstr ""
"Die GPRS Toegang Punt Naam spesifiseer die APN wat gebruik word wanneer 'n "
"datasessie met die GSM-gebaseerde netwerk daargestel word. Die APN bepaal "
"dikwels hoe die gebruiker gefaktureer sal word vir hul netwerkgebruik en of "
"die gebruiker toegang tot die internet of net 'n verskaffer-spesifieke "
"ommuurde tuin het, daarom is dit belangrik om die korrekte APN vir die "
"gebruiker se mobiele breëband plan te gebruik. Die APN mag slegs saamgestel "
"word uit die karakters a-z, 0-9, ., en - per GSM 03.60 Afdeling 14.9."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:141
msgid ""
"When TRUE, the settings such as APN, username, or password will default to "
"values that match the network the modem will register to in the Mobile "
"Broadband Provider database."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer WAAR, sal die instellings soos APN, gebruikersnaam of wagwoord "
"verstek op waardes wat ooreenstem met die netwerk waarop die modem sal "
"registreer in die Mobiele Breëband Verskaffer databasis."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:142
msgid ""
"The device unique identifier (as given by the WWAN management service) which "
"this connection applies to.  If given, the connection will only apply to the "
"specified device."
msgstr ""
"Die toestel se unieke identifiseerder (soos gegee deur die WWAN bestuur "
"diens) waarop hierdie verbinding van toepassing is. Indien gegee, sal die "
"verbinding slegs van toepassing wees op die gespesifiseerde toestel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:143
msgid ""
"When TRUE, only connections to the home network will be allowed. Connections "
"to roaming networks will not be made."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer WAAR is, sal slegs verbindings met die tuisnetwerk toegelaat word. "
"Verbindings met swerfnetwerke sal nie gemaak word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:145
msgid ""
"The Network ID (GSM LAI format, ie MCC-MNC) to force specific network "
"registration.  If the Network ID is specified, NetworkManager will attempt "
"to force the device to register only on the specified network. This can be "
"used to ensure that the device does not roam when direct roaming control of "
"the device is not otherwise possible."
msgstr ""
"Die Netwerk ID (GSM LAI formaat, dws MCC-MNC) om spesifieke netwerk "
"registrasie af te dwing. As die netwerk ID gespesifiseer is, sal "
"NetwerkBestuurder probeer om die toestel te dwing om slegs op die "
"gespesifiseerde netwerk te registreer. Dit kan gebruik word om te verseker "
"dat die toestel nie swerf wanneer direkte swerfbeheer van die toestel nie "
"andersins moontlik is nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:146
msgid ""
"Legacy setting that used to help establishing PPP data sessions for GSM-"
"based modems. Deprecated: 1"
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:149
msgid ""
"If the SIM is locked with a PIN it must be unlocked before any other "
"operations are requested.  Specify the PIN here to allow operation of the "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Indien die SIM met 'n PIN gesluit is, moet dit ontsluit word voordat enige "
"ander bewerkings versoek word. Spesifiseer die PIN hier om die werking van "
"die toestel toe te laat."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:151
msgid ""
"The SIM card unique identifier (as given by the WWAN management service) "
"which this connection applies to.  If given, the connection will apply to "
"any device also allowed by \"device-id\" which contains a SIM card matching "
"the given identifier."
msgstr ""
"Die SIM kaart unieke identifiseerder (soos gegee deur die WWAN bestuur "
"diens) waarop hierdie verbinding van toepassing is. Indien gegee, sal die "
"verbinding van toepassing wees op enige toestel wat ook toegelaat word deur "
"\"device-id\" wat 'n SIM kaart bevat wat ooreenstem met die gegewe "
"identifiseerder."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:152
msgid ""
"A MCC/MNC string like \"310260\" or \"21601\" identifying the specific "
"mobile network operator which this connection applies to.  If given, the "
"connection will apply to any device also allowed by \"device-id\" and \"sim-"
"id\" which contains a SIM card provisioned by the given operator."
msgstr ""
"'n MCC/MNC toutjie soos \"310260\" of \"21601\" identifisering van die "
"spesifieke mobiele netwerk operateur watter hierdie konneksie aansoeke om "
"te. Indien gegee, sal die verbinding van toepassing wees op enige toestel "
"wat ook toegelaat word deur \"device-id\" en \"sim-id\" wat 'n SIM kaart "
"bevat wat deur die gegewe operateur voorsien is"

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:440
msgid ""
"Whether the system hostname can be determined from DHCP on this connection. "
"When set to NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1), the value from global configuration is "
"used. If the property doesn't have a value in the global configuration, "
"NetworkManager assumes the value to be NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1)."
msgstr ""
"Whether die stelsel gasheernaam kan van DHCP op hierdie verbinding bepaal "
"word. Wanneer dit op NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1) gestel is, word die waarde van "
"globale konfigurasie gebruik. As die eiendom nie 'n waarde in die globale "
"konfigurasie het nie, neem NetwerkBestuurder aan dat die waarde is "
"NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:441
msgid ""
"Whether the system hostname can be determined from reverse DNS lookup of "
"addresses on this device. When set to NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1), the value "
"from global configuration is used. If the property doesn't have a value in "
"the global configuration, NetworkManager assumes the value to be "
"NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1)."
msgstr ""
"Whether die stelsel gasheernaam kan bepaal word uit omgekeerde DNS-opsoek "
"van adresse op hierdie toestel. Wanneer dit op NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1) "
"gestel is, word die waarde van globale konfigurasie gebruik. As die eiendom "
"nie 'n waarde in die globale konfigurasie het nie, neem NetwerkBestuurder "
"aan dat die waarde is NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:442
msgid ""
"If set to NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1), NetworkManager attempts to get the hostname "
"via DHCPv4/DHCPv6 or reverse DNS lookup on this device only when the device "
"has the default route for the given address family (IPv4/IPv6). If set to "
"NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0), the hostname can be set from this device even if it "
"doesn't have the default route. When set to NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1), the "
"value from global configuration is used. If the property doesn't have a "
"value in the global configuration, NetworkManager assumes the value to be "
"NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0)."
msgstr ""
"Indien dit op NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1) gestel is, probeer NetworkManager om die "
"gasheernaam via DHCPv4/DHCPv6 of omgekeerde DNS opsoek op hierdie toestel te "
"kry slegs wanneer die toestel die verstekroete vir die gegewe adresfamilie "
"(IPv4/IPv6) het. As dit op NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0) gestel is, kan die "
"gasheernaam vanaf hierdie toestel gestel word, selfs al het dit nie die "
"verstekroete nie. Wanneer dit op NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1) gestel is, word die "
"waarde van globale konfigurasie gebruik. As die eiendom nie 'n waarde in die "
"globale konfigurasie het nie, neem NetworkManager aan dat die waarde "
"NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0) is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:443
msgid ""
"The relative priority of this connection to determine the system hostname. A "
"lower numerical value is better (higher priority).  A connection with higher "
"priority is considered before connections with lower priority. If the value "
"is zero, it can be overridden by a global value from NetworkManager "
"configuration. If the property doesn't have a value in the global "
"configuration, the value is assumed to be 100. Negative values have the "
"special effect of excluding other connections with a greater numerical "
"priority value; so in presence of at least one negative priority, only "
"connections with the lowest priority value will be used to determine the "
"hostname."
msgstr ""
"Die relatiewe prioriteit van hierdie verbinding om die stelsel gasheernaam "
"te bepaal. 'n Laer numeriese waarde is beter (hoër prioriteit). 'n "
"Verbinding met hoër prioriteit word oorweeg voor verbindings met laer "
"prioriteit. As die waarde nul is, kan dit deur 'n globale waarde van "
"NetwerkBestuurder konfigurasie oorheers word. As die eiendom nie 'n waarde "
"in die globale opset het nie, word aanvaar dat die waarde 100 is. Negatiewe "
"waardes het die spesiale effek dat ander verbindings met 'n groter numeriese "
"prioriteit waarde uitgesluit word; dus in die teenwoordigheid van ten minste "
"een negatiewe prioriteit, sal slegs verbindings met die laagste prioriteit "
"waarde gebruik word om die gasheernaam te bepaal."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:154
msgid ""
"If specified, this connection will only apply to the IPoIB device whose "
"permanent MAC address matches. This property does not change the MAC address "
"of the device (i.e. MAC spoofing)."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, sal hierdie verbinding slegs van toepassing wees op "
"die IPoIB toestel waarvan die permanente MAC adres ooreenstem. Hierdie "
"eienskap verander nie die MAC adres van die toestel nie (d.w.s. MAC "
"spoofing)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:156
msgid ""
"The InfiniBand P_Key to use for this device. A value of -1 means to use the "
"default P_Key (aka \"the P_Key at index 0\"). Otherwise, it is a 16-bit "
"unsigned integer, whose high bit is set if it is a \"full membership\" P_Key."
msgstr ""
"Die InfiniBand P_Key om vir hierdie toestel te gebruik. 'n Waarde van -1 "
"beteken om die verstek P_Key te gebruik (aka \"the P_Key at index 0\"). "
"Andersins, dit is 'n 16-bis ongetekende heelgetal, waarvan die hoë bis "
"gestel word as dit 'n \"full membership\" P_Key."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:157
msgid ""
"The interface name of the parent device of this device. Normally NULL, but "
"if the \"p_key\" property is set, then you must specify the base device by "
"setting either this property or \"mac-address\"."
msgstr ""
"Die koppelvlaknaam van die ouertoestel van hierdie toestel. Normaalweg NULL, "
"maar as die \"p_key\" eiendom gestel is, dan moet jy die basistoestel "
"spesifiseer deur óf hierdie te stel eiendom of \"mac-address\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:158
msgid ""
"The IP-over-InfiniBand transport mode. Either \"datagram\" or \"connected\"."
msgstr ""
"Die IP-oor-InfiniBand vervoer modus. Óf \"datagram\" of \"connected\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:219
msgid ""
"How many additional levels of encapsulation are permitted to be prepended to "
"packets. This property applies only to IPv6 tunnels."
msgstr ""
"Hoeveel bykomende vlakke van inkapseling word toegelaat om by pakkies aan te "
"sluit. Hierdie eiendom is slegs van toepassing op IPv6 tonnels."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:220
msgid ""
"Tunnel flags. Currently, the following values are supported: "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_IGN_ENCAP_LIMIT (0x1), "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_USE_ORIG_TCLASS (0x2), "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_USE_ORIG_FLOWLABEL (0x4), "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_MIP6_DEV (0x8), NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_RCV_DSCP_COPY "
"(0x10), NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_USE_ORIG_FWMARK (0x20). They are valid only "
"for IPv6 tunnels."
msgstr ""
"Tonnel vlae. Tans word die volgende waardes ondersteun: "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_IGN_ENCAP_LIMIT (0x1), "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_USE_ORIG_TCLASS (0x2), "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_USE_ORIG_FLOWLABEL (0x4), "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_MIP6_DEV (0x8), NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_RCV_DSCP_COPY "
"(0x10), NM_IP_TUNNEL_FLAG_IP6_USE_ORIG_FWMARK (0x20). Hulle is slegs geldig "
"vir IPv6 tonnels."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:221
msgid ""
"The flow label to assign to tunnel packets. This property applies only to "
"IPv6 tunnels."
msgstr ""
"Die vloeietiket om aan tonnelpakkies toe te ken. Hierdie eiendom is slegs "
"van toepassing op IPv6 tonnels."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:223
msgid ""
"The key used for tunnel input packets; the property is valid only for "
"certain tunnel modes (GRE, IP6GRE). If empty, no key is used."
msgstr ""
"Die sleutel wat gebruik word vir tonnel invoer pakkies; die eiendom is slegs "
"geldig vir sekere tonnel modusse (GRE, IP6GRE). Indien leeg, word geen "
"sleutel gebruik nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:224
msgid ""
"The local endpoint of the tunnel; the value can be empty, otherwise it must "
"contain an IPv4 or IPv6 address."
msgstr ""
"Die plaaslike eindpunt van die tonnel; die waarde kan leeg wees, anders moet "
"dit 'n IPv4 of IPv6 adres bevat."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:225
msgid ""
"The tunneling mode, for example NM_IP_TUNNEL_MODE_IPIP (1) or "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_MODE_GRE (2)."
msgstr ""
"Die tonnel modus, byvoorbeeld NM_IP_TUNNEL_MODE_IPIP (1) of "
"NM_IP_TUNNEL_MODE_GRE (2)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:226
msgid ""
"If non-zero, only transmit packets of the specified size or smaller, "
"breaking larger packets up into multiple fragments."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, stuur slegs pakkies van die gespesifiseerde grootte of "
"kleiner, en breek groter pakkies op in veelvuldige fragmente."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:227
msgid ""
"The key used for tunnel output packets; the property is valid only for "
"certain tunnel modes (GRE, IP6GRE). If empty, no key is used."
msgstr ""
"Die sleutel wat gebruik word vir tonnel uitset pakkies; die eiendom is slegs "
"geldig vir sekere tonnelmodusse (GRE, IP6GRE). Indien leeg, word geen "
"sleutel gebruik nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:228
msgid ""
"If given, specifies the parent interface name or parent connection UUID the "
"new device will be bound to so that tunneled packets will only be routed via "
"that interface."
msgstr ""
"Indien gegee, spesifiseer die ouer koppelvlak naam of ouer verbinding UUID "
"waaraan die nuwe toestel gebind sal wees sodat tonnel pakkette slegs via "
"daardie koppelvlak herlei sal word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:229
msgid "Whether to enable Path MTU Discovery on this tunnel."
msgstr "Of Path MTU Discovery op hierdie tonnel geaktiveer moet word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:230
msgid ""
"The remote endpoint of the tunnel; the value must contain an IPv4 or IPv6 "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Die afgeleë eindpunt van die tonnel; die waarde moet 'n IPv4- of IPv6-adres "
"bevat."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:231
msgid ""
"The type of service (IPv4) or traffic class (IPv6) field to be set on "
"tunneled packets."
msgstr ""
"Die tipe diens (IPv4) of verkeers klas (IPv6) veld wat op tonnel pakkette "
"gestel moet word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:232
msgid ""
"The TTL to assign to tunneled packets. 0 is a special value meaning that "
"packets inherit the TTL value."
msgstr ""
"Die TTL om aan tonnel pakkette toe te ken. 0 is 'n spesiale waarde wat "
"beteken dat pakkies die TTL waarde erf."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:159
msgid ""
"A list of IPv4 addresses and their prefix length. Multiple addresses can be "
"separated by comma. For example \"192.168.1.5/24, 10.1.0.5/24\". The "
"addresses are listed in decreasing priority, meaning the first address will "
"be the primary address."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys van IPv4 adresse en hul voorvoegsellengte. Veelvuldige adresse kan "
"deur komma geskei word. Byvoorbeeld \"192.168.1.5/24, 10.1.0.5/24\". Die "
"adresse word in dalende prioriteit gelys, wat beteken dat die eerste adres "
"die primêre adres sal wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:161
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:191
msgid ""
"Timeout in milliseconds used to check for the presence of duplicate IP "
"addresses on the network.  If an address conflict is detected, the "
"activation will fail.  A zero value means that no duplicate address "
"detection is performed, -1 means the default value (either configuration "
"ipvx.dad-timeout override or zero).  A value greater than zero is a timeout "
"in milliseconds. The property is currently implemented only for IPv4."
msgstr ""
"Tyd-uit in millisekondes gebruik om te kyk vir die teenwoordigheid van "
"duplikaat IP adresse op die netwerk. As 'n adreskonflik bespeur word, sal "
"die aktivering misluk. 'n Nul waarde beteken dat geen duplikaat adres "
"opsporing uitgevoer word nie, -1 beteken die verstekwaarde (óf konfigurasie "
"ipvx.dad-timeout-oorskakeling of nul). 'n Waarde groter as nul is 'n "
"uitteltyd in millisekondes. Die eiendom word tans slegs vir IPv4 "
"geïmplementeer"

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:162
msgid ""
"A string sent to the DHCP server to identify the local machine which the "
"DHCP server may use to customize the DHCP lease and options. When the "
"property is a hex string ('aa:bb:cc') it is interpreted as a binary client "
"ID, in which case the first byte is assumed to be the 'type' field as per "
"RFC 2132 section 9.14 and the remaining bytes may be an hardware address "
"(e.g. '01:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx' where 1 is the Ethernet ARP type and the rest "
"is a MAC address). If the property is not a hex string it is considered as a "
"non-hardware-address client ID and the 'type' field is set to 0. The special "
"values \"mac\" and \"perm-mac\" are supported, which use the current or "
"permanent MAC address of the device to generate a client identifier with "
"type ethernet (01). Currently, these options only work for ethernet type of "
"links. The special value \"ipv6-duid\" uses the DUID from \"ipv6.dhcp-duid\" "
"property as an RFC4361-compliant client identifier. As IAID it uses "
"\"ipv4.dhcp-iaid\" and falls back to \"ipv6.dhcp-iaid\" if unset. The "
"special value \"duid\" generates a RFC4361-compliant client identifier based "
"on \"ipv4.dhcp-iaid\" and uses a DUID generated by hashing /etc/machine-id. "
"The special value \"stable\" is supported to generate a type 0 client "
"identifier based on the stable-id (see connection.stable-id) and a per-host "
"key. If you set the stable-id, you may want to include the \"${DEVICE}\" or "
"\"${MAC}\" specifier to get a per-device key. If unset, a globally "
"configured default is used. If still unset, the default depends on the DHCP "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"'n Toutjie wat na die DHCP bediener gestuur word om die plaaslike masjien te "
"identifiseer wat die DHCP bediener kan gebruik om die DHCP huurkontrak en "
"opsies aan te pas. Wanneer die eienskap 'n hex-string ('aa:bb:cc') is, word "
"dit geïnterpreteer as 'n binêre kliënt-ID, in welke geval die eerste grepe "
"aanvaar word as die 'tipe'-veld volgens RFC 2132 afdeling 9.14 en die "
"oorblywende grepe kan 'n hardeware adres wees (bv. '01:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx' "
"waar 1 die Ethernet ARP tipe is en die res 'n MAC adres is). As die eiendom "
"nie 'n hex-string is nie, word dit beskou as 'n nie hardeware adres klient "
"ID en die 'type' veld is op 0 gestel. Die spesiale waardes \"mac\" en \"perm-"
"mac\" word ondersteun, wat die huidige gebruik of permanente MAC adres van "
"die toestel om 'n klient identifiseerder met tipe ethernet (01) te genereer. "
"Tans werk hierdie opsies net vir ethernet tipe skakels. Die spesiale waarde "
"\"ipv6-duid\" gebruik die DUID van \"ipv6.dhcp-duid\" eiendom as 'n RFC4361 "
"voldoende klient identifiseerder. As IAID gebruik dit \"ipv4.dhcp-iaid\" en "
"val terug na \"ipv6.dhcp-iaid\" as dit nie ingestel is nie. Die spesiale "
"waarde \"duid\" genereer 'n RFC4361-voldoende kliënt identifiseerder "
"gebaseer op \"ipv4.dhcp-iaid\" en gebruik 'n DUID gegenereer deur hashing "
"/etc/machine-id. Die spesiale waarde \"stable\" word ondersteun om 'n tipe 0 "
"klient identifiseerder te genereer gebaseer op die stable-id (sien "
"connection.stable-id) en 'n per-gasheer sleutel. As jy die stable-id stel, "
"wil jy dalk die \"${DEVICE}\" of \"${MAC}\" spesifiseerder insluit om 'n per-"
"toestel sleutel te kry. As dit nie ingestel is nie, word 'n globaal "
"gekonfigureerde verstek gebruik. As dit nog nie ingestel is nie, hang die "
"verstek af van die DHCP inprop"

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:163
msgid ""
"If the \"dhcp-send-hostname\" property is TRUE, then the specified FQDN will "
"be sent to the DHCP server when acquiring a lease. This property and \"dhcp-"
"hostname\" are mutually exclusive and cannot be set at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Indien die \"dhcp-send-hostname\" eiendom is WAAR, dan die gespesifiseerde "
"FQDN sal gestuur word aan die DHCP bediener wanneer bekom 'n huurkontrak. "
"Hierdie eiendom en \"dhcp-hostname\" is onderling uitsluitend en kan nie "
"terselfdertyd ingestel word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:164
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:193
msgid ""
"If the \"dhcp-send-hostname\" property is TRUE, then the specified name will "
"be sent to the DHCP server when acquiring a lease. This property and \"dhcp-"
"fqdn\" are mutually exclusive and cannot be set at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Indien die \"dhcp-send-hostname\" eiendom is WAAR, dan sal die "
"gespesifiseerde naam gestuur word aan die DHCP bediener wanneer bekom 'n "
"huurkontrak. Hierdie eiendom en\"dhcp-fqdn\" is onderling uitsluitend en kan "
"nie terselfder tyd stel word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:165
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:194
msgid ""
"Flags for the DHCP hostname and FQDN. Currently, this property only includes "
"flags to control the FQDN flags set in the DHCP FQDN option. Supported FQDN "
"flags are NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_SERV_UPDATE (0x1), "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_ENCODED (0x2) and "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_NO_UPDATE (0x4).  When no FQDN flag is set and "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_CLEAR_FLAGS (0x8) is set, the DHCP FQDN option "
"will contain no flag. Otherwise, if no FQDN flag is set and "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_CLEAR_FLAGS (0x8) is not set, the standard FQDN "
"flags are set in the request: NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_SERV_UPDATE (0x1), "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_ENCODED (0x2) for IPv4 and "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_SERV_UPDATE (0x1) for IPv6. When this property is "
"set to the default value NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_NONE (0x0), a global default "
"is looked up in NetworkManager configuration. If that value is unset or also "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_NONE (0x0), then the standard FQDN flags described "
"above are sent in the DHCP requests."
msgstr ""
"Vlae vir die DHCP gasheernaam en FQDN. Tans bevat hierdie eiendom slegs vlae "
"om die FQDN-vlae te beheer wat in die DHCP FQDN opsie gestel is. "
"Ondersteunde FQDN vlae is NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_SERV_UPDATE (0x1), "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_ENCODED (0x2) en "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_NO_UPDATE (0x4). Wanneer geen FQDN vlag gestel is "
"nie en NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_CLEAR_FLAGS (0x8) is gestel, sal die DHCP "
"FQDN opsie geen vlag bevat nie. Andersins, as geen FQDN vlag gestel is nie "
"en NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_CLEAR_FLAGS (0x8) nie gestel is nie, word die "
"standaard FQDN vlae in die versoek gestel: "
"NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_FQDN_SERV_UPDATE (0x1), IPv_DHCP_HODE_HOSTNAME_DNHVAG0 "
"vir NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_DNHVAG0 vir "
"NM_DHCP_DMFQNAME_DNHVAG0(NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_DNFLAG)(NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_DNFLAG0) "
"(NM_DHCP_HOSTMFQNAME_ENH2AG0) (NDHCP_DOFQNAME_4FLAG) Wanneer hierdie eiendom "
"op die verstek waarde NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_NONE (0x0) gestel is, word 'n "
"globale verstek in NetwerkBestuurder konfigurasie opgesoek. As daardie "
"waarde nie ingestel is nie of ook NM_DHCP_HOSTNAME_FLAG_NONE (0x0), dan word "
"die standaard FQDN vlae wat hierbo beskryf is, in die DHCP versoeke gestuur."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:166
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:194
msgid ""
"A string containing the \"Identity Association Identifier\" (IAID) used by "
"the DHCP client. The property is a 32-bit decimal value or a special value "
"among \"mac\", \"perm-mac\", \"ifname\" and \"stable\". When set to \"mac\" "
"(or \"perm-mac\"), the last 4 bytes of the current (or permanent) MAC "
"address are used as IAID. When set to \"ifname\", the IAID is computed by "
"hashing the interface name. The special value \"stable\" can be used to "
"generate an IAID based on the stable-id (see connection.stable-id), a per-"
"host key and the interface name. When the property is unset, the value from "
"global configuration is used; if no global default is set then the IAID is "
"assumed to be \"ifname\". Note that at the moment this property is ignored "
"for IPv6 by dhclient, which always derives the IAID from the MAC address."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:167
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:196
msgid ""
"Array of servers from which DHCP offers must be rejected. This property is "
"useful to avoid getting a lease from misconfigured or rogue servers. For "
"DHCPv4, each element must be an IPv4 address, optionally followed by a slash "
"and a prefix length (e.g. \"192.168.122.0/24\"). This property is currently "
"not implemented for DHCPv6."
msgstr ""
"Verskeidenheid bedieners waarvandaan DHCP aanbied, moet verwerp word. "
"Hierdie eiendom is nuttig om te verhoed dat u 'n huurkontrak van verkeerd "
"gekonfigureerde of skelm bedieners kry. Vir DHCPv4 moet elke element 'n IPv4-"
"adres wees, opsioneel gevolg deur 'n skuinsstreep en 'n voorvoegsellengte "
"(bv. \"192.168.122.0/24\"). Hierdie eiendom is tans nie vir DHCPv6 "
"geïmplementeer nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:168
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:197
msgid ""
"If TRUE, a hostname is sent to the DHCP server when acquiring a lease. Some "
"DHCP servers use this hostname to update DNS databases, essentially "
"providing a static hostname for the computer.  If the \"dhcp-hostname\" "
"property is NULL and this property is TRUE, the current persistent hostname "
"of the computer is sent."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, word 'n gasheernaam na die DHCP bediener gestuur wanneer 'n "
"huurkontrak verkry word. Sommige DHCP bedieners gebruik hierdie gasheernaam "
"om DNS databasisse op te dateer, wat in wese 'n statiese gasheernaam vir die "
"rekenaar verskaf. As die \"dhcp-hostname\" eiendom NULL is en hierdie "
"eiendom WAAR is, word die huidige aanhoudende gasheernaam van die rekenaar "
"gestuur."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:169
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:198
msgid ""
"A timeout for a DHCP transaction in seconds. If zero (the default), a "
"globally configured default is used. If still unspecified, a device specific "
"timeout is used (usually 45 seconds). Set to 2147483647 (MAXINT32) for "
"infinity."
msgstr ""
"'n Tyduit vir 'n DHCP transaksie in sekondes. Indien nul (die verstek), word "
"'n globaal gekonfigureerde verstek gebruik. Indien nog nie gespesifiseer "
"nie, word 'n toestelspesifieke uitteltyd gebruik (gewoonlik 45 sekondes). "
"Stel op 2147483647 (MAXINT32) vir oneindig."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:169
msgid ""
"The Vendor Class Identifier DHCP option (60). Special characters in the data "
"string may be escaped using C-style escapes, nevertheless this property "
"cannot contain nul bytes. If the per-profile value is unspecified (the "
"default), a global connection default gets consulted. If still unspecified, "
"the DHCP option is not sent to the server. Since 1.28"
msgstr ""

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:217
#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:237
msgid "Array of IP addresses of DNS servers."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:172
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:200
msgid ""
"Array of DNS options as described in man 5 resolv.conf. NULL means that the "
"options are unset and left at the default. In this case NetworkManager will "
"use default options. This is distinct from an empty list of properties. The "
"currently supported options are \"attempts\", \"debug\", \"edns0\", "
"\"inet6\", \"ip6-bytestring\", \"ip6-dotint\", \"ndots\", \"no-check-"
"names\", \"no-ip6-dotint\", \"no-reload\", \"no-tld-query\", \"rotate\", "
"\"single-request\", \"single-request-reopen\", \"timeout\", \"trust-ad\", "
"\"use-vc\". The \"trust-ad\" setting is only honored if the profile "
"contributes name servers to resolv.conf, and if all contributing profiles "
"have \"trust-ad\" enabled. When using a caching DNS plugin (dnsmasq or "
"systemd-resolved in NetworkManager.conf) then \"edns0\" and \"trust-ad\" are "
"automatically added."
msgstr ""
"Skikking van DNS opsies soos beskryf in man 5 resolv.conf. NULL beteken dat "
"die opsies gedeaktiveer is en op die verstek gelaat word. In hierdie geval "
"NetwerkBestuurder sal verstek opsies gebruik. Dit word onderskei van 'n leë "
"lys eiendomme. Die tans ondersteunde opsies is \"attempts\", \"debug\", "
"\"edns0\", \"inet6\", \"ip6-bytestring\", \"ip6-dotint\", \"ndots\", \"no-"
"check-names\", \"no-ip6-dotint\", \"no-reload\", \"no-tld-query\", "
"\"rotate\", \"single-request\", \"single-request-reopen\", \"timeout\", "
"\"trust-ad\", \"use-vc\". Die \"trust-ad\" instelling word slegs geëer as "
"die profiel naam bedieners bydra tot resolv.conf, en as alle bydraende "
"profiele het \"trust-ad\" in staat gestel. Wanneer gebruik van a caching DNS "
"inprop (dnsmasq of systemd-resolved in NetworkManager.conf) dan \"edns0\" en "
"\"trust-ad\" word outomaties bygevoeg."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:173
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:201
msgid ""
"DNS servers priority. The relative priority for DNS servers specified by "
"this setting.  A lower numerical value is better (higher priority). Negative "
"values have the special effect of excluding other configurations with a "
"greater numerical priority value; so in presence of at least one negative "
"priority, only DNS servers from connections with the lowest priority value "
"will be used. To avoid all DNS leaks, set the priority of the profile that "
"should be used to the most negative value of all active connections "
"profiles. Zero selects a globally configured default value. If the latter is "
"missing or zero too, it defaults to 50 for VPNs (including WireGuard) and "
"100 for other connections. Note that the priority is to order DNS settings "
"for multiple active connections.  It does not disambiguate multiple DNS "
"servers within the same connection profile. When multiple devices have "
"configurations with the same priority, VPNs will be considered first, then "
"devices with the best (lowest metric) default route and then all other "
"devices. When using dns=default, servers with higher priority will be on top "
"of resolv.conf. To prioritize a given server over another one within the "
"same connection, just specify them in the desired order. Note that commonly "
"the resolver tries name servers in /etc/resolv.conf in the order listed, "
"proceeding with the next server in the list on failure. See for example the "
"\"rotate\" option of the dns-options setting. If there are any negative DNS "
"priorities, then only name servers from the devices with that lowest "
"priority will be considered. When using a DNS resolver that supports "
"Conditional Forwarding or Split DNS (with dns=dnsmasq or dns=systemd-"
"resolved settings), each connection is used to query domains in its search "
"list. The search domains determine which name servers to ask, and the DNS "
"priority is used to prioritize name servers based on the domain.  Queries "
"for domains not present in any search list are routed through connections "
"having the '~.' special wildcard domain, which is added automatically to "
"connections with the default route (or can be added manually).  When "
"multiple connections specify the same domain, the one with the best priority "
"(lowest numerical value) wins.  If a sub domain is configured on another "
"interface it will be accepted regardless the priority, unless parent domain "
"on the other interface has a negative priority, which causes the sub domain "
"to be shadowed. With Split DNS one can avoid undesired DNS leaks by properly "
"configuring DNS priorities and the search domains, so that only name servers "
"of the desired interface are configured."
msgstr ""
"DNS bedieners prioriteit. Die relatiewe prioriteit vir DNS bedieners wat "
"deur hierdie instelling gespesifiseer word. 'n Laer numeriese waarde is "
"beter (hoër prioriteit). Negatiewe waardes het die spesiale effek dat ander "
"konfigurasies met 'n groter numeriese prioriteit waarde uitgesluit word; dus "
"in die teenwoordigheid van ten minste een negatiewe prioriteit, sal slegs "
"DNS bedieners van verbindings met die laagste prioriteit waarde gebruik "
"word. Om alle DNS lekkasies te vermy, stel die prioriteit van die profiel "
"wat gebruik moet word op die mees negatiewe waarde van alle aktiewe "
"verbinding profiele. Zero kies 'n globaal gekonfigureerde verstek waarde. As "
"laasgenoemde ontbreek of ook nul is, is dit verstek na 50 vir VPN’s "
"(insluitend WireGuard) en 100 vir ander verbindings. Let daarop dat die "
"prioriteit is om DNS instellings vir veelvuldige aktiewe verbindings te "
"bestel. Dit ontdubbel nie veelvuldige DNS bedieners binne dieselfde "
"verbinding profiel nie. Wanneer verskeie toestelle konfigurasies met "
"dieselfde prioriteit het, sal VPN’s eerste oorweeg word, dan toestelle met "
"die beste (laagste metrieke) verstekroete en dan alle ander toestelle. "
"Wanneer dns=default gebruik word, sal bedieners met hoër prioriteit bo-op "
"resolv.conf wees. Om 'n gegewe bediener bo 'n ander een binne dieselfde "
"verbinding te prioritiseer, spesifiseer hulle net in die verlangde volgorde. "
"Let daarop dat die resolver gewoonlik naam bedieners in /etc/resolv.conf "
"probeer in die volgorde wat gelys is, en voortgaan met die volgende bediener "
"in die lys by mislukking. Sien byvoorbeeld die \"rotate\" opsie van die dns-"
"opsies instelling. As daar enige negatiewe DNS-prioriteite is, sal slegs "
"naambedieners van die toestelle met daardie laagste prioriteit oorweeg word. "
"Wanneer 'n DNS-oplosser gebruik word wat voorwaardelike aanstuur of gesplete "
"DNS ondersteun (met dns=dnsmasq of dns=systemd-resolved instellings), word "
"elke verbinding gebruik om navraag te doen oor domeine in sy soeklys. Die "
"soek domeine bepaal watter naam bedieners om te vra, en die DNS prioriteit "
"word gebruik om naam bedieners op grond van die domein te prioritiseer. "
"Navrae vir domeine wat nie in enige soeklys voorkom nie, word deur "
"verbindings met die '~.' gestuur. spesiale wildcard-domein, wat outomaties "
"by verbindings met die verstekroete gevoeg word (of met die hand bygevoeg "
"kan word). Wanneer verskeie verbindings dieselfde domein spesifiseer, wen "
"die een met die beste prioriteit (laagste numeriese waarde). As 'n subdomein "
"op 'n ander koppelvlak gekonfigureer is, sal dit aanvaar word ongeag die "
"prioriteit, tensy ouer domein op die ander koppelvlak 'n negatiewe "
"prioriteit het, wat veroorsaak dat die subdomein geskadu word. Met Split DNS "
"kan 'n mens ongewenste DNS lekkasies vermy deur DNS prioriteite en die soek "
"domeine behoorlik te konfigureer, sodat slegs naam bedieners van die "
"gewenste koppelvlak gekonfigureer word."

#: ../src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:245
#: ../src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:270
msgid ""
"Array of DNS search domains. Domains starting with a tilde ('~') are "
"considered 'routing' domains and are used only to decide the interface over "
"which a query must be forwarded; they are not used to complete unqualified "
"host names. When using a DNS plugin that supports Conditional Forwarding or "
"Split DNS, then the search domains specify which name servers to query. This "
"makes the behavior different from running with plain /etc/resolv.conf. For "
"more information see also the dns-priority setting."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:174
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:200
msgid ""
"The gateway associated with this configuration. This is only meaningful if "
"\"addresses\" is also set. The gateway's main purpose is to control the next "
"hop of the standard default route on the device. Hence, the gateway property "
"conflicts with \"never-default\" and will be automatically dropped if the IP "
"configuration is set to never-default. As an alternative to set the gateway, "
"configure a static default route with /0 as prefix length."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:176
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:204
msgid ""
"When \"method\" is set to \"auto\" and this property to TRUE, automatically "
"configured name servers and search domains are ignored and only name servers "
"and search domains specified in the \"dns\" and \"dns-search\" properties, "
"if any, are used."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer \"method\" op \"auto\" gestel is en hierdie eienskap op WAAR, word "
"outomaties gekonfigureerde naam bedieners en soek domeine geïgnoreer en "
"slegs naam bedieners en soek domeine gespesifiseer in die \"dns\" en \"dns-"
"search\" eiendomme, indien enige, is gebruik word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:177
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:205
msgid ""
"When \"method\" is set to \"auto\" and this property to TRUE, automatically "
"configured routes are ignored and only routes specified in the \"routes\" "
"property, if any, are used."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer \"method\" op \"auto\" gestel is en hierdie eienskap op WAAR, word "
"outomaties gekonfigureerde roetes geïgnoreer en slegs roetes gespesifiseer "
"in die \"routes\" eiendom, indien enige, word gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:179
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:207
msgid ""
"If TRUE, allow overall network configuration to proceed even if the "
"configuration specified by this property times out.  Note that at least one "
"IP configuration must succeed or overall network configuration will still "
"fail.  For example, in IPv6-only networks, setting this property to TRUE on "
"the NMSettingIP4Config allows the overall network configuration to succeed "
"if IPv4 configuration fails but IPv6 configuration completes successfully."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, laat die algehele netwerk konfigurasie voort, selfs al verval "
"die opstelling wat deur hierdie eienskap gespesifiseer word. Let daarop dat "
"ten minste een IP konfigurasie moet slaag of algehele netwerk konfigurasie "
"sal steeds misluk. Byvoorbeeld, in IPv6-net-netwerke, stel hierdie eiendom "
"op WAAR op die NMSettingIP4Config die algehele netwerk konfigurasie om "
"suksesvol te wees as IPv4 konfigurasie misluk, maar IPv6 konfigurasie "
"suksesvol voltooi."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:180
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:208
msgid ""
"IP configuration method. NMSettingIP4Config and NMSettingIP6Config both "
"support \"disabled\", \"auto\", \"manual\", and \"link-local\". See the "
"subclass-specific documentation for other values. In general, for the "
"\"auto\" method, properties such as \"dns\" and \"routes\" specify "
"information that is added on to the information returned from automatic "
"configuration.  The \"ignore-auto-routes\" and \"ignore-auto-dns\" "
"properties modify this behavior. For methods that imply no upstream network, "
"such as \"shared\" or \"link-local\", these properties must be empty. For "
"IPv4 method \"shared\", the IP subnet can be configured by adding one manual "
"IPv4 address or otherwise 10.42.x.0/24 is chosen. Note that the shared "
"method must be configured on the interface which shares the internet to a "
"subnet, not on the uplink which is shared."
msgstr ""
"IP konfigurasie metode. NMSettingIP4Config en NMSettingIP6Config ondersteun "
"albei \"disabled\", \"auto\", \"manual\" en \"link-local\". Sien die subklas-"
"spesifieke dokumentasie vir ander waardes. Oor die algemeen, vir die "
"\"auto\" metode, spesifiseer eiendomme soos \"dns\" en \"routes\" inligting "
"wat bygevoeg word by die inligting wat van outomatiese konfigurasie "
"teruggestuur word. Die eiendomme \"ignore-auto-routes\" en \"ignore-auto-"
"dns\" wysig hierdie gedrag. Vir metodes wat geen stroomop-netwerk impliseer "
"nie, soos \"shared\" of \"link-local\", moet hierdie eiendomme leeg wees. "
"Vir IPv4 metode \"shared\", kan die IP-subnet gekonfigureer word deur een "
"handmatige IPv4 adres by te voeg of anders word 10.42.x.0/24 gekies. Let "
"daarop dat die gedeelde metode gekonfigureer moet word op die koppelvlak wat "
"die internet met 'n subnet deel, nie op die opskakel wat gedeel word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:181
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:210
msgid ""
"If TRUE, this connection will never be the default connection for this IP "
"type, meaning it will never be assigned the default route by NetworkManager."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, sal hierdie verbinding nooit die verstek verbinding vir hierdie "
"IP tipe wees nie, wat beteken dat dit nooit die verstekroete deur "
"NetwerkBestuurder toegeken sal word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:183
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:213
msgid ""
"The minimum time interval in milliseconds for which dynamic IP configuration "
"should be tried before the connection succeeds. This property is useful for "
"example if both IPv4 and IPv6 are enabled and are allowed to fail. Normally "
"the connection succeeds as soon as one of the two address families "
"completes; by setting a required timeout for e.g. IPv4, one can ensure that "
"even if IP6 succeeds earlier than IPv4, NetworkManager waits some time for "
"IPv4 before the connection becomes active. Note that if \"may-fail\" is "
"FALSE for the same address family, this property has no effect as "
"NetworkManager needs to wait for the full DHCP timeout. A zero value means "
"that no required timeout is present, -1 means the default value (either "
"configuration ipvx.required-timeout override or zero)."
msgstr ""
"Die minimum tyd interval in millisekondes waarvoor dinamiese IP konfigurasie "
"probeer moet word voordat die verbinding slaag. Hierdie eienskap is "
"byvoorbeeld nuttig as beide IPv4 en IPv6 geaktiveer is en toegelaat word om "
"te misluk. Normaalweg slaag die verbinding sodra een van die twee "
"adresfamilies voltooi is; deur 'n vereiste uitteltyd te stel vir bv. IPv4, "
"'n mens kan verseker dat selfs al slaag IP6 vroeër as IPv4, NetworkManager "
"'n rukkie wag vir IPv4 voordat die verbinding aktief word. Let daarop dat as "
"\"may-fail\" ONWAAR is vir dieselfde adresfamilie, hierdie eiendom geen "
"effek het nie, aangesien NetwerkBestuurder moet wag vir die volle DHCP "
"uitteltyd. 'n Nul waarde beteken dat geen vereiste uitteltyd aanwesig is "
"nie, -1 beteken die verstek waarde (óf konfigurasie ipvx.required-timeout "
"verwydering of nul)."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:184
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:214
msgid ""
"The default metric for routes that don't explicitly specify a metric. The "
"default value -1 means that the metric is chosen automatically based on the "
"device type. The metric applies to dynamic routes, manual (static) routes "
"that don't have an explicit metric setting, address prefix routes, and the "
"default route. Note that for IPv6, the kernel accepts zero (0) but coerces "
"it to 1024 (user default). Hence, setting this property to zero effectively "
"mean setting it to 1024. For IPv4, zero is a regular value for the metric."
msgstr ""
"Die verstek metriek vir roetes wat nie 'n maatstaf uitdruklik spesifiseer "
"nie. Die verstek waarde -1 beteken dat die maatstaf outomaties gekies word "
"op grond van die toestel tipe. Die metrieke is van toepassing op dinamiese "
"roetes, handmatige (statiese) roetes wat nie 'n eksplisiete metrieke "
"instelling het nie, adres voorvoegsel roetes en die verstek roete. Let "
"daarop dat vir IPv6, die kern nul (0) aanvaar, maar dit dwing na 1024 "
"(gebruiker verstek). Dus, om hierdie eiendom op nul te stel, beteken "
"effektief om dit op 1024 te stel. Vir IPv4 is nul 'n gereelde waarde vir die "
"metrieke."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:185
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:215
msgid ""
"Enable policy routing (source routing) and set the routing table used when "
"adding routes. This affects all routes, including device-routes, IPv4LL, "
"DHCP, SLAAC, default-routes and static routes. But note that static routes "
"can individually overwrite the setting by explicitly specifying a non-zero "
"routing table. If the table setting is left at zero, it is eligible to be "
"overwritten via global configuration. If the property is zero even after "
"applying the global configuration value, policy routing is disabled for the "
"address family of this connection. Policy routing disabled means that "
"NetworkManager will add all routes to the main table (except static routes "
"that explicitly configure a different table). Additionally, NetworkManager "
"will not delete any extraneous routes from tables except the main table. "
"This is to preserve backward compatibility for users who manage routing "
"tables outside of NetworkManager."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer beleidsroetering (bron roetering) en stel die roeteringtabel wat "
"gebruik word wanneer roetes bygevoeg word. Dit raak alle roetes, insluitend "
"toestel roetes, IPv4LL, DHCP, SLAAC, verstek roetes en statiese roetes. Maar "
"let op dat statiese roetes die instelling individueel kan oorskryf deur 'n "
"nie-nul roetering tabel uitdruklik te spesifiseer. As die tabel instelling "
"op nul gelaat word, kwalifiseer dit om oorgeskryf te word via globale "
"konfigurasie. As die eienskap nul is selfs nadat die globale konfigurasie "
"waarde toegepas is, is beleidroetering gedeaktiveer vir die adresfamilie van "
"hierdie verbinding. Beleidsroetering gedeaktiveer beteken dat "
"NetwerkBestuurder alle roetes by die hooftabel sal voeg (behalwe statiese "
"roetes wat 'n ander tabel uitdruklik konfigureer). Boonop sal "
"NetwerkBestuurder geen vreemde roetes van tabelle uitvee nie, behalwe die "
"hooftabel. Dit is om terugwaartse versoenbaarheid te behou vir gebruikers "
"wat roete tabelle buite NetwerkBestuurder."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:186
msgid ""
"A list of IPv4 destination addresses, prefix length, optional IPv4 next hop "
"addresses, optional route metric, optional attribute. The valid syntax is: "
"\"ip[/prefix] [next-hop] [metric] [attribute=val]...[,ip[/prefix]...]\". For "
"example \"192.0.2.0/24 10.1.1.1 77, 198.51.100.0/24\"."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys van IPv4 bestemming adresse, voorvoegsellengte, opsionele IPv4 "
"volgende hop-adresse, opsionele roetemetriek, opsionele attribuut. Die "
"geldige sintaksis is: \"ip[/prefix] [next-hop] [metriek] "
"[kenmerk=val]...[,ip[/prefix]...]\". Byvoorbeeld \"192.0.2.0/24 10.1.1.1 77, "
"198.51.100.0/24\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:187
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:217
msgid "A comma separated list of routing rules for policy routing."
msgstr "'n Komma-geskeide lys van roetereëls vir beleid roetering."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:231
msgid ""
"Configure method for creating the address for use with RFC4862 IPv6 "
"Stateless Address Autoconfiguration. The permitted values are: "
"NM_SETTING_IP6_CONFIG_ADDR_GEN_MODE_EUI64 (0) or "
"NM_SETTING_IP6_CONFIG_ADDR_GEN_MODE_STABLE_PRIVACY (1). If the property is "
"set to EUI64, the addresses will be generated using the interface tokens "
"derived from hardware address. This makes the host part of the address to "
"stay constant, making it possible to track host's presence when it changes "
"networks. The address changes when the interface hardware is replaced. The "
"value of stable-privacy enables use of cryptographically secure hash of a "
"secret host-specific key along with the connection's stable-id and the "
"network address as specified by RFC7217. This makes it impossible to use the "
"address track host's presence, and makes the address stable when the network "
"interface hardware is replaced. On D-Bus, the absence of an addr-gen-mode "
"setting equals enabling stable-privacy. For keyfile plugin, the absence of "
"the setting on disk means EUI64 so that the property doesn't change on "
"upgrade from older versions. Note that this setting is distinct from the "
"Privacy Extensions as configured by \"ip6-privacy\" property and it does not "
"affect the temporary addresses configured with this option."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:258
msgid ""
"A list of IPv6 addresses and their prefix length. Multiple addresses can be "
"separated by comma. For example \"2001:db8:85a3::8a2e:370:7334/64, "
"2001:db8:85a3::5/64\". The addresses are listed in increasing priority, "
"meaning the last address will be the primary address."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:192
msgid ""
"A string containing the DHCPv6 Unique Identifier (DUID) used by the dhcp "
"client to identify itself to DHCPv6 servers (RFC 3315). The DUID is carried "
"in the Client Identifier option. If the property is a hex string "
"('aa:bb:cc') it is interpreted as a binary DUID and filled as an opaque "
"value in the Client Identifier option. The special value \"lease\" will "
"retrieve the DUID previously used from the lease file belonging to the "
"connection. If no DUID is found and \"dhclient\" is the configured dhcp "
"client, the DUID is searched in the system-wide dhclient lease file. If "
"still no DUID is found, or another dhcp client is used, a global and "
"permanent DUID-UUID (RFC 6355) will be generated based on the machine-id. "
"The special values \"llt\" and \"ll\" will generate a DUID of type LLT or LL "
"(see RFC 3315) based on the current MAC address of the device. In order to "
"try providing a stable DUID-LLT, the time field will contain a constant "
"timestamp that is used globally (for all profiles) and persisted to disk. "
"The special values \"stable-llt\", \"stable-ll\" and \"stable-uuid\" will "
"generate a DUID of the corresponding type, derived from the connection's "
"stable-id and a per-host unique key. You may want to include the "
"\"${DEVICE}\" or \"${MAC}\" specifier in the stable-id, in case this profile "
"gets activated on multiple devices. So, the link-layer address of \"stable-"
"ll\" and \"stable-llt\" will be a generated address derived from the stable "
"id. The DUID-LLT time value in the \"stable-llt\" option will be picked "
"among a static timespan of three years (the upper bound of the interval is "
"the same constant timestamp used in \"llt\"). When the property is unset, "
"the global value provided for \"ipv6.dhcp-duid\" is used. If no global value "
"is provided, the default \"lease\" value is assumed."
msgstr ""
"'n Toutjie wat die DHCPv6 Unique Identifier (DUID) bevat wat deur die dhcp "
"klient gebruik word om homself aan DHCPv6 bedieners (RFC 3315) te "
"identifiseer. Die DUID word in die Klient Identifier opsie gedra. As die "
"eiendom 'n hex toutjie ('aa:bb:cc') is, word dit geïnterpreteer as 'n binêre "
"DUID en gevul as 'n ondeursigtige waarde in die Klient Identifier opsie. Die "
"spesiale waarde \"lease\" sal die DUID wat voorheen gebruik is, haal van die "
"huurlêer wat aan die verbinding behoort. As geen DUID gevind word nie en "
"\"dhclient\" is die gekonfigureerde dhcp klient, word die DUID in die "
"stelselwye dhclient huurlêer gesoek. As daar steeds geen DUID gevind word "
"nie, of 'n ander dhcp klient gebruik word, sal 'n globale en permanente DUID-"
"UUID (RFC 6355) gegenereer word gebaseer op die masjien-ID. Die spesiale "
"waardes \"llt\" en \"ll\" sal 'n DUID van tipe LLT of LL genereer (sien RFC "
"3315) gebaseer op die huidige MAC adres van die toestel. Om te probeer om 'n "
"stabiele DUID-LLT te verskaf, sal die tydveld 'n konstante tydstempel bevat "
"wat wêreldwyd (vir alle profiele) gebruik word en na skyf voortgesit word. "
"Die spesiale waardes \"stable-llt\", \"stable-ll\" en \"stable-uuid\" sal 'n "
"DUID van die ooreenstemmende tipe genereer, afgelei van die verbinding se "
"stable-id en 'n per-gasheer unieke sleutel. Jy sal dalk die \"${DEVICE}\" of "
"\"${MAC}\" spesifiseerder in die stable-id wil insluit, ingeval hierdie "
"profiel op verskeie toestelle geaktiveer word. Dus, die skakellaagadres van "
"\"stable-ll\" en \"stable-llt\" sal 'n gegenereerde adres wees wat afgelei "
"is van die stabiele id. Die DUID-LLT tyd waarde in die \"stable-llt\" opsie "
"sal gekies word uit 'n statiese tydsduur van drie jaar (die boonste grens "
"van die interval is dieselfde konstante tydstempel wat in \"llt\" gebruik "
"word). Wanneer die eiendom nie ingestel is nie, word die globale waarde wat "
"vir \"ipv6.dhcp-duid\" verskaf is, gebruik. Indien geen globale waarde "
"verskaf word nie, word die verstek \"huur\" waarde aanvaar."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:206
msgid ""
"Configure IPv6 Privacy Extensions for SLAAC, described in RFC4941.  If "
"enabled, it makes the kernel generate a temporary IPv6 address in addition "
"to the public one generated from MAC address via modified EUI-64.  This "
"enhances privacy, but could cause problems in some applications, on the "
"other hand.  The permitted values are: -1: unknown, 0: disabled, 1: enabled "
"(prefer public address), 2: enabled (prefer temporary addresses). Having a "
"per-connection setting set to \"-1\" (unknown) means fallback to global "
"configuration \"ipv6.ip6-privacy\". If also global configuration is "
"unspecified or set to \"-1\", fallback to read "
"\"/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/default/use_tempaddr\". Note that this setting is "
"distinct from the Stable Privacy addresses that can be enabled with the "
"\"addr-gen-mode\" property's \"stable-privacy\" setting as another way of "
"avoiding host tracking with IPv6 addresses."
msgstr ""
"Stel IPv6 Privaatheid Uitbreidings op vir SLAAC, beskryf in RFC4941. As dit "
"geaktiveer is, laat dit die kern 'n tydelike IPv6 adres genereer bykomend "
"tot die publieke een wat gegenereer word vanaf MAC adres via gewysigde EUI-"
"64. Dit verbeter privaatheid, maar kan probleme in sommige toepassings "
"veroorsaak, aan die ander kant. Die toegelate waardes is: -1: onbekend, 0: "
"gedeaktiveer, 1: geaktiveer (verkies openbare adres), 2: aangeskakel "
"(verkies tydelike adresse). As 'n per-verbinding-instelling op \"-1\" "
"(onbekend) gestel is, beteken dit terugval na globale konfigurasie "
"\"ipv6.ip6-privacy\". As ook globale konfigurasie ongespesifiseer is of op "
"\"-1 gestel is\", terugval om "
"\"/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/default/use_tempaddr\" te lees. Let daarop dat "
"hierdie instelling verskil van die Stabiele Privaatheids adresse wat "
"geaktiveer kan word met die \"addr-gen-mode\" eiendom se \"stable-privacy\" "
"instelling as 'n ander manier om gasheeropsporing met IPv6 adresse te vermy."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:211
msgid ""
"A timeout for waiting Router Advertisements in seconds. If zero (the "
"default), a globally configured default is used. If still unspecified, the "
"timeout depends on the sysctl settings of the device. Set to 2147483647 "
"(MAXINT32) for infinity."
msgstr ""
"'n Tydtyd vir wag van Router Advertensies in sekondes. Indien nul (die "
"verstek), word 'n globaal gekonfigureerde verstek gebruik. As dit steeds "
"ongespesifiseer is, hang die uitteltyd af van die sysctl-instellings van die "
"toestel. Stel op 2147483647 (MAXINT32) vir oneindig."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:216
msgid "Array of IP routes."
msgstr "Skikking van IP roetes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:218
msgid ""
"Configure the token for draft-chown-6man-tokenised-ipv6-identifiers-02 IPv6 "
"tokenized interface identifiers. Useful with eui64 addr-gen-mode."
msgstr ""
"Konfigureer die teken vir draft-chown-6man-tokenised-ipv6-identifiers-02 "
"IPv6-tokenised koppelvlak-identifiseerders. Nuttig met eui64 addr-gen-modus."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:233
msgid "Whether the transmitted traffic must be encrypted."
msgstr "Of die oorgedrade verkeer geënkripteer moet word."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:254
msgid ""
"The pre-shared CAK (Connectivity Association Key) for MACsec Key Agreement."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:235
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"mka-cak\" property."
msgstr "Vlae wat aandui hoe om die \"mka-cak\" eiendom te hanteer."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:256
msgid ""
"The pre-shared CKN (Connectivity-association Key Name) for MACsec Key "
"Agreement."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:237
msgid ""
"Specifies how the CAK (Connectivity Association Key) for MKA (MACsec Key "
"Agreement) is obtained."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer hoe die CAK (Konnektiwiteit Assosiasie Sleutel) vir MKA (MACsec "
"Sleutel Ooreenkoms) word verkry."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:238
msgid ""
"If given, specifies the parent interface name or parent connection UUID from "
"which this MACSEC interface should be created.  If this property is not "
"specified, the connection must contain an \"802-3-ethernet\" setting with a "
"\"mac-address\" property."
msgstr ""
"Indien gegee, spesifiseer die ouer koppelvlak naam of ouer verbinding UUID "
"waaruit hierdie MACSEC koppelvlak geskep moet word. As hierdie eienskap nie "
"gespesifiseer is nie, moet die verbinding 'n \"802-3-ethernet\" instelling "
"met 'n \"mac-address\" eiendom bevat."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:239
msgid ""
"The port component of the SCI (Secure Channel Identifier), between 1 and "
"65534."
msgstr ""
"Die poort komponent van die SCI (Veilige Kanaal Identifiseerder), tussen 1 "
"en 65534."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:240
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the SCI (Secure Channel Identifier) is included in every "
"packet."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer of die SCI (Veilige Kanaal Identifiseerder) by elke pakkie "
"ingesluit is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:241
msgid "Specifies the validation mode for incoming frames."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die validering modus vir inkomende rame."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:242
msgid ""
"The macvlan mode, which specifies the communication mechanism between "
"multiple macvlans on the same lower device."
msgstr ""
"Die macvlan modus, wat die kommunikasie meganisme tussen veelvuldige "
"macvlans op dieselfde onderste toestel spesifiseer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:243
msgid ""
"If given, specifies the parent interface name or parent connection UUID from "
"which this MAC-VLAN interface should be created.  If this property is not "
"specified, the connection must contain an \"802-3-ethernet\" setting with a "
"\"mac-address\" property."
msgstr ""
"Indien gegee, spesifiseer die ouer koppelvlak naam of ouer verbinding UUID "
"waaruit hierdie MAC-VLAN koppelvlak geskep moet word. As hierdie eienskap "
"nie gespesifiseer is nie, moet die verbinding 'n \"802-3-ethernet\" "
"instelling bevat met 'n \"mac-address\" eiendom."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:244
msgid "Whether the interface should be put in promiscuous mode."
msgstr "Of die koppelvlak in promiskue modus geplaas moet word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:245
msgid "Whether the interface should be a MACVTAP."
msgstr "Of die koppelvlak 'n MACVTAP behoort wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:246
msgid ""
"A list of driver names to match. Each element is a shell wildcard pattern. "
"See NMSettingMatch:interface-name for how special characters '|', '&', '!' "
"and '\\' are used for optional and mandatory matches and inverting the "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys van drywer name om te pas. Elke element is 'n shell jokerteken "
"patroon. Sien NMSettingMatch:interface-naam vir hoe spesiale karakters '|', "
"'&', '!' en '\\' word gebruik vir opsionele en verpligte passings en om die "
"patroon om te keer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:247
msgid ""
"A list of interface names to match. Each element is a shell wildcard "
"pattern. An element can be prefixed with a pipe symbol (|) or an ampersand "
"(&). The former means that the element is optional and the latter means that "
"it is mandatory. If there are any optional elements, than the match "
"evaluates to true if at least one of the optional element matches (logical "
"OR). If there are any mandatory elements, then they all must match (logical "
"AND). By default, an element is optional. This means that an element \"foo\" "
"behaves the same as \"|foo\". An element can also be inverted with "
"exclamation mark (!) between the pipe symbol (or the ampersand) and before "
"the pattern. Note that \"!foo\" is a shortcut for the mandatory match "
"\"&!foo\". Finally, a backslash can be used at the beginning of the element "
"(after the optional special characters) to escape the start of the pattern. "
"For example, \"&\\!a\" is an mandatory match for literally \"!a\"."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys van koppelvlakname om te pas. Elke element is 'n shell jokerteken "
"patroon. 'n Element kan deur 'n pypsimbool (|) of 'n ampersand (&) "
"voorafgegaan word. Eersgenoemde beteken dat die element opsioneel is en "
"laasgenoemde beteken dat dit verpligtend is. As daar enige opsionele "
"elemente is, evalueer die passing na waar as ten minste een van die "
"opsionele elemente ooreenstem (logiese OF). As daar enige verpligte elemente "
"is, moet hulle almal ooreenstem (logies EN). By verstek is 'n element "
"opsioneel. Dit beteken dat 'n element \"foo\" dieselfde optree as \"|foo\". "
"'n Element kan ook omgekeer word met 'n uitroepteken (!) tussen die "
"pypsimbool (of die ampersand) en voor die patroon. Let daarop dat \"!foo\" "
"'n kortpad is vir die verpligte pasmaat \"&!foo\". Laastens kan 'n "
"terugskuinsstreep aan die begin van die element (na die opsionele spesiale "
"karakters) gebruik word om die begin van die patroon te ontsnap. "
"Byvoorbeeld, \"&\\!a\" is 'n verpligte pasmaat vir letterlike \"!a\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:248
msgid ""
"A list of kernel command line arguments to match. This may be used to check "
"whether a specific kernel command line option is set (or unset, if prefixed "
"with the exclamation mark). The argument must either be a single word, or an "
"assignment (i.e. two words, joined by \"=\"). In the former case the kernel "
"command line is searched for the word appearing as is, or as left hand side "
"of an assignment. In the latter case, the exact assignment is looked for "
"with right and left hand side matching. Wildcard patterns are not supported. "
"See NMSettingMatch:interface-name for how special characters '|', '&', '!' "
"and '\\' are used for optional and mandatory matches and inverting the match."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys kernel opdragreël argumente om te pas. Dit kan gebruik word om te "
"kontroleer of 'n spesifieke kernel opdragreël opsie gestel is (of unset, "
"indien die uitroepteken voorvoeg). Die argument moet óf 'n enkele woord "
"wees, óf 'n opdrag (d.w.s. twee woorde, verbind deur \"=\"). In eersgenoemde "
"geval word die kernel opdragreël gesoek vir die woord wat soos dit verskyn, "
"of as die linkerkant van 'n opdrag. In laasgenoemde geval word na die "
"presiese opdrag gesoek met regter en linkerkant-passing. Jokerteken patrone "
"word nie ondersteun nie. Sien NMSettingMatch:interface-naam vir hoe spesiale "
"karakters '|', '&', '!' en '\\' word gebruik vir opsionele en verpligte "
"passings en om die passing om te keer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:249
msgid ""
"A list of paths to match against the ID_PATH udev property of devices. "
"ID_PATH represents the topological persistent path of a device. It typically "
"contains a subsystem string (pci, usb, platform, etc.) and a subsystem-"
"specific identifier. For PCI devices the path has the form \"pci-"
"$domain:$bus:$device.$function\", where each variable is an hexadecimal "
"value; for example \"pci-0000:0a:00.0\". The path of a device can be "
"obtained with \"udevadm info /sys/class/net/$dev | grep ID_PATH=\" or by "
"looking at the \"path\" property exported by NetworkManager (\"nmcli -f "
"general.path device show $dev\"). Each element of the list is a shell "
"wildcard pattern. See NMSettingMatch:interface-name for how special "
"characters '|', '&', '!' and '\\' are used for optional and mandatory "
"matches and inverting the pattern."
msgstr ""
"'n Lys paaie wat ooreenstem met die ID_PATH udev eiendom van toestelle. "
"ID_PATH verteenwoordig die topologiese aanhoudende pad van 'n toestel. Dit "
"bevat tipies 'n substelsel string (pci, usb, platform, ens.) en 'n "
"substelsel-spesifieke identifiseerder. Vir PCI toestelle het die pad die "
"vorm \"pci-$domain:$bus:$device.$function\", waar elke veranderlike 'n "
"heksadesimale waarde is; byvoorbeeld \"pci-0000:0a:00.0\". Die pad van 'n "
"toestel kan verkry word met \"udevadm info /sys/class/net/$dev | grep "
"ID_PATH=\" of deur te kyk na die \"path\" eiendom wat deur NetwerkBestuurder "
"uitgevoer word (\"nmcli -f general.path device show $dev\"). Elke element "
"van die lys is 'n shell jokerteken patroon. Sien NMSettingMatch:interface-"
"name vir hoe spesiale karakters '|', '&', '!' en '\\' word gebruik vir "
"opsionele en verpligte passings en om die patroon om te keer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:253
msgid "The data path type. One of \"system\", \"netdev\" or empty."
msgstr "Die tipe datapad. Een van \"system\", \"netdev\" of leeg."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:254
msgid "The bridge failure mode. One of \"secure\", \"standalone\" or empty."
msgstr ""
"Die brug mislukking modus. Een van \"secure\", \"standalone\" of leeg."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:255
msgid "Enable or disable multicast snooping."
msgstr "Aktiveer of deaktiveer multicast snuffel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:256
msgid "Enable or disable RSTP."
msgstr "Aktiveer of deaktiveer RSTP."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:257
msgid "Enable or disable STP."
msgstr "Aktiveer of deaktiveer STP."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:258
msgid "Open vSwitch DPDK device arguments."
msgstr "Maak vSwitch DPDK toestel argumente oop."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:259
msgid ""
"Open vSwitch DPDK number of rx queues. Defaults to zero which means to leave "
"the parameter in OVS unspecified and effectively configures one queue."
msgstr ""
"Maak vSwitch DPDK aantal rx-rye oop. Verstek na nul wat beteken om die "
"parameter in OVS ongespesifiseer te laat en konfigureer effektief een tou."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:434
msgid "A dictionary of key/value pairs with exernal-ids for OVS."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:263
msgid ""
"The interface type. Either \"internal\", \"system\", \"patch\", \"dpdk\", or "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"Die koppelvlak tipe. Óf \"internal\", \"system\", \"patch\", \"dpdk\", of "
"leeg."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:264
msgid ""
"Specifies the name of the interface for the other side of the patch. The "
"patch on the other side must also set this interface as peer."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die naam van die koppelvlak vir die ander kant van die pleister. "
"Die pleister aan die ander kant moet ook hierdie koppelvlak as eweknie stel."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:265
msgid "The time port must be inactive in order to be considered down."
msgstr "Die tydpoort moet onaktief wees om as af geag te word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:266
msgid ""
"Bonding mode. One of \"active-backup\", \"balance-slb\", or \"balance-tcp\"."
msgstr ""
"Bonding modus. Een van \"active-backup\", \"balance-slb\", of \"balance-"
"tcp\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:267
msgid "The time port must be active before it starts forwarding traffic."
msgstr "Die tydpoort moet aktief wees voordat dit verkeer begin aanstuur."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:268
msgid "LACP mode. One of \"active\", \"off\", or \"passive\"."
msgstr "LACP modus. Een van \"active\", \"off\", of \"passive\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:269
msgid "The VLAN tag in the range 0-4095."
msgstr "Die VLAN tag in die reeks 0-4095."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:282
msgid ""
"The VLAN mode. One of \"access\", \"native-tagged\", \"native-untagged\", "
"\"trunk\" or unset."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:272
msgid ""
"If non-zero, instruct pppd to set the serial port to the specified baudrate. "
" This value should normally be left as 0 to automatically choose the speed."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, gee pppd opdrag om die seriële poort op die gespesifiseerde "
"baudrate te stel. Hierdie waarde moet normaalweg as 0 gelaat word om die "
"spoed outomaties te kies."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:273
msgid ""
"If TRUE, specify that pppd should set the serial port to use hardware flow "
"control with RTS and CTS signals.  This value should normally be set to "
"FALSE."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, spesifiseer dat pppd die seriële poort moet stel om "
"hardewarevloeibeheer met RTS en CTS seine te gebruik. Hierdie waarde moet "
"normaalweg op VALS gestel word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:274
msgid ""
"If non-zero, instruct pppd to presume the connection to the peer has failed "
"if the specified number of LCP echo-requests go unanswered by the peer.  The "
"\"lcp-echo-interval\" property must also be set to a non-zero value if this "
"property is used."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, gee pppd opdrag om aan te neem dat die verbinding met die "
"eweknie misluk het as die gespesifiseerde aantal LCP eggo-versoeke nie deur "
"die eweknie beantwoord word nie. Die \"lcp-echo-interval\" eiendom moet ook "
"op 'n nie-nul waarde gestel word indien hierdie eiendom gebruik word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:275
msgid ""
"If non-zero, instruct pppd to send an LCP echo-request frame to the peer "
"every n seconds (where n is the specified value).  Note that some PPP peers "
"will respond to echo requests and some will not, and it is not possible to "
"autodetect this."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, gee pppd opdrag om 'n LCP eggo-versoek raam elke n sekondes "
"na die eweknie te stuur (waar n die gespesifiseerde waarde is). Let daarop "
"dat sommige PPP eweknieë op eggo versoeke sal reageer en sommige nie, en dit "
"is nie moontlik om dit outomaties op te spoor nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:276
msgid ""
"If TRUE, stateful MPPE is used.  See pppd documentation for more information "
"on stateful MPPE."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, word stateful MPPE gebruik. Sien pppd-dokumentasie vir meer "
"inligting oor statige MPPE."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:277
msgid ""
"If non-zero, instruct pppd to request that the peer send packets no larger "
"than the specified size.  If non-zero, the MRU should be between 128 and "
"16384."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, gee pppd opdrag om te versoek dat die eweknie pakkies nie "
"groter as die gespesifiseerde grootte stuur nie. Indien nie-nul, moet die "
"MRU tussen 128 en 16384 wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:278
msgid ""
"If non-zero, instruct pppd to send packets no larger than the specified size."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, gee pppd opdrag om pakkies te stuur wat nie groter is as die "
"gespesifiseerde grootte nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:279
msgid "If TRUE, Van Jacobsen TCP header compression will not be requested."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, sal Van Jacobsen TCP kopskrif kompressie nie versoek word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:280
msgid ""
"If TRUE, do not require the other side (usually the PPP server) to "
"authenticate itself to the client.  If FALSE, require authentication from "
"the remote side.  In almost all cases, this should be TRUE."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, moenie van die ander kant (gewoonlik die PPP bediener) vereis "
"om homself aan die kliënt te verifieer nie. Indien ONWAAR, vereis stawing "
"vanaf die afgeleë kant. In byna alle gevalle behoort dit WAAR te wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:281
msgid "If TRUE, BSD compression will not be requested."
msgstr "Indien WAAR, sal BSD kompressie nie versoek word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:282
msgid "If TRUE, \"deflate\" compression will not be requested."
msgstr "Indien WAAR, sal \"deflate\" kompressie nie versoek word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:283
msgid "If TRUE, the CHAP authentication method will not be used."
msgstr "Indien WAAR, sal die CHAP stawing metode nie gebruik word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:284
msgid "If TRUE, the EAP authentication method will not be used."
msgstr "Indien WAAR, sal die EAP stawing metode nie gebruik word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:285
msgid "If TRUE, the MSCHAP authentication method will not be used."
msgstr "Indien WAAR, sal die MSCHAP stawing metode nie gebruik word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:286
msgid "If TRUE, the MSCHAPv2 authentication method will not be used."
msgstr "Indien WAAR, sal die MSCHAPv2 stawing metode nie gebruik word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:287
msgid "If TRUE, the PAP authentication method will not be used."
msgstr "Indien WAAR, sal die PAP stawing metode nie gebruik word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:288
msgid ""
"If TRUE, MPPE (Microsoft Point-to-Point Encryption) will be required for the "
"PPP session.  If either 64-bit or 128-bit MPPE is not available the session "
"will fail.  Note that MPPE is not used on mobile broadband connections."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, sal MPPE (Microsoft Punt-tot-Punt Enkripsie) vir die PPP sessie "
"vereis word. As óf 64-bis of 128-bis MPPE nie beskikbaar is nie, sal die "
"sessie misluk. Let daarop dat MPPE nie op mobiele breëband verbindings "
"gebruik word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:289
msgid ""
"If TRUE, 128-bit MPPE (Microsoft Point-to-Point Encryption) will be required "
"for the PPP session, and the \"require-mppe\" property must also be set to "
"TRUE.  If 128-bit MPPE is not available the session will fail."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, sal 128-bis MPPE (Microsoft Punt-tot-Punt Enkripsie) vereis "
"word vir die PPP-sessie, en die \"require-mppe\" eiendom moet ook op WAAR "
"gestel word. As 128-bis MPPE nie beskikbaar is nie, sal die sessie misluk."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:290
msgid ""
"If given, specifies the parent interface name on which this PPPoE connection "
"should be created.  If this property is not specified, the connection is "
"activated on the interface specified in \"interface-name\" of "
"NMSettingConnection."
msgstr ""
"Indien gegee, spesifiseer die ouer koppelvlak naam waarop hierdie PPPoE "
"verbinding geskep moet word. As hierdie eiendom nie gespesifiseer is nie, "
"word die verbinding geaktiveer op die koppelvlak gespesifiseer in "
"\"interface-name\" van NMSettingConnection."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:291
msgid "Password used to authenticate with the PPPoE service."
msgstr "Wagwoord gebruik om outentiseer met die PPPoE diens."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:293
msgid ""
"If specified, instruct PPPoE to only initiate sessions with access "
"concentrators that provide the specified service.  For most providers, this "
"should be left blank.  It is only required if there are multiple access "
"concentrators or a specific service is known to be required."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, gee PPPoE opdrag om slegs sessies te begin met toegang "
"konsentrators wat die gespesifiseerde diens verskaf. Vir die meeste "
"verskaffers moet dit leeg gelaat word. Dit word slegs vereis as daar "
"veelvuldige toegangskonsentrators is of dit bekend is dat 'n spesifieke "
"diens benodig word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:294
msgid "Username used to authenticate with the PPPoE service."
msgstr "Gebruikernaam gebruik om met die PPPoE diens te outentiseer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:295
msgid "Whether the proxy configuration is for browser only."
msgstr "Of die proxy konfigurasie slegs vir blaaier is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:296
msgid ""
"Method for proxy configuration, Default is NM_SETTING_PROXY_METHOD_NONE (0)"
msgstr ""
"Metode vir proxy konfigurasie, Verstek is NM_SETTING_PROXY_METHOD_NONE (0)"

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:311
msgid "PAC script for the connection."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:298
msgid "PAC URL for obtaining PAC file."
msgstr "PAC URL vir die verkryging van PAC lêer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:299
msgid ""
"Speed to use for communication over the serial port.  Note that this value "
"usually has no effect for mobile broadband modems as they generally ignore "
"speed settings and use the highest available speed."
msgstr ""
"Spoed om te gebruik vir kommunikasie oor die seriële poort. Let daarop dat "
"hierdie waarde gewoonlik geen effek het vir mobiele breëband modems nie, "
"aangesien hulle oor die algemeen spoedinstellings ignoreer en die hoogste "
"beskikbare spoed gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:300
msgid "Byte-width of the serial communication. The 8 in \"8n1\" for example."
msgstr ""
"Byte-breedte van die seriële kommunikasie. Die 8 in \"8n1\" byvoorbeeld."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:301
msgid "Parity setting of the serial port."
msgstr "Pariteit instelling van die seriële poort."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:302
msgid "Time to delay between each byte sent to the modem, in microseconds."
msgstr ""
"Tyd om te vertraag tussen elke greep wat na die modem gestuur word, in "
"mikrosekondes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:303
msgid ""
"Number of stop bits for communication on the serial port.  Either 1 or 2. "
"The 1 in \"8n1\" for example."
msgstr ""
"Aantal stoppunte vir kommunikasie op die seriële poort. Óf 1 of 2. Die 1 in "
"\"8n1\" byvoorbeeld."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:304
msgid ""
"Whether to autoprobe virtual functions by a compatible driver. If set to "
"NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1), the kernel will try to bind VFs to a compatible driver "
"and if this succeeds a new network interface will be instantiated for each "
"VF. If set to NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0), VFs will not be claimed and no network "
"interfaces will be created for them. When set to NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1), "
"the global default is used; in case the global default is unspecified it is "
"assumed to be NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1)."
msgstr ""
"Of virtuele funksies outomaties deur 'n versoenbare bestuurder moet "
"ondersoek word. As dit op NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1) gestel is, sal die kern "
"probeer om VF's aan 'n versoenbare drywer te bind en as dit slaag, sal 'n "
"nuwe netwerkkoppelvlak vir elke VF geïnstantieer word. As dit op "
"NM_TERNARY_FALSE (0) gestel is, sal VF'e nie opgeëis word nie en geen "
"netwerkkoppelvlakke sal daarvoor geskep word nie. Wanneer dit op "
"NM_TERNARY_DEFAULT (-1) gestel is, word die globale verstek gebruik; in die "
"geval dat die globale verstek ongespesifiseer is, word aanvaar dat dit "
"NM_TERNARY_TRUE (1) is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:305
msgid ""
"The total number of virtual functions to create. Note that when the sriov "
"setting is present NetworkManager enforces the number of virtual functions "
"on the interface (also when it is zero) during activation and resets it upon "
"deactivation. To prevent any changes to SR-IOV parameters don't add a sriov "
"setting to the connection."
msgstr ""
"Die totale aantal virtuele funksies om te skep. Let daarop dat wanneer die "
"sriov instelling teenwoordig is, dwing NetwerkBestuurder die aantal virtuele "
"funksies op die koppelvlak af (ook wanneer dit nul is) tydens aktivering en "
"stel dit terug by deaktivering. Om enige veranderinge aan SR-IOV parameters "
"te voorkom, moenie 'n sriov instelling by die verbinding voeg nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:306
msgid ""
"Array of virtual function descriptors. Each VF descriptor is a dictionary "
"mapping attribute names to GVariant values. The 'index' entry is mandatory "
"for each VF. When represented as string a VF is in the form: \"INDEX "
"[ATTR=VALUE[ ATTR=VALUE]...]\". for example: \"2 mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 spoof-"
"check=true\". Multiple VFs can be specified using a comma as separator. "
"Currently, the following attributes are supported: mac, spoof-check, trust, "
"min-tx-rate, max-tx-rate, vlans. The \"vlans\" attribute is represented as a "
"semicolon-separated list of VLAN descriptors, where each descriptor has the "
"form \"ID[.PRIORITY[.PROTO]]\". PROTO can be either 'q' for 802.1Q (the "
"default) or 'ad' for 802.1ad."
msgstr ""
"Elke VF beskrywer is 'n woordeboek wat kenmerk name na GVariant waardes "
"karteer. Die 'index' inskrywing is verpligtend vir elke VF. Wanneer 'n VF as "
"string voorgestel word in die vorm: \"INDEKS [ATTR=WAARDE[ "
"ATTR=WAARDE]...]\". byvoorbeeld: \"2 mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 spoof-"
"check=true\". Veelvuldige VF'e kan gespesifiseer word met behulp van 'n "
"komma as skeiding. Tans word die volgende eienskappe ondersteun: mac, spoof-"
"check, trust, min-tx-rate, max-tx-rate, vlans. Die \"vlans\" attribuut word "
"voorgestel as 'n kommapunt geskeide lys van VLAN beskrywers, waar elke "
"beskrywer die vorm \"ID[.PRIORITY[.PROTO]] het. PROTO kan óf 'q' vir 802.1Q "
"(die verstek) of 'ad' vir 802.1ad wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:307
msgid ""
"Array of TC queueing disciplines. When the \"tc\" setting is present, qdiscs "
"from this property are applied upon activation. If the property is empty, "
"all qdiscs are removed and the device will only have the default qdisc "
"assigned by kernel according to the \"net.core.default_qdisc\" sysctl. If "
"the \"tc\" setting is not present, NetworkManager doesn't touch the qdiscs "
"present on the interface."
msgstr ""
"Verskeidenheid TC toue dissiplines. Wanneer die \"tc\" instelling "
"teenwoordig is, word qdiscs vanaf hierdie eiendom toegepas by aktivering. As "
"die eiendom leeg is, word alle qdiscs verwyder en die toestel sal slegs die "
"verstek qdisc hê wat deur kern toegewys is volgens die "
"\"net.core.default_qdisc\" sysctl. As die \"tc\" instelling nie teenwoordig "
"is nie, raak NetwerkBestuurder nie aan die qdiscs wat op die koppelvlak "
"teenwoordig is nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:308
msgid ""
"Array of TC traffic filters. When the \"tc\" setting is present, filters "
"from this property are applied upon activation. If the property is empty, "
"NetworkManager removes all the filters. If the \"tc\" setting is not "
"present, NetworkManager doesn't touch the filters present on the interface."
msgstr ""
"Skikking van TC verkeer filters. Wanneer die \"tc\" instelling teenwoordig "
"is, word filters vanaf hierdie eiendom toegepas by aktivering. As die "
"eiendom leeg is, verwyder NetwerkManager al die filters. As die \"tc\" "
"instelling nie teenwoordig is nie, raak NetworkBestuurder nie aan die "
"filters wat op die koppelvlak teenwoordig is nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:309
msgid ""
"The JSON configuration for the team network interface.  The property should "
"contain raw JSON configuration data suitable for teamd, because the value is "
"passed directly to teamd. If not specified, the default configuration is "
"used.  See man teamd.conf for the format details."
msgstr ""
"Die JSON konfigurasie vir die span netwerk koppelvlak. Die eiendom moet rou "
"JSON konfigurasie data bevat wat geskik is vir teamd, want die waarde word "
"direk na teamd deurgegee. Indien nie gespesifiseer nie, word die "
"verstekkonfigurasie gebruik. Sien man teamd.conf vir die formaat "
"besonderhede."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:310
#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:328
msgid ""
"Link watchers configuration for the connection: each link watcher is defined "
"by a dictionary, whose keys depend upon the selected link watcher. Available "
"link watchers are 'ethtool', 'nsna_ping' and 'arp_ping' and it is specified "
"in the dictionary with the key 'name'. Available keys are:   ethtool: 'delay-"
"up', 'delay-down', 'init-wait'; nsna_ping: 'init-wait', 'interval', 'missed-"
"max', 'target-host'; arp_ping: all the ones in nsna_ping and 'source-host', "
"'validate-active', 'validate-inactive', 'send-always'. See teamd.conf man "
"for more details."
msgstr ""
"Skakelkykers konfigurasie vir die verbinding: elk skakelkykers word "
"gedefinieer deur 'n woordeboek, waarvan die sleutels afhang van die "
"geselekteerde skakelkykers. Beskikbaar skakelkykers is 'ethtool', "
"'nsna_ping' en 'arp_ping' en dit word in die woordeboek gespesifiseer met "
"die sleutel 'name'. Beskikbare sleutels is:   ethtool: 'delay-up', 'delay-"
"down', 'init-wait'; nsna_ping: 'init-wait', 'interval', 'missed-max', "
"'target-host'; arp_ping: alle die eens in nsna_ping en 'source-host', "
"'validate-active', 'validate-inactive', 'send-always'. sien teamd.conf man "
"vir meer besonderhede."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:311
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd mcast_rejoin.count."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd mcast_rejoin.count."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:312
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd mcast_rejoin.interval."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd mcast_rejoin.interval."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:313
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd notify_peers.count."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd notify_peers.count."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:314
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd notify_peers.interval."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd notify_peers.interval."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:315
msgid ""
"Corresponds to the teamd runner.name. Permitted values are: \"roundrobin\", "
"\"broadcast\", \"activebackup\", \"loadbalance\", \"lacp\", \"random\"."
msgstr ""
"Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.name. Toegelate waardes is: "
"\"roundrobin\", \"broadcast\", \"activebackup\", \"loadbalance\", \"lacp\", "
"\"random\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:316
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.active."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.active."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:317
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.agg_select_policy."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.agg_select_policy."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:318
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.fast_rate."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.fast_rate."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:319
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.hwaddr_policy."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.hwaddr_policy."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:320
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.min_ports."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.min_ports."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:321
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.sys_prio."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.sys_prio."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:322
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.tx_balancer.name."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.tx_balancer.name."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:323
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.tx_balancer.interval."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.tx_balancer.interval."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:324
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd runner.tx_hash."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd runner.tx_hash."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:325
msgid ""
"The JSON configuration for the team port. The property should contain raw "
"JSON configuration data suitable for teamd, because the value is passed "
"directly to teamd. If not specified, the default configuration is used. See "
"man teamd.conf for the format details."
msgstr ""
"Die JSON konfigurasie vir die spanpoort. Die eiendom moet rou JSON "
"konfigurasie data bevat wat geskik is vir teamd, want die waarde word direk "
"na teamd deurgegee. Indien nie gespesifiseer nie, word die verstek "
"konfigurasie gebruik. Sien man teamd.conf vir die formaat besonderhede."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:326
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.lacp_key."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.lacp_key."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:327
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.lacp_prio."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.lacp_prio."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:329
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.prio."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.prio."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:330
msgid ""
"Corresponds to the teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.queue_id. When set to -1 means the "
"parameter is skipped from the json config."
msgstr ""
"Korrespondeer om te die teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.queue_id. Wanneer ingestel op "
"-1 beteken dat die parameter oorgeslaan word vanaf die json konfig."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:331
msgid "Corresponds to the teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.sticky."
msgstr "Korrespondeer om te die teamd ports.PORTIFNAME.sticky."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:332
msgid ""
"The group ID which will own the device. If set to NULL everyone will be able "
"to use the device."
msgstr ""
"Die groep ID wat die toestel sal besit. Indien dit op NULL gestel is sal "
"almal die toestel kan gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:333
msgid ""
"The operating mode of the virtual device. Allowed values are "
"NM_SETTING_TUN_MODE_TUN (1) to create a layer 3 device and "
"NM_SETTING_TUN_MODE_TAP (2) to create an Ethernet-like layer 2 one."
msgstr ""
"Die bedryf modus van die virtuele toestel. Toegelate waardes is "
"NM_SETTING_TUN_MODE_TUN (1) om 'n laag 3-toestel te skep en "
"NM_SETTING_TUN_MODE_TAP (2) om 'n Ethernet-agtige laag 2 een te skep."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:334
msgid ""
"If the property is set to TRUE, the interface will support multiple file "
"descriptors (queues) to parallelize packet sending or receiving. Otherwise, "
"the interface will only support a single queue."
msgstr ""
"As die eiendom op WAAR gestel is, sal die koppelvlak verskeie lêerbeskrywers "
"(toue) ondersteun om pakkieversending of  ontvangs te paralleliseer. "
"Andersins sal die koppelvlak slegs 'n enkele tou ondersteun."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:335
msgid ""
"The user ID which will own the device. If set to NULL everyone will be able "
"to use the device."
msgstr ""
"Die gebruiker ID wat die toestel sal besit. As dit op NULL gestel is, sal "
"almal die toestel kan gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:336
msgid ""
"If TRUE the interface will prepend a 4 byte header describing the physical "
"interface to the packets."
msgstr ""
"Indien WAAR, sal die koppelvlak 'n 4 grepe kopskrif aanbring wat die fisiese "
"koppelvlak met die pakkies beskryf."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:337
msgid ""
"If TRUE the IFF_VNET_HDR the tunnel packets will include a virtio network "
"header."
msgstr ""
"As WAAR die IFF_VNET_HDR sal die tonnel pakkies 'n virtio netwer kopskrif "
"insluit."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:338
msgid ""
"A dictionary of key/value pairs with user data. This data is ignored by "
"NetworkManager and can be used at the users discretion. The keys only "
"support a strict ascii format, but the values can be arbitrary UTF8 strings "
"up to a certain length."
msgstr ""
"'n Woordeboek van sleutel/waarde pare met gebruiker data. Hierdie data word "
"deur NetworkManager geïgnoreer en kan na goeddunke van die gebruiker gebruik "
"word. Die sleutels ondersteun slegs 'n streng ascii-formaat, maar die "
"waardes kan arbitrêre UTF8 toutjies tot 'n sekere lengte wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:447
msgid ""
"This property specifies the peer interface name of the veth. This property "
"is mandatory."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie eiendom spesifiseer die eweknie koppelvlak naam van die veth. "
"Hierdie eiendom is verpligtend."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:339
msgid ""
"For outgoing packets, a list of mappings from Linux SKB priorities to 802.1p "
"priorities.  The mapping is given in the format \"from:to\" where both "
"\"from\" and \"to\" are unsigned integers, ie \"7:3\"."
msgstr ""
"Vir uitgaande pakkies, 'n lys van kartering van Linux SKB prioriteite na "
"802.1p prioriteite. Die kartering word gegee in die formaat \"from:to\" waar "
"beide \"from\" en \"to\" ongetekende heelgetalle is, dws \"7:3\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:340
msgid ""
"One or more flags which control the behavior and features of the VLAN "
"interface.  Flags include NM_VLAN_FLAG_REORDER_HEADERS (0x1) (reordering of "
"output packet headers), NM_VLAN_FLAG_GVRP (0x2) (use of the GVRP protocol), "
"and NM_VLAN_FLAG_LOOSE_BINDING (0x4) (loose binding of the interface to its "
"master device's operating state). NM_VLAN_FLAG_MVRP (0x8) (use of the MVRP "
"protocol). The default value of this property is "
"NM_VLAN_FLAG_REORDER_HEADERS, but it used to be 0. To preserve backward "
"compatibility, the default-value in the D-Bus API continues to be 0 and a "
"missing property on D-Bus is still considered as 0."
msgstr ""
"Een of meer vlae wat die gedrag en kenmerke van die VLAN koppelvlak beheer. "
"Vlae sluit in NM_VLAN_FLAG_REORDER_HEADERS (0x1) (herordening van uitset "
"pakkie opskrifte), NM_VLAN_FLAG_GVRP (0x2) (gebruik van die GVRP protokol), "
"en NM_VLAN_FLAG_LOOSE_BINDING (0x4) (los binding van die koppelvlak se "
"werkende toestand aan sy hooftoestel). NM_VLAN_FLAG_MVRP (0x8) (gebruik van "
"die MVRP protokol). Die verstekwaarde van hierdie eiendom is "
"NM_VLAN_FLAG_REORDER_HEADERS, maar dit was vroeër 0. Om terugwaartse "
"versoenbaarheid te behou, bly die verstekwaarde in die D-Bus API steeds 0 en "
"'n ontbrekende eienskap op D-Bus word steeds as 0 beskou."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:341
msgid ""
"The VLAN identifier that the interface created by this connection should be "
"assigned. The valid range is from 0 to 4094, without the reserved id 4095."
msgstr ""
"Die VLAN identifiseerder wat die koppelvlak geskep deur hierdie verbinding "
"moet toegewys word. Die geldige reeks is van 0 tot 4094, sonder die "
"gereserveerde ID 4095."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:342
msgid ""
"For incoming packets, a list of mappings from 802.1p priorities to Linux SKB "
"priorities.  The mapping is given in the format \"from:to\" where both "
"\"from\" and \"to\" are unsigned integers, ie \"7:3\"."
msgstr ""
"Vir inkomende pakkies, 'n lys van koppelings van 802.1p-prioriteite na Linux "
"SKB prioriteite. Die kartering word gegee in die formaat \"from:to\" waar "
"beide \"from\" en \"to\" ongetekende heelgetalle is, dws \"7:3\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:343
msgid ""
"If given, specifies the parent interface name or parent connection UUID from "
"which this VLAN interface should be created.  If this property is not "
"specified, the connection must contain an \"802-3-ethernet\" setting with a "
"\"mac-address\" property."
msgstr ""
"Indien gegee, spesifiseer die ouer-koppelvlaknaam of ouer verbinding UUID "
"waaruit hierdie VLAN koppelvlak geskep moet word. As hierdie eienskap nie "
"gespesifiseer is nie, moet die verbinding 'n \"802-3-ethernet\" instelling "
"met 'n \"mac-adres\" eienskap bevat."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:345
msgid ""
"Dictionary of key/value pairs of VPN plugin specific data.  Both keys and "
"values must be strings."
msgstr ""
"Woordeboek van sleutel/waarde pare VPN inprop spesifieke data. Beide "
"sleutels en waardes moet toutjies wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:346
msgid ""
"If the VPN service supports persistence, and this property is TRUE, the VPN "
"will attempt to stay connected across link changes and outages, until "
"explicitly disconnected."
msgstr ""
"As die VPN diens volharding ondersteun, en hierdie eienskap is WAAR, sal die "
"VPN probeer om verbind te bly oor skakel veranderings en onderbrekings, "
"totdat dit uitdruklik ontkoppel word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:347
msgid ""
"Dictionary of key/value pairs of VPN plugin specific secrets like passwords "
"or private keys.  Both keys and values must be strings."
msgstr ""
"Woordeboek van sleutel-/waardepare VPN inprop spesifieke geheime soos "
"wagwoorde of private sleutels. Beide sleutels en waardes moet toutjies wees."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:348
msgid ""
"D-Bus service name of the VPN plugin that this setting uses to connect to "
"its network.  i.e. org.freedesktop.NetworkManager.vpnc for the vpnc plugin."
msgstr ""
"D-Bus-diensnaam van die VPN inprop wat hierdie instelling gebruik om aan sy "
"netwerk te koppel. d.w.s. org.freedesktop.NetworkManager.vpnc vir die vpnc "
"inprop."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:349
msgid ""
"Timeout for the VPN service to establish the connection. Some services may "
"take quite a long time to connect. Value of 0 means a default timeout, which "
"is 60 seconds (unless overridden by vpn.timeout in configuration file). "
"Values greater than zero mean timeout in seconds."
msgstr ""
"Tyd-uit vir die VPN-diens om die verbinding te bewerkstellig. Sommige "
"dienste kan nogal lank neem om aan te sluit. Waarde van 0 beteken 'n verstek "
"tyd-uit, wat 60 sekondes is (tensy dit deur vpn.timeout in die konfigurasie "
"lêer oorheers word). Waardes groter as nul beteken tyd-uit in sekondes."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:350
msgid ""
"If the VPN connection requires a user name for authentication, that name "
"should be provided here.  If the connection is available to more than one "
"user, and the VPN requires each user to supply a different name, then leave "
"this property empty.  If this property is empty, NetworkManager will "
"automatically supply the username of the user which requested the VPN "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"As die VPN verbinding 'n gebruiker naam vir stawing vereis, moet daardie "
"naam hier verskaf word. As die verbinding vir meer as een gebruiker "
"beskikbaar is en die VPN vereis dat elke gebruiker 'n ander naam verskaf, "
"laat dan hierdie eiendom leeg. As hierdie eiendom leeg is, sal "
"NetwerkBestuurder outomaties die gebruiker naam verskaf van die gebruiker "
"wat die VPN verbinding versoek het."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:351
msgid "The routing table for this VRF."
msgstr "Die roete tabel vir hierdie VRF."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:352
msgid ""
"Specifies the lifetime in seconds of FDB entries learnt by the kernel."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die leeftyd in sekondes van FDB inskrywings wat deur die kern "
"geleer is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:353
msgid ""
"Specifies the UDP destination port to communicate to the remote VXLAN tunnel "
"endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die UDP bestemming poort om met die afgeleë VXLAN tonnel "
"eindpunt te kommunikeer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:354
msgid ""
"Specifies the VXLAN Network Identifier (or VXLAN Segment Identifier) to use."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die VXLAN Netwerk Identifiseerder (of VXLAN Segment "
"Identifiseerder) wat gebruik moet word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:355
msgid "Specifies whether netlink LL ADDR miss notifications are generated."
msgstr "Spesifiseer of netlink LL ADDR mis kennisgewings gegenereer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:356
msgid "Specifies whether netlink IP ADDR miss notifications are generated."
msgstr "Spesifiseer of netlink IP ADDR mis kennisgewings gegenereer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:357
msgid ""
"Specifies whether unknown source link layer addresses and IP addresses are "
"entered into the VXLAN device forwarding database."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer of onbekende bron skakellaag adresse en IP adresse in die VXLAN "
"toestel aanstuur databasis ingevoer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:358
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum number of FDB entries. A value of zero means that the "
"kernel will store unlimited entries."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die maksimum aantal FDB inskrywings. 'n Waarde van nul beteken "
"dat die kern onbeperkte inskrywings sal stoor."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:359
msgid "If given, specifies the source IP address to use in outgoing packets."
msgstr ""
"Indien gegee, spesifiseer die bron IP adres om in uitgaande pakkies te "
"gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:360
msgid ""
"If given, specifies the parent interface name or parent connection UUID."
msgstr ""
"Indien gegee, spesifiseer die ouer koppelvlak naam of ouer verbinding UUID."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:361
msgid "Specifies whether ARP proxy is turned on."
msgstr "Spesifiseer of ARP proxy is aangeskakel op."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:362
msgid ""
"Specifies the unicast destination IP address to use in outgoing packets when "
"the destination link layer address is not known in the VXLAN device "
"forwarding database, or the multicast IP address to join."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die unicast bestemming IP adres om in uitgaande pakkies te "
"gebruik wanneer die bestemming skakellaag adres nie in die VXLAN toestel "
"aanstuur databasis bekend is nie, of die multicast IP adres om aan te sluit."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:363
msgid "Specifies whether route short circuit is turned on."
msgstr "Spesifiseer of roete kortsluiting aangeskakel is."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:364
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum UDP source port to communicate to the remote VXLAN "
"tunnel endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die maksimum UDP bron poort om met die afgeleë VXLAN tonnel "
"eindpunt te kommunikeer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:365
msgid ""
"Specifies the minimum UDP source port to communicate to the remote VXLAN "
"tunnel endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die minimum UDP bron poort om met die afgeleë VXLAN tonnel "
"eindpunt te kommunikeer."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:366
msgid "Specifies the TOS value to use in outgoing packets."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die TOS waarde om in uitgaande pakkies te gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:367
msgid "Specifies the time-to-live value to use in outgoing packets."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die tyd-tot-lewe waarde om in uitgaande pakkies te gebruik."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:368
msgid ""
"The P2P device that should be connected to. Currently, this is the only way "
"to create or join a group."
msgstr ""
"Die P2P toestel waaraan gekoppel moet word. Tans is dit die enigste manier "
"om 'n groep te skep of aan te sluit."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:369
msgid ""
"The Wi-Fi Display (WFD) Information Elements (IEs) to set. Wi-Fi Display "
"requires a protocol specific information element to be set in certain Wi-Fi "
"frames. These can be specified here for the purpose of establishing a "
"connection. This setting is only useful when implementing a Wi-Fi Display "
"client."
msgstr ""
"Die Wi-Fi Vertoon (WFD) Inligting Elemente (IE's) om te stel. Wi-Fi skerm "
"vereis dat 'n protokol spesifieke inligting element in sekere Wi-Fi rame "
"gestel moet word. Dit kan hier gespesifiseer word vir die doel om 'n "
"verbinding te vestig. Hierdie instelling is slegs nuttig wanneer 'n Wi-Fi "
"Vertoon klient geïmplementeer word."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:370
msgid ""
"Flags indicating which mode of WPS is to be used. There's little point in "
"changing the default setting as NetworkManager will automatically determine "
"the best method to use."
msgstr ""
"Vlae wat aandui watter modus van WPS gebruik moet word. Daar is min sin om "
"die verstekinstelling te verander, aangesien NetwerkBestuurder outomaties "
"die beste metode sal bepaal om te gebruik."

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:386
msgid ""
"If specified, this connection will only apply to the WiMAX device whose MAC "
"address matches. This property does not change the MAC address of the device "
"(known as MAC spoofing). Deprecated: 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../clients/common/settings-docs.c.in:388
msgid ""
"Network Service Provider (NSP) name of the WiMAX network this connection "
"should use. Deprecated: 1"
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:388
msgid ""
"The use of fwmark is optional and is by default off. Setting it to 0 "
"disables it. Otherwise, it is a 32-bit fwmark for outgoing packets. Note "
"that \"ip4-auto-default-route\" or \"ip6-auto-default-route\" enabled, "
"implies to automatically choose a fwmark."
msgstr ""
"Die gebruik van fwmark is opsioneel en is by verstek af. As u dit op 0 stel, "
"deaktiveer dit. Andersins is dit 'n 32-bis fwmark vir uitgaande pakkies. Let "
"daarop dat \"ip4-auto-default-route\" of \"ip6-auto-default-route\" "
"geaktiveer, impliseer om outomaties 'n fwmark te kies."

#: ../src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:420
msgid ""
"Whether to enable special handling of the IPv4 default route. If enabled, "
"the IPv4 default route from wireguard.peer-routes will be placed to a "
"dedicated routing-table and two policy routing rules will be added. The "
"fwmark number is also used as routing-table for the default-route, and if "
"fwmark is zero, an unused fwmark/table is chosen automatically. This "
"corresponds to what wg-quick does with Table=auto and what WireGuard calls "
"\"Improved Rule-based Routing\". Note that for this automatism to work, you "
"usually don't want to set ipv4.gateway, because that will result in a "
"conflicting default route. Leaving this at the default will enable this "
"option automatically if ipv4.never-default is not set and there are any "
"peers that use a default-route as allowed-ips."
msgstr ""

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:390
msgid "Like ip4-auto-default-route, but for the IPv6 default route."
msgstr "Soos ip4-outo-verstek-roete, maar vir die IPv6 verstek roete."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:391
msgid ""
"The listen-port. If listen-port is not specified, the port will be chosen "
"randomly when the interface comes up."
msgstr ""
"Die luister-poort. As luisterpoort nie gespesifiseer is nie, sal die poort "
"lukraak gekies word wanneer die koppelvlak verskyn."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:392
msgid ""
"If non-zero, only transmit packets of the specified size or smaller, "
"breaking larger packets up into multiple fragments. If zero a default MTU is "
"used. Note that contrary to wg-quick's MTU setting, this does not take into "
"account the current routes at the time of activation."
msgstr ""
"Indien nie-nul, stuur slegs pakkies van die gespesifiseerde grootte of "
"kleiner, en breek groter pakkies op in veelvuldige fragmente. Indien nul "
"word 'n verstek MTU gebruik. Let daarop dat in contrary om wg-quick se MTU "
"instelling, dit nie die huidige roetes ten tyde van aktivering in ag neem "
"nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:393
msgid ""
"Whether to automatically add routes for the AllowedIPs ranges of the peers. "
"If TRUE (the default), NetworkManager will automatically add routes in the "
"routing tables according to ipv4.route-table and ipv6.route-table. Usually "
"you want this automatism enabled. If FALSE, no such routes are added "
"automatically. In this case, the user may want to configure static routes in "
"ipv4.routes and ipv6.routes, respectively. Note that if the peer's "
"AllowedIPs is \"0.0.0.0/0\" or \"::/0\" and the profile's ipv4.never-default "
"or ipv6.never-default setting is enabled, the peer route for this peer won't "
"be added automatically."
msgstr ""
"Whether om outomaties roetes by te voeg vir die ToegelateIP's reeks van die "
"eweknieë. Indien WAAR (die verstek), NetwerkBestuurder sal voeg outomaties "
"roetes in die roetes tabelle volgens ipv4.route-table en ipv6.route-table. "
"Gewoonlik wil jy hierdie outomatisme geaktiveer hê. Indien ONWAAR, geen "
"sulke roetes word bygevoeg outomaties nie. In hierdie geval, die gebruiker "
"wil dalk statiese roetes konfigureer in ipv4.routes en ipv6.routes, "
"respektiewelike. Let daarop dat as die eweknie se ToegelateIP's is "
"\"0.0.0.0/0\" of \"::/0\" en die profiel se ipv4.never-default of ipv6.never-"
"default instelling geaktiveer is, sal die eweknie roete vir hierdie eweknie "
"nie outomaties bygevoeg word nie."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:394
msgid "The 256 bit private-key in base64 encoding."
msgstr "Die 256-bis privaat-sleutel in base64 kodering."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:395
msgid "Flags indicating how to handle the \"private-key\" property."
msgstr "Vlae wat aandui hoe om die te hanteer \"private-key\" eiendom."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:434
msgid ""
"IEEE 802.15.4 channel. A positive integer or -1, meaning \"do not set, use "
"whatever the device is already set to\"."
msgstr ""
"IEEE 802.15.4 kanaal. 'n Positiewe heelgetal of -1, wat beteken \"do not "
"set, use whatever the device is already set to\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:435
msgid ""
"If specified, this connection will only apply to the IEEE 802.15.4 (WPAN) "
"MAC layer device whose permanent MAC address matches."
msgstr ""
"Indien gespesifiseer, sal hierdie verbinding slegs van toepassing wees op "
"die IEEE 802.15.4 (WPAN) MAC laagtoestel waarvan die permanente MAC adres "
"ooreenstem."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:436
msgid ""
"IEEE 802.15.4 channel page. A positive integer or -1, meaning \"do not set, "
"use whatever the device is already set to\"."
msgstr ""
"IEEE 802.15.4 kanaal bladsy. 'n Positiewe heelgetal of -1, wat beteken \"do "
"not set, use whatever the device is already set to\"."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:437
msgid "IEEE 802.15.4 Personal Area Network (PAN) identifier."
msgstr "IEEE 802.15.4 Persoonlike Gebied Netwerk (PAN) identifiseerder."

#: src/libnmc-setting/settings-docs.h.in:438
msgid ""
"Short IEEE 802.15.4 address to be used within a restricted environment."
msgstr ""
"Kort IEEE 802.15.4 adres om binne 'n beperkte omgewing gebruik te word."

