#: src/nmcli/general.c:315
msgid ""
"Usage: nmcli general status { help }\n"
"\n"
"Show overall status of NetworkManager.\n"
"'status' is the default action, which means 'nmcli gen' calls 'nmcli gen "
"status'\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Gebruikage: nmcli algemeen status { help }\n"
"\n"
"Wys algehele status van NetwerkBestuurder.\n"
"'status' is die verstek aksie, wat beteken 'nmcli gen' calls 'nmcli gen "
"status'\n"
"\n"

#: src/nmcli/general.c:325
msgid ""
"Usage: nmcli general hostname { ARGUMENTS | help }\n"
"\n"
"ARGUMENTS := [<hostname>]\n"
"\n"
"Get or change persistent system hostname.\n"
"With no arguments, this prints currently configured hostname. When you pass\n"
"a hostname, NetworkManager will set it as the new persistent system "
"hostname.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Gebruikage: nmcli algemene gasheernaam { ARGUMENTS | help }\n"
"\n"
"ARGUMENTS := [<hostname>]\n"
"\n"
"Kry of verander aanhoudende stelsel gasheernaam.\n"
"Met geen arguments, hierdie afdruk tans gekonfigureerde gasheernaam. Wanneer "
"jy slaag\n"
"'n gasheernaam, NetwerkBestuurder sal dit stel as die nuwe aanhoudende "
"stelsel gasheernaam.\n"
"\n"

#: src/nmcli/general.c:337
msgid ""
"Usage: nmcli general permissions { help }\n"
"\n"
"Show caller permissions for authenticated operations.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Gebruikage: nmcli algemene toestemmings { help }\n"
"\n"
"Wys beller toestemmings vir gewaarmerk bewerkings.\n"
"\n"

#: src/nmcli/general.c:345
msgid ""
"Usage: nmcli general reload { ARGUMENTS | help }\n"
"\n"
"ARGUMENTS := [<flag>[,<flag>...]]\n"
"\n"
"Reload NetworkManager's configuration and perform certain updates, like\n"
"flushing caches or rewriting external state to disk. This is similar to\n"
"sending SIGHUP to NetworkManager but it allows for more fine-grained\n"
"control over what to reload through the flags argument. It also allows\n"
"non-root access via PolicyKit and contrary to signals it is synchronous.\n"
"\n"
"Available flags are:\n"
"\n"
"  'conf'        Reload the NetworkManager.conf configuration from\n"
"                disk. Note that this does not include connections, which\n"
"                can be reloaded through 'nmcli connection reload' instead.\n"
"\n"
"  'dns-rc'      Update DNS configuration, which usually involves writing\n"
"                /etc/resolv.conf anew. This is equivalent to sending the\n"
"                SIGUSR1 signal to the NetworkManager process.\n"
"\n"
"  'dns-full'    Restart the DNS plugin. This is for example useful when\n"
"                using dnsmasq plugin, which uses additional configuration\n"
"                in /etc/NetworkManager/dnsmasq.d. If you edit those files,\n"
"                you can restart the DNS plugin. This action shortly\n"
"                interrupts name resolution.\n"
"\n"
"With no flags, everything that is supported is reloaded, which is\n"
"identical to sending a SIGHUP.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gebruikage: nmcli algemene herlaai { ARGUMENTS | help }\n"
"\n"
"ARGUMENTS := [<flag>[,<flag>...]]\n"
"\n"
"Herlaai NetwerkBestuurder se konfigurasie en sekere opdaterings uit te voer, "
"soos\n"
"kasgeheue uitspoel of eksterne toestand na skyf herskryf. Hierdie is "
"soortgelyk aan\n"
"stuur SIGHUP tot NetwerkBestuurder maar dit maak voorsiening vir meer "
"fynkorrelige\n"
"beheer oor wat om te herlaai deur die vlae-argument. Dit ook toelaat\n"
"nie-wortel toegang via PolicyKit en in contrary met seine is dit "
"sinchronies.\n"
"\n"
"Beskikbare vlae is:\n"
"\n"
"  'conf'        Herlaai die NetworkManager.conf konfigurasie vanaf\n"
"                skyf. Nota dat hierdie sluit nie konneksies in nie, watter\n"
"                kan herlaai word deur 'nmcli connection reload' in plaas "
"daarvan.\n"
"\n"
"  'dns-rc'      Opdateer DNS konfigurasie, wat gewoonlik skryf behels\n"
"                /etc/resolv.conf anew. Dit is gelykstaande aan die stuur van "
"die\n"
"                SIGUSR1 sein aan die NetwerkBestuurder proses.\n"
"\n"
"  'dns-full'    Herbegin die DNS inprop. Hierdie is vir byvoorbeeld-nuttig "
"wanneer\n"
"                gebruik dnsmasq inprop, wat addisionele konfigurasie "
"gebruik\n"
"                in /etc/NetworkManager/dnsmasq.d. Indien jy wysig daardie "
"lêers,\n"
"                jy kan die DNS inprop herbegin. Hierdie aksie binnekort\n"
"                onderbreek naam resolusie.\n"
"\n"
"Met geen vlae nie, word alles wat ondersteun word herlaai, wat is\n"
"identies aan die stuur van 'n SIGHUP.\n"

#: src/nmcli/general.c:379
msgid ""
"Usage: nmcli general logging { ARGUMENTS | help }\n"
"\n"
"ARGUMENTS := [level <log level>] [domains <log domains>]\n"
"\n"
"Get or change NetworkManager logging level and domains.\n"
"Without any argument current logging level and domains are shown. In order "
"to\n"
"change logging state, provide level and/or domain. Please refer to the man "
"page\n"
"for the list of possible logging domains.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Gebruikage: nmcli algemene logging { ARGUMENTS | help }\n"
"\n"
"ARGUMENTS := [level <log level>] [domains <log domains>]\n"
"\n"
"Kry of verander NetwerkBestuurder logging vlak en domeine.\n"
